<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="GEN" style="id">Baebu Thyaa</book>
  <para style="h">GENESIS</para>
  <para style="toc1">Genesis</para>
  <para style="toc2">GENESIS</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gen</para>
  <para style="mt1">GENESIS</para>
  <para style="mt2">Genesis</para>
  <para style="imt">Byalaanmaw</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Genesis</char> (Zenesis) cipaw asuilan tuh “Athonaw” cipaw nynh thua. E ccauh nynh vaaw te lae raenaw, ccungccaw thokeinaw, laephi vawlan seinaw te teingnaw athonaw kong te Pachia nynh ccungccaw a ccuepenaw kong kha a ho. <char style="bk">Genesis</char> hynh phuin ning lang phia kho athua:</para>
  <para style="ip">1. Byaria 1-11 lungkhu kya laephi raenaw kong te masaty ccungccaw phungpaw a um. E kyahin Adam te Evi kong, Kain te Abel kong, Noah te tuipayn kong te Babilon Innhangpaw kong a um.</para>
  <para style="ip">2. Byaria 12-50 lungkhu kya masaty Israel hae mih minpaaw hae thokeinaw phungpaw a um. Masaty tuh Abraham thua zah aning tuh Pachia a zynnaw te a doliakunaw kya a minthaanpaw nynh thua. Abraham koute a ccapaw Isak kong, a mintaw Jakob (Israel cite mah ko athuapaw) kong, Israel phin haw lae ning hae mih paaw hae athua hae paw Jakob ccapaw hae lu haw lae ning kong kha a um. Jakob ccapaw hae laku e Josef kong kha abyapi lan um zah, Jakob te ccangpaw a ccapaw hae kha mih innbyn hae ryte Izip ram lang a cciakhae hae paw kong kha a um (byaria 12-50).</para>
  <para style="ip">E ccauh nynh ccungccaw hae kong kha ho salamah a paccyn huaccepaw tuh Pachia nynh rya a lawpaw kong kha nynh thua. Pachia nynh atyn-are a raenaw kong kyate tho zah, Pachia nynh a ccungccaw hae kha zungzae a oihsah cih hae cipaw byakinpyakunaw khate athang. E ccauh athonaw te athangnaw cia abyapi huapaw tuh Pachia nynh thua; hoyleinaw a raetu hae kha byapia hae zah de a tahnaw hae kong, a ccungccaw hae kha cciakhae hae zah a bawmnaw hae kong te mih phungpaw a raenaw zia kha a langsah. Minphuin phuin kheit zynnaw phungpaw te tuh-e zynnaw tuh a hiinthya nawlan bawm khylan hynh-e ccauh rynpaw hynh zei athua.</para>
  <para style="iot">Abyalupi hae</para>
  <para style="io1">Vaaw te lae te ccungccaw raenaw 1.1—2.25</para>
  <para style="io1">Seinaw te teingnaw athonaw 3.1-24</para>
  <para style="io1">Adam kyate Noah kyacia 4.1—5.32</para>
  <para style="io1">Noah te tuipayn 6.1—10.32</para>
  <para style="io1">Babel Innhangpaw 11.1-9</para>
  <para style="io1">Shem kyate Abram kyacia 11.10-32</para>
  <para style="io1">Thokeinaw paaw hae: Abraham, Isak, Jakob 12.1—35.29</para>
  <para style="io1">Esau ciihan hae 36.1-43</para>
  <para style="io1">Josef te a uno hae 37.1—45.28</para>
  <para style="io1">Israel hae Izip ram kya 46.1—50.26</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Raenaw Kong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Athotakaw kya Pachia nynh vaaw te lae kha a rae, <verse number="2" style="v" />laephi tuh muinsan a hoi leipaw accakaepaw nynh thua, akhupaw rilipi kha mohnaw nynh phang a bong, te Pachia muisaw<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pachia kyate khisan, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cite khyhze </char><char style="fq" closed="false">athawsaepaw khisan </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cite mah leihku kho athua.</char></note> tuh tui luki khe a pae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Oute Pachia nynh, “Awnaw um sah,” ci zah awnaw tuh a um.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 4:6">2Ko 4.6</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Pachia nynh awnaw tuh ahoy cite a muih; te awnaw kha mohnaw kyate a phia. <verse number="5" style="v" />Pachia nynh awnaw kha Khuadae, mohnaw kha Khuazi cite min a phu. Zete thang zah awkhua yn thua—tuh-e tuh nin kheitnaw nin nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Te Pachia nynh, “Tui angaelung khe myarya kopaw adawkuhpaw ccangkheit um sah, tuh-e nynh tui te tui kha phia hae sah,” a ci. <verse number="7" style="v" />Te Pachia nynh myarya kopaw adawkuhpaw kha rae zah, tuh-e luki umpaw tui te tuh-e kaw lang umpaw tui kha a phia hae thyhte a um vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.6-8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 3:5">2Pe 3.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Te Pachia nynh myarya kopaw adawkuhpaw tuh Vaawlui cite min a phu. Zete thang zah awkhua yn thua—tuh-e tuh nin ningnaw nin nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pachia nynh, “Vaawlui zakaw umpaw tui hynh san kheit kya pynkheihlan sueluakuh sah, aroupaw laelung kha langkuh sah,” cite kaw a pya thyhte acyihkuh vae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Pachia nynh aroupaw laelung kha Laephi cite minphu zah, pynkheihlan sueluakuhpaw tui kha Rili cite min a phu. Te Pachia nynh tuh-e tuh ahoy cite a muih. <verse number="11" style="v" />Oute Pachia nynh, “Laephi vawlan hin thingku-ruaku aphuinphuin po sah: acii-amung umpaw aku hae, te laephi vawlan athae lungkhu amung umpaw thingku aphuinphuin po sah,” cite kaw a pya thyhte a cyihkuh vae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tetuh laephi nynh thingku-ruaku aphuinphuin kha a posah vae: acii-amung umpaw aku phuin miakaw, te athae lungkhu amung umpaw thingku phuin miakaw kya-e thingku hae tuh a po vae hae. Pachia nynh tuh-e tuh ahoy cite a muih. <verse number="13" style="v" />Zete thang zah awkhua yn thua—tuh-e tuh nin thumnaw nin nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Te Pachia nynh, “Khuazi te khuadae kha phia khylan adawkuhpaw vaawlui kya awnaw um sah; tuh-e awnaw tuh muihsahnaw hae, nin hae, kum hae te kumvaelori kha khya khylan thua sah. <verse number="15" style="v" />Laephi vawlan awnaw pya khylan adawkuhpaw vaawlui kya awnaw um sah,” cite kaw a pya thyhte a cyihkuh vae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Te Pachia nynh myarya lepaw awnaw ccangning kha a rae, khuadae uktu lang khuanin kha rae zah, khuazi uktu lang sawpaw kha a rae, te awsi hae kha mah a rae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Pachia nynh laephi vawlan awnaw pya khylan, <verse number="18" style="v" />khuadae te khuazi kha uk khylan, te awnaw te mohnaw kha phia khylan tuh-e a aw hae paw kha adawkuhpaw vaawlui kyakhe a nung. Te Pachia nynh tuh-e tuh ahoy cite a muih. <verse number="19" style="v" />Zete thang zah awkhua yn thua—tuh-e tuh nin palinaw nin nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Te Pachia nynh, “Tui kya ahiinpaw ahysuepaw aphuinphuin kha tui nynh pousah sah, te pavaw hae nynh laephi luki adawkuhpaw vaawlui khe zou bungthung hae sah,” a ci. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuhcite rili lungkhu umpaw myarya lepaw ngasawpi hae te tui kya piathya zah ahiinpaw ahysuepaw aphuinphuin, te azouthyapaw pavaw aphuinphuin kha Pachia nynh a rae. Te Pachia nynh tuh-e tuh ahoy cite a muih. <verse number="22" style="v" />Pachia nynh minmin kha, “Pungzae oh, lungthung oh lah rili tui kya phe beih oh, pavaw hae nynh laephi vawlan lungthung hae sah,” cite hythua a pya hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Zete thang zah awkhua yn thua—tuh-e tuh nin pangawnaw nin nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Te Pachia nynh, “Laephi nynh ahiinpaw ahysuepaw aphuinphuin: sahiin aphuinphuin te loramsaw aphuinphuin te avawpaw aphuinphuin kha pousah sah,” cite kaw a pya thyhte a cyihkuh vae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Pachia nynh laephi vawlan umpaw loramsaw aphuinphuin, te sahiin aphuinphuin, te laephi vawlan avawpaw atyn-are kha a rae. Te Pachia nynh tuh-e tuh ahoy cite a muih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Oute Pachia nynh, “Ahmaw muinsan hawte, ahmaw oun lo lante ccungccaw kha rae oh sih; minmin nynh tui kya-e ngasaw hae thuasah, vaawlang e pavaw hae thuasah, sahiin hae thuasah, laephi kya-e loramsaw balyn thuasah, te laephi vawlan avawpaw miakaw thuasah uk hae sah,” cite kaw a pya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 11:7">1Ko 11.7</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuhcite Pachia nynh, ccungccaw<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.27 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ccungccaw </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw hynh Hebru bya te </char><char style="fq" closed="false">adam </char><char style="ft" closed="false">a ci hae.</char></note> kha</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw muinsan alo lante a rae,</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin kha Pachia muinsan alo lante a rae hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">aning nynh pise te nopi kha a rae hae.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pachia nynh minmin kha, “Pungzae oh lah lungthung oh, laephi kha phe beih oh lah laephi kha uk oh; te tui kya-e ngasaw hae, vaawlang e pavaw hae te laephi vawlan hiin zah apiathyapaw miakaw kha uk oh,” cite hythua a pya hae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Pachia nynh, “Laephi vawlan balyn umpaw acii-amung hoipaw aku miakaw te athae lungkhu amung umpaw thingku miakaw kha kae pya vae oh; nanning nynh tuh-e hae tuh na ae cih oh. <verse number="30" style="v" />Te laephi kya-e ramsaw miakaw, vaawlang e pavaw miakaw, laephi vawlan avawpaw atyn-are, hiinnaw hy a hoipaw atyn-are hanlan hinlalyhpaw aku miakaw kha ae lan ka pya vae hae,” cite kaw a pya thyhte acyihkuh vae. <verse number="31" style="v" />Pachia nynh a raepaw atyn-are kha myarya ahoy ccaccing cite a muih. Te zete thang zah awkhua yn thua—tuh-e tuh nin taruhnaw nin nynh thua.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuhcite vaaw te lae te tuh-e hae kya umpaw atyn-are kha rae kou athua vae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Te nin sarinaw nin khe Pachia nynh a lawpaw a ryalaw kha a thangsah, te a lawpaw a ryalaw balyn kyate nin sarinaw khe a haeung.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.2-3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:11">Exo 20.11</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Pachia nynh nin sarinaw nin kha hythuapya zah taekhia lante a thyaasah, pawccecize tuh-e nin khe Pachia nynh a raepaw raenaw balyn kha thangsah zah a haeung.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hynh-e hae tuh Pachia nynh vaaw te lae a raenaw konglang nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ccangpaw Raenaw Kong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia nynh vaaw te lae kha a rae nin khe, <verse number="5" style="v" />laephi kya ramkaw e aku mah um loh khyh zah ccoukupaw aku mah um loh khyh, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia nynh laephi vawlan khuaarawsah loh khyh, te laephi vawlan looh ccoukupaw rya a lahtu mah um loh khyh; <verse number="6" style="v" />thuasalama tui tuh laephi kyate pou zah laephi balyn kha a ciasah. <verse number="7" style="v" />Oute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia nynh laephi kya-e laenoi khate ccungccapaw kha a rae, hiinnaw hy kha a naduh lungkhu lang a sawnua; te ccungccapaw tuh ahiinpaw ahysuepaw lang yn tang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:45">1Ko 15.45</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia nynh nithua langkhe Eden kya khokhu ccangkheit a rae; te a raepaw ccungccapaw kha tuin kya a umsah. <verse number="9" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia nynh do ry umpaw te ae lan ahoypaw thingku miakaw kha laephi kyate a posah, khokhu ngaelung khe hiinnaw thingku kha mah a posah, te athya ahoy nynawpaw thingku mah a posah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 2:7">Bya 2.7</ref>, <ref loc="REV 22:2">22.2</ref>, <ref loc="REV 22:14">14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khokhu kha tui bu khylan Eden kyate vaw vakheit pou zah a lua, tuh-e vaw tuh tuin kyate vaw pali lang a phiakuh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Ccangkheitnaw vaw min tuh Pishon acikuh; tuh-e vaw tuh Havilah ram balyn po lekuh lan lua zah tuh-e kyatuin sui a pou; <verse number="12" style="v" />te tuh-e laelung kya-e sui tuh ahoy; amynkhuhpaw badelah thingphi te oniks lung mah a um. <verse number="13" style="v" />Ccangningnaw vaw min tuh Gihon acikuh; tuh-e vaw tuh Kush ram balyn po lekuh lan a lua. <verse number="14" style="v" />Ccangthumnaw vaw a min tuh Tigris acikuh, tuh-e vaw tuh Assiria ram nithua lang aluapaw nynh thua. Te ccangpalinaw vaw tuh Zufrates acikuh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia nynh ccungccapaw kha lah zah Eden khokhu kya ryalaw khylan te do-oih khylan tuin kya a nung. <verse number="16" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia nynh ccungccapaw kha, “Nang nynh khokhu kya umpaw thingku miakaw kya-e athae hae hynh rythyte na ae cih; <verse number="17" style="v" />thuasalama athya ahoy nynawpaw thingku kya-e athae hynh tuh na ae lan khyh, hynh-e thingthae hynh na ae lanze, na ae nin khe nang tuh na chih cih,” cite kaw a pya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Oute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia nynh, “Ccungccapaw hynh amaw makhaete um lan hoy khyh; amaw hanlan angaekuhpaw bawmtu lu kheit ka raepah cih,” a ci. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tukeiccuze laephi kya-e sarangpaw miakaw te vaawlang e pavaw miakaw kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia nynh laephi khate a rae, tuh-e hae tuh ccungccapaw nynh muih zah min a phu ccaw cite amaw kalan a cciakhae hae, ccungccapaw nynh ahiinpaw ahysuepaw miakaw kha min a phu thyhte min ccarou a hoi hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Ccungccapaw nynh sahiin balyn, vaawlang e pavaw hae, te sarangpaw miakaw kha min a phu hae; thuasalama ccungccapaw hanlan angaekuhpaw bawmtu ccangkheit sanmah muih khyh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia nynh ccungccapaw kha thuhbabi lan a isah; oute Pachia nynh a naru ccangkheit kha lah zah, tuh-e a lawnaw kyakhe ngesaw khate a pingsah. <verse number="22" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia nynh ccungccapaw kyate a lawpaw naru khate ccungccanung kha rae zah ccungccapaw kalan a cciakhae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Oute ccungccapaw nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Hynh-e hynh ka ru kya-e ru thua zah</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ngesaw kya-e ngesaw nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">Ccungccapaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">lawpaw athua keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">hynh-e hynh Ccungccanung cite</para>
  <para style="q2">ko athua cih,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tukeiccuze pisepaw nynh a nung te a paaw kha cciataw zah a zu te a umkheih hae, te minmin tuh pyn pynkheit lang a tang hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:5">Mat 19.5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:7-8">Mar 10.7-8</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 6:16">1Ko 6.16</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:31">Efe 5.31</ref></char></note> <verse number="25" style="v" />Te pisepaw te a zu tuh mih ccakaete um hae zah mih maethah khyh.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Seinaw Kong</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ROM 5:12-21">Rom 5.12-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia nynh a raepaw ccangpaw sarangpaw hae laeze hupaw tuh a thyaruh huapaw nynh thua. Hupaw nynh nopinung kha, “Pachia nynh, ‘Khokhu kya umpaw pawpaw thingthae mah na ae lan khyh oh,’ a ci ccaccing tou?” cite a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:9">Bya 12.9</ref>, <ref loc="REV 20:2">20.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Te nopinung nynh hupaw kha, “Khokhu kya umpaw thingthae hae kha kae ae kho; <verse number="3" style="v" />thuasalama Pachia nynh, ‘Khokhu angaelung umpaw thingku kya-e thingthae tuh na ae lan khyh oh, tuhpiaze na ty lan khyh oh, tuhkhyhze tuh na chih cih oh,’ a ci,” cite a cipya. <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuasalama hupaw nynh nopinung kha, “Na chih lan khyh oh; <verse number="5" style="v" />pawccecize tuh-e thingthae kha na ae oh zetuh nae mit a aw cih, athya ahoy kha na nyh cih oh zah Amaw na lo lan oh paw kha Pachia nynh a ny,” a cipya. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze tuh-e thingku a thae tuh ae lan ahoy, duaa lan a um, te hawnaw mue nawlan ry lan umpaw thingku athuapaw kha nopinung nynh he a muih tuh, athae kha lokuh zah a ae, thingthae abang kha a vawpaw kalan pyabua zah a vawpaw nynh mah a ae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Oute parouhte mih mit tuh phae aw zah mih ccakaete a um hae paw kha a nyku hae; te minmin nynh eboh anaw hae kha biakuh hae zah cce kya khawkupaw uccaw lang a raeku hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Zetesang khe minmin nynh khokhu kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia a cciapaw roi kha a thae hae, te pisepaw te a zu tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia muihnaw kyate khokhu kya-e thingku hae laku khe a rekuh hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia nynh pisepaw kha ko zah, “Teimou na um?” a ci. <verse number="10" style="v" />Pisepaw nynh, “Khokhu kya na roi kha ka thae, te ka ccakaete ka um keiccuze ka rih zah ka rekuh,” a cipya. <verse number="11" style="v" />Pachia nynh, “Na ccakaete na um cipaw hummou ae hopah? Na ae lan khyh cite kaw kae pyapaw thingthae kha phe na ae vae tou?” cite a khia. <verse number="12" style="v" />Pisepaw nynh, “Kae te umkheih lan nae pyapaw nopinung nynh thingthae kha yn pya zah ka ae,” a cipya. <verse number="13" style="v" />Oute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia nynh nopinung kha, “Pawcce hynhte na la cyi?” a ci. Te nopinung nynh, “Hupaw nynh yn ling zah ka ae,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:3">2Ko 11.3</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 2:14">1Ti 2.14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia nynh hupaw kha,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Nang nynh hynh-e hynh na cyi keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">sarangpaw hae balyn te</para>
  <para style="q1">ramkaw e ahysuepaw balyn laku</para>
  <para style="q2">thyalaw na thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">na vue te na vaw cih zah</para>
  <para style="q2">na hiin lungkhu balyn</para>
  <para style="q2">laenoi kha na ae cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang te nopinung laku thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">na ciihan te a ciihan laku thuasah</para>
  <para style="q1">rawsekunaw ka nung cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">aning nynh na lu kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ae tude cih zah</para>
  <para style="q2">nang nynh a ccukhung kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na tuh cih,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nopinung kha, “Na teing lanpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">ccaawpoinaw kya-e teingnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya ka lesah cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">ccinaw teingte ccaaw na saah cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama na vawpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">na ry ngaethae cih zah</para>
  <para style="q2">aning nynh nang kha ae uk cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Te pisepaw kha,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Na zu bya kha na ngae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">‘Khah-e thingthae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na ae lan khyh,’ cite</para>
  <para style="q1">kaw kae pyapaw kha na ae keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi hynh nang keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">thyalaw athua;</para>
  <para style="q1">na hiin lungkhu balyn laephi kya-e kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thawbangte ryalawkute na ae cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />laephi nynh na hanlan hinpaw ku</para>
  <para style="q2">aphuinphuin kha a posah cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">te loo kya-e athae te anaw kha na ae cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.17-18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 6:8">Heb 6.8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Laephi kalan na kithui makhia</para>
  <para style="q2">na mae kyate na vaesaw a pou lante</para>
  <para style="q1">looh kha na ae cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize laephi kyate rae na thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">nang tuh laenoi na thua zah</para>
  <para style="q2">laenoi kalan na kithui cih,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pisepaw nynh a zu kha Evi cite min a phu, pawccecize aning tuh ccungccaw balyn hae nung nynh thua. <verse number="21" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia nynh pisepaw te a zu hanlan saphua uccaw kha raepah hae zah a lawsaku hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Adam te Evi A Dee hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Oute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia nynh, “Pisepaw tuh aening kya-e lukhakheit hawte thua vae zah athya ahoy kha a ny vae; te aning nynh zungzae hiinnaw mue khylan a kuih kha a dyng cih zah hiinnaw thingku kya-e athae kha mah lokute a aesei cih,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:14">Bya 22.14</ref></char></note> <verse number="23" style="v" />Tukeiccuze pisepaw tuh amaw yn thuanaw laephi kya ryalaw khylan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia nynh Eden khokhu kyate a pousah. <verse number="24" style="v" />Pachia nynh pisepaw kha dee zah hiinnaw thingku kalan cceihpaw laanpi kha khynsah khylan Eden khokhu nithua langkhe teitei lang balyn amiakuh khopaw maee thaloi te cherubim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">cherubim </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw tuh a sake saepaw sarangpaw phuin kheit, vaawccungccaw alopaw nynh thua.</char></note> hae kha a nung hae.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Kain nynh Abel A Chia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te Adam nynh a zu Evi te ihkheih hae zah Evi tuh ccaaw a poi, te Kain kha saah zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bawmnaw liate ccapise lu kheit ka saah,” a ci. <verse number="2" style="v" />Tukoute a neitaw Abel kha a saah. Abel tuh tuurinpaw thua zah Kain tuh loophopaw nynh thua. <verse number="3" style="v" />Accyh yn zaw tuh Kain nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> pya khylan loo kya-e athae kha yn ccyng, <verse number="4" style="v" />te Abel nynh a tuuphu kyate masaty a than hae paw kya-e athopaw kha a pya. Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Abel te a pyapaw a uccaw kha a ccoupya,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:4">Heb 11.4</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />thuasalama Kain te a pyapaw a uccaw kha ccoupah khyh. Tukeiccuze Kain tuh myarya a thinria zah a mitmae hoy khyh. <verse number="6" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Kain kha, “Pawcce na thinria, pawcce na mitmae hoy khyh? <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahoypaw kha na rae lanze ccoupya leite um na thua cih zawtou? Te ahoypaw kha na rae khyh lanze seinaw nynh thuakaw kya phang ae buh, seinaw nynh nang kha uk lan ae ry, thuasalama nang nynh seinaw kha na tae lanpaw nynh thua,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kain nynh a neitaw Abel kha, “Loo lang cceih sih,” a cipya. Te loo kya a um lya hae khe Kain nynh a neitaw Abel kha rawse zah a chia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:35">Mat 23.35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:51">Luk 11.51</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:12">1Jo 3.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Oute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Kain kha, “Na neitaw Abel teimou um?” a ci. Kain nynh, “Ka nyh khyh; kae tuh ka neitaw rintu ka thua zawtou?” a ci. <verse number="10" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Pawmou phe na rae vae? Ngaetua; na neitaw chii nynh laephi kyate kamaw kalan palei a sia!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:24">Heb 12.24</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Na kuih te na chiapaw na neitaw chii kha zu khylan a khalang a awpaw laephi kyate nang tuh atu thyalaw na thua vae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Laephi kya rya na law ze pawsang mah ae poupah lan khyh; nang tuh laephi kya a ccuepaw te a khiavuikuhpaw na thua cih,” a ci. <verse number="13" style="v" />Kain nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha, “Nae pyapaw detahnaw tuh ka ngaesang khonaw laeze alehua! <verse number="14" style="v" />Kae kha laephi kyate atunin nae dee vae zah na mae kha kae muih vae lan khyh; laephi kya a ccuepaw te a khiavuikuhpaw ka thua vae cih, yn muihpaw lukhakheit nynh kae kha yn theih vae cih,” a cipya. <verse number="15" style="v" />Oute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Kain kha, “Tuhte thua khyh! Kain a theihpaw tuh humhung zemah liarunaw leit sari a ing cih,” a ci. Te Kain a muihpaw lukhakheit nynh Kain kha a chia khyh nawlan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Kain kyakhe syntawnaw ccangkheit a rae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Oute Kain tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> umnaw kyate po pou zah Eden nithua lang umpaw Nod<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nod </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw tuh </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Khiavuikunaw </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw nynh thua.</char></note> ram kya khua a sah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kain tuh a zu te a ihkheih hae, te a zu nynh ccaawpoi zah Enok kha a saah; khuapi khuakheit rae zah a min tuh a ccapaw Enok min kha lee zah Enok cite min a phu. <verse number="18" style="v" />Enok nynh Irad kha a saah; te Irad tuh Mehujael a paaw, Mehujael tuh Methusael a paaw, Methusael tuh Lamek a paaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lamek nynh zu lu ning a hoi; lu kheit min tuh Adah cikuh zah ccangpaw lu kheit min tuh Zillah a cikuh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Adah nynh Jabal kha a saah; Jabal tuh bu kya um hae paw te sahiin a kua hae paw mih minpaaw nynh thua. <verse number="21" style="v" />Jabal a neitaw min tuh Jubal nynh thua; aning tuh tintang a khuathya hae paw te phyly a tuthya hae paw mih minpaaw nynh thua. <verse number="22" style="v" />Zillah nynh Tubal-kain kha a saah, aning tuh sohin te sivawhaelua aphuinphuin a raethyapaw nynh thua. Tubal-kain a ccianung tuh Naamah nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lamek nynh a zu hae kha:</para>
  <para style="q1">“Adah te Zillah, ka roi hynh thaetua oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">Lamek zu hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka hopaw bya hynh ngaetua oh:</para>
  <para style="q1">Vaemaw yn muihsahpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccapaw lu kheit kha phe ka chia,</para>
  <para style="q1">kae yn buapaw ccangvae</para>
  <para style="q2">lu kheit kha phe ka chia.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kain a theihpaw kha leih sari te</para>
  <para style="q2">liaru athua lanze Lamek a theihpaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">sung sari leit sari te liaru athua cih,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:22">Mat 18.22</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Te Adam nynh a zu te bua a ihkheih hae, te aning nynh ccapaw lu kheit saah zah Seth cite min a phu, pawccecize aning nynh, “Kain nynh a chiapaw Abel ccelang ccangpaw ccapaw kha Pachia nynh yn khangpya vae,” a ci. <verse number="26" style="v" />Seth nynh ccapaw lu kheit saah zah Enosh cite min a phu. Tuh-e ccyh lya ccungccaw hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min kha mangte a beik takaw hae.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Adam Ciihan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:1-4">1Sh 1.1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hynh-e hynh Adam ciihan ccazing nynh thua. Pachia nynh ccungccaw kha he a rae tuh minmin kha amaw te a lokuh lante a rae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.1-2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:27-28">Gen 1.27-28</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Pise te nopi kha a rae, te hythuapya hae zah minmin a rae nin hae khe “Ccungccaw” cite min a phu hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:4">Mat 19.4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:6">Mar 10.6</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Adam tuh kum za kheit sung thum he cih tuh amaw muinsan te a lokuh lante ccapaw lu kheit saah zah Seth cite min a phu. <verse number="4" style="v" />Seth a pui koute Adam tuh kum za tarya hiin zah ccangpaw ccapaw hae te ccanung hae kha mah a saah hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Adam tuh kum za takua sung thum acih te a chih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Seth nynh za kheit kum pangaw acih te Enosh kha a saah. <verse number="7" style="v" />Enosh a pui koute Seth tuh kum za tarya kum sari hiin zah ccangpaw ccapaw hae te ccanung hae kha mah a saah hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Seth tuh za takua kum haw lae ning acih te a chih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Enosh nynh kum sung takua acih te Kenan kha a saah. <verse number="10" style="v" />Kenan a pui koute Enosh tuh za tarya kum haw lae pangaw hiin zah ccangpaw ccapaw hae te ccanung hae mah a saah hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Enosh tuh za takua kum pangaw acih te a chih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kenan nynh kum sung sari acih te Mahalalel kha a saah. <verse number="13" style="v" />Mahalalel a pui koute Kenan tuh kum za tarya sung pali hiin zah ccangpaw ccapaw hae te ccanung hae kha mah a saah hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Kenan tuh za takua kum haw acih te a chih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mahalalel tuh sung taruh kum pangaw acih te Jared kha a saah. <verse number="16" style="v" />Jared a pui koute Mahalalel tuh kum za tarya sung thum hiin zah ccangpaw ccapaw hae te ccanung hae mah a saah hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Mahalalel tuh za tarya sung takua kum pangaw acih te a chih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jared tuh za kheit sung taruh kum ning acih te Enok kha a saah. <verse number="19" style="v" />Enok a pui koute Jared tuh kum za tarya hiin zah ccangpaw ccapaw hae te ccanung hae kha mah a saah hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Jared tuh za takua sung taruh kum ning acih te a chih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Enok nynh sung taruh kum pangaw acih te Methuselah kha a saah. <verse number="22" style="v" />Methuselah a pui koute Enok tuh kum za thum lungkhu Pachia te a mungkuh hae; te ccangpaw ccapaw hae te ccanung hae kha mah a saah hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Enok tuh za thum sung taruh kum pangaw cia a hiin. <verse number="24" style="v" />Enok tuh Pachia te a cceihkheih hae; te aning tuh um vae khyh, pawccecize Pachia nynh aning kha a law vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:5">Heb 11.5</ref>; <ref loc="JUD 1:14">Jud 14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Methuselah nynh za kheit sung tarya kum sari acih te Lamek kha a saah. <verse number="26" style="v" />Lamek a pui koute Methuselah tuh za sari sung tarya kum ning hiin zah ccangpaw ccapaw hae te ccanung hae mah a saah. <verse number="27" style="v" />Methuselah tuh za takua sung taruh kum takua acih te a chih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lamek nynh za kheit sung tarya kum ning acih te ccapaw lu kheit a saah; <verse number="29" style="v" />Lamek nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh thya a lawpaw laephi kya-e ah ryalaw te ah kuih te lawpaw ryalaw rupaw kyate hynh-e paw nynh thawdangnaw yn pya cih,” cih zah a min tuh Noah cite a phu. <verse number="30" style="v" />Noah a pui koute Lamek tuh za pangaw sung takua kum pangaw hiin zah ccangpaw ccapaw hae te ccanung hae kha mah a saah hae. <verse number="31" style="v" />Lamek tuh za sari sung sari kum sari acih te a chih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Noah tuh kum za pangaw acih te Shem, Ham te Jafeth kha a saah hae.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Ccungccaw Hoyleinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Laephi vawlan ccungccaw hae tuh pungzae hae zah ccanopi hae kha he a saah hae tuh,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.1-4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:6">Job 1.6</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 2:1">2.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Pachia ccapaw hae nynh tuh-e ccanopi hae mih puithyanaw kha a muih hae; a ry hae paw kha pokuh hae zah zu lang a dyku hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Oute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Ka muisaw tuh a chihthyapaw ccungccaw hae kya zungzae um lan ccan khyh, pawccecize minmin tuh ngesaw nynh thua hae; ccungccaw she tuh za kheit kum kuin thua sah,” a ci. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuh-e she kya laephi vawlan mih pyn lepaw Nefilim ccungccaw hae la um hae, tuh-e she koute mah Pachia ccapaw hae nynh ccungccaw ccanung hae te ihkheih hae zah ccaaw a saah hae. Tuh-e ccaaw hae tuh langmawlya mawte rawhoy hae paw te minthaan hae paw nynh thua hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:33">Nam 13.33</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Laephi kya ccungccaw hoyleinaw tuh myarya le zah mih thinlung nynh a tuapaw miakaw kya ahoy leipaw cci nynh zungzae a um cipaw kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a muih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.5-8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:37">Mat 24.37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26">Luk 17.26</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:20">1Pe 3.20</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh laephi vawlan ccungccaw a la raepaw kha a ngaesikuh, te tuh-e a raepaw nynh a thinlung kha myarya a ccisah. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Ka raepaw ccungccaw hae, sarangpaw hae, a vawthya hae paw te vaawlang e pavaw hae kha laephi kyate ka roh cih, pawccecize minmin ka raepaw hynh ka ngaesikuh,” a ci. <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuasalama Noah tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mitmuihnaw kya maehoynaw a mue.</para>
  <para style="s">Noah nynh Pachia Lungrytung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hynh-e hae tuh Noah konglang nynh thua hae. Noah tuh midingpaw, tuh-e she lyaze ccaenaw um leipaw thua zah Pachia ryte a mungkuh hae paw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:5">2Pe 2.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Te Noah nynh ccapaw lu thum a saah, Shem, Ham te Jafeth nynh thua hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Laephi tuh Pachia mitmuihnaw kya ahoy leipaw hiinzia te um zah puathonaw te phe a beih. <verse number="12" style="v" />Te Pachia nynh laephi hynh hoy khyh cite a muih; pawccecize ccungccaw balyn tuh laephi vawlan ahoy leipaw hiinzia te a hiin vae hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Te Pachia nynh Noah kha, “Ccungccaw balyn kha phe maemih lan ka tuaku vae, pawccecize laephi tuh minmin keiccuze puathonaw te nynh phe a bia vae; atu laephi te minmin kha ka roh vae cih. <verse number="14" style="v" />Kawparah thing te sanphalung ccangkheit kha namaw hanlan raekuh; a lungkhu kya akhaan hae kha rae lah sanphalung a lungkhu lang te atolang kha thingphi te pong na thuh cih. <verse number="15" style="v" />Sanphalung kha hynhcite na rae cih: asaepaw dong za thum, akopaw dong sung pangaw te ahangpaw dong sung thum athua cih. <verse number="16" style="v" />Sanphalung avawlan kha na daw cih, tuh-e na dawpaw te pang laku khe dong kheit na uasah cih. Sanphalung akin langkhe thuakaw ccangkheit na rae cih zah akaw khang, angaelung khang te avaw khang cite khang thum lante na sak cih. <verse number="17" style="v" />Vaawlui kaw um zah ahiinpaw ahysuepaw balyn kha ro khylan laephi vawlan tui ka ynsakuh cih. Laephi vawlan umpaw atyn-are a chih cih hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Thuasalama namaw kya tuh ka byakin kha ka tynsah cih; te nang tuh na ccapaw hae, na zu te na ccapaw hae zu hae ryte sanphalung lungkhu lang na tee cih oh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahiinpaw sarangpaw aphuinphuin kya-e nopi te pise bua kheit cci kha na lah cih zah namaw ryte mih hiinnaw kha khynsah khylan sanphalung lungkhu lang na teekhae cih hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Pavaw hae kha mimaw phuin thathyhte, te sarangpaw hae kha mimaw phuin thathyhte, a vawthyapaw miakaw kha amaw phuin thathyhte, a phuin takyh kya-e sa ning cci kha mih hiinnaw khynsah khylan namaw kalan oun tee cih hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Aepaw looh phuin miakaw kha mah namaw ryte na cciakhae cih zah na ccakhung cih; te tuh-e tuh namaw te sarangpaw hae aepaw lang a tang cih,” a ci. <verse number="22" style="v" />Pachia nynh kaw a pya thyhte Noah nynh pong a cyi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:7">Heb 11.7</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Alepaw Tuipayn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Oute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Noah kha, “Nang te na innbyn balyn sanphalung lungkhu lang tee oh, pawccecize hynh-e she kya nang rou nynh ka malang na ding cipaw ka muih. <verse number="2" style="v" />Athyaapaw sarangpaw hae balyn kya-e nopi te pise bua sari cci, te athyaa leipaw sarangpaw hae kya-e nopi te pise bua kheit cci, <verse number="3" style="v" />te vaawlang e pavaw hae nopi te pise bua sari cci kha mah laephi vawlan balyn mih phuin raveihte hiinsah khylan namaw ryte sanphalung lungkhu lang teekhae hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Pawccecize atunin kyate nin sari he aro te, laephi vawlan nin sung pali te zi sung pali khua ka rawsah cih; te ka raepaw ahiinpaw miakaw kha laephi kyate ka roh cih,” a ci. <verse number="5" style="v" />Te Pachia nynh kaw a pyapaw balyn kha Noah nynh pong a cyi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Laephi vawlan tuipayn he a ynku lyakhe Noah tuh kum za taruh acih vae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Te Noah tuh a ccapaw hae, a zu te a ccapaw hae zu hae ryte tuipayn kyate lue khylan sanphalung lungkhu lang a tee hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:38-39">Mat 24.38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:27">Luk 17.27</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Athyaapaw sarangpaw hae, te athyaa leipaw sarangpaw hae, pavaw hae te laephi vawlan avawthya hae paw kya-e, <verse number="9" style="v" />nopi te pise bua kheit cci tuh Pachia nynh Noah kya kaw a pya thyhte Noah ryte sanphalung lungkhu lang a tee hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Te nin sari he aro te, laephi vawlan tuipayn tuh yn yhkuh vae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Noah kum za taruh a ci kum, sawpaw sah ningnaw<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sah ningnaw </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tuh </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ziv </char><char style="ft" closed="false">sawpaw ci hae zah, April te May loukaw nynh thua.</char></note>, nin haw lae sari nin kya, myarya khupaw tuinaw hae balyn tuh phae koi zah vaawlui e thanlan-aw hae tuh oun hungkuh vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 3:6">2Pe 3.6</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Te laephi vawlan nin sung pali te zi sung pali khua a rah. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuh-e nin ccaccei kyatuin Noah te a ccapaw hae, Shem, Ham te Jafeth, te Noah a zu te a ccapaw hae zu lu thum tuh sanphalung lungkhu lang a tee hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Minmin ryte ramsaw phuin miakaw, te sahiin-awvaw phuin miakaw balyn, te laephi vawlan a vawthyapaw miakaw, te pavaw phuin miakaw, sake hoipaw ahysuepaw miakaw mah a teebua hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Hiinnaw hy a hoipaw miakaw kya-e bua kheit cci tuh Noah ryte sanphalung lungkhu lang a tee hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Pachia nynh Noah kha kaw a pya thyhte alungkhu lang a tee hae paw tuh sarangpaw balyn kya-e nopi te pise nynh thua hae; te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Noah kha a lungkhu kya a khawsung vae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuipayn tuh nin sung pali lungkhu laephi vawlan a ynkuh thung; te tui tuh lungthung zah sanphalung kha hangthung zah laephi luki kyacia a hangsah vae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Laephi vawlan tui tuh kaethung zah myarya a lungthung; te sanphalung kha tui vawlan a phaly. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tui tuh laephi vawlan myarya a thawsae lante kaethung zah vaawlui zakaw umpaw ahangpaw mua hae balyn kha pong a vu hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tui tuh mua hae luki cia kaethung zah dong haw lae pangaw akhu lan a vu. <verse number="21" style="v" />Te laephi vawlan apiathyapaw ahysuepaw hae, pavaw hae, sahiin-awvaw hae, ramsaw hae, laephi vawlan avawpaw ahysuepaw balyn, te ccungccaw balyn tuh pong a chih hae; <verse number="22" style="v" />Aroupaw laelung kya umpaw, naduh te hysue zah ahiinpaw atyn-are pong a chih hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Laephi vawlan umpaw ahiinpaw miakaw, ccungccaw hae te sarangpaw hae te a vawthyapaw hae, te vaawlang e pavaw hae kha Pachia nynh marya a ro; minmin kha laephi kyate ro athua hae. Noah amaw te sanphalung kya a umkheih hae paw rou nynh a lae hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Te tui tuh laephi vawlan nin za kheit sung pangaw lungkhu a kaethung.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Tuipayn A Kynaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thuasalama Pachia nynh Noah te sanphalung kya umkheih hae paw sarangpaw balyn te sahiin-awvaw balyn kha ning khyh hae. Te Pachia nynh laephi vawlan khivae zawsah zah tui tuh akybung; <verse number="2" style="v" />myarya khunaw kya umpaw tuinaw hae te vaawlui kya-e thanlan-aw hae kha oun khawkuh zah vaawlui kya-e khuaa tuh akan vae, <verse number="3" style="v" />te tui tuh laephi kyate byabyate akybung. Te nin za kheit sung pangaw aro tuh tui tuh aky vae; <verse number="4" style="v" />te sawpaw sah sarinaw<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sawpaw sah sarinaw </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tuh </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tishri </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ci hae zah, September te October loukaw nynh thua. </char></note>, nin haw lae sari nin kyakhe sanphalung tuh Ararat mua kya a tinkuh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tui tuh sawpaw sah hawnaw<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sawpaw sah hawnaw </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tuh </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tebeth </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ci hae zah, December te January loukaw nynh thua. </char></note>, cia po akybung; sawpaw sah hawnaw, masaty nin kya mua dung hae tuh oun langkuh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nin sung pali aro te Noah nynh a raepaw sanphalung kya-e thanlan-aw kha hung zah, <verse number="7" style="v" />va-aw sa kheit kha a saw; tuh-e va-aw nynh laephi vawlan tui arou makhia a khiakuh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Oute Noah nynh laephi vawlan tui aky vae tah cipaw ny khylan vahu sa kheit kha a saw; <verse number="9" style="v" />thuasalama vahu nynh ccunaw kha muihkuh khyh zah Noah umnaw sanphalung kalan phe a ki, pawccecize laephi vawlan balyn tui a um ung. Tukeiccuze Noah nynh a kuih kha dyngte vahu kha kyng zah amaw umnaw sanphalung lungkhu lang a nung. <verse number="10" style="v" />Noah nynh nin sari a ngaw koute vahu kha sanphalung kyate bua a saw; <verse number="11" style="v" />zete khe vahu tuh Noah kalan yn ki zah a mung te a teipaw hinlalyhpaw oliv naw kha yn thuakhae; tukeiccuze Noah nynh laephi vawlan tui aky vae cipaw a ny. <verse number="12" style="v" />Oute Noah nynh nin sari a ngaw koute vahu kha bua a saw; vahu tuh Noah kalan yn ki vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Noah za taruh kum kheit a ci kum, sawpaw sah kheitnaw<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sawpaw sah kheitnaw </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tuh </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nisan </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ci hae zah, March te April loukaw nynh thua. </char></note>, kyaze masaty nin kyakhe laephi vawlan tui tuh karae aky vae; te Noah nynh sanphalung adawkuhpaw kha phou zah he a do tuh, arou takawpaw laephi kha a muih. <verse number="14" style="v" />Sawpaw sah ningnaw kya nin kuin lae sari nin khe laephi tuh arou vae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Oute Pachia nynh Noah kha, <verse number="16" style="v" />“Namaw ryte na zu, na ccapaw hae te na ccapaw hae zu hae ryte sanphalung kyate pou ccavae oh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Laephi vawlan pungthung khylan te pungzae khylan namaw ryte a um hae paw ahiinpaw miakaw, pavaw hae te sarangpaw hae te laephi vawlan a vawthyapaw miakaw kha namaw ryte poukhae hae,” a cipya. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Noah tuh a zu, a ccapaw hae te a ccapaw hae zu hae ryte a pou hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Te sarangpaw miakaw, avawpaw miakaw, te pavaw miakaw, laephi vawlan apiathyapaw miakaw tuh mimaw phuin thathyhte aphuphute sanphalung kyate a pou vae hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Noah kya Pachia Byakinpyakunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Oute Noah nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanlan silawhang ccangkheit kha rae zah athyaapaw sarangpaw te athyaapaw pavaw phuin takyh kya-e sa kheit cci kha lah zah silawhang vawlan khe maee-ute silawnaw kha a rae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh lungrythuasah paw amynkhuhpaw kha he a thae tuh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Ccungccaw keiccuze laephi hynh mazi thya bua ka law vae lan khyh, pawccecize ccungccaw thinlung tuh a di lya mawte hoy khyh; vaekheit ka la cyi vae hawkhate ahiinpaw ahysuepaw miakaw kha kharouh bua ka roh vae lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Laephi she athang makhia,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccou ccyh te rue ccyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">akyaapaw ccyh te asopaw ccyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">hawnin te khuaccih,</para>
  <para style="q1">khuadae te khuazi,</para>
  <para style="q2">thang boi vae lan khyh,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite a thinlung kya bua a ciku.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Pachia te Noah Byakinkunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pachia nynh Noah te a ccaaw hae kha hythuapya hae zah, “Pungzae oh lah lungthung oh, laephi kya phe beih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:28">Gen 1.28</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Laephi vawlan sarangpaw miakaw, vaawlang e pavaw miakaw, laephi vawlan avawpaw atyn-are, te rili lungkhu e ngasaw balyn nynh nanning kha ae rih cih oh zah a thyngkuh cih hae; minmin kha nae kuih kya pya athua hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahinpaw thingku-ruaku hae kha nanning kae pya oh hawte hiin zah apiathyapaw miakaw tuh nanning hanlan looh athua cih, atyn-are kha nanning kae pya oh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuasalama saw kha achii te na aede lan khyh oh, pawccecize hiinnaw tuh chii kya nynh a um.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 7:26-27">Lev 7.26-27</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 17:10-14">17.10-14</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 19:26">19.26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:16">Deu 12.16</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 12:23">23</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 15:23">15.23</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Pawccecize nae hiinnaw athuapaw nae chii kha kae ngiaru cih oh, sarangpaw balyn kyate tuh-e kha ka ngiaru cih, te ccangpaw lu kheit chii hanlan ka ngiaru cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Humhung zemah ccungccaw</para>
  <para style="q2">lukhakheit chii kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a luasahpaw tuh,</para>
  <para style="q1">lukhakheit nynh a chii kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a luasah ru cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize amaw muinsan alo lante</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia nynh ccungccaw kha a rae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26-27">Gen 1.26-27</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 17:10-14">17.10-14</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:26">Lev 19.26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:16">Deu 12.16</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 12:23">23</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 15:23">15.23</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Te nanning tuh pungzae oh lah lungthung oh, laephi vawlan ccaaw patae saah oh lah pungzae oh,” a cipya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:28">Gen 1.28</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Te Pachia nynh Noah te a ccaaw hae kyakhe, <verse number="9" style="v" />“Nanning te naemaw koute nae ciihan hae kya thuasah, <verse number="10" style="v" />te nanning ryte a um hae paw hiin zah mih hysue hae paw (ahiinpaw ahysuepaw athua hae paw) pavaw hae, sahiin-awvaw hae, ramsaw miakaw—sanphalung kyate a pou hae paw kya thuasah ka byakin kha ka tynsah cih. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuipayn keiccuze ahysuepaw balyn hynh papin buachih vae lan khyh, te laephi ro khylan tuipayn hynh mazi bua ynkuh vae lan khyh, nanning kya ka byakin kha ka tynsah,” a ci. <verse number="12" style="v" />Pachia nynh, “Kamaw te naemaw, nanning ryte a um hae paw ahiinpaw ahysuepaw miakaw laku, malang she balyn hanlan ka raepaw byakin kya-e muihsahnaw tuh hynh-e nynh athua: <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka sawdoih kha maeking kya ka nung vae, tuh-e tuh kamaw te laephi laku byakin muihsahnaw ccangkheit athua cih. <verse number="14" style="v" />Maeking kha laephi luki ka umsah vae ze sawdoih tuh maeking kya a langkuh, <verse number="15" style="v" />Kamaw te naemaw te nanning ryte a um hae paw ahiinpaw ahysuepaw balyn laku a umpaw ka byakin kha ka ning lan khyh zah ahysuepaw balyn kha tuipayn nynh mazi bua roh vae lan khyh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Maeking kya sawdoih a umpaw kha he ka muih vae ze, Pachia te laephi vawlan umpaw ahiinpaw ahysuepaw balyn laku a umpaw zungzae tynpaw byakin kha ka ning lan khyh,” a ci. <verse number="17" style="v" />Pachia nynh Noah kha, “E hynh kamaw te laephi vawlan umpaw ahysuepaw balyn laku ka tynsahpaw byakin muihsahnaw nynh thua,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="s">Noah te A Ccaaw hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sanphalung atolang a pou hae paw Noah ccapaw hae tuh Shem, Ham, te Jafeth nynh thua hae. Ham tuh Kanaan a paaw nynh thua. <verse number="19" style="v" />Hynh-e lu thum tuh Noah ccapaw hae thua zah hynh-e hae kyate laephi pynpi ccungccaw a pazaekuh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Noah tuh loophopaw thua zah misu khokhu masaty a raetupaw nynh thua. <verse number="21" style="v" />te Noah nynh misutui kha neih zah a rui keiccuze a bu kya a ccakaete a ih. <verse number="22" style="v" />Kanaan a paaw Ham nynh a ccakaete umpaw a paaw kha muih zah atolang umpaw a uno hae lu ning kha a hopya hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Te Shem te Jafeth nynh boeining zung kheit kha lah hae zah mih raw kya a khangkuh kou hae te, mih nulangte sihnuakuh hae zah a ccakaete umpaw mih paaw kha a bong hae; mih mae kha ccanglang a hawi keiccu hae ze, mih paaw nynh a ccakaete a umpaw kha muih vae khyh hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Noah nynh misutui a ruinaw kyate a lung yn cci zah he yn thaekuh tuh, a ccasoi nynh a tungvaw a cyipaw kha nyh zah, <verse number="25" style="v" />“Kanaan tungvaw thyalawnaw um sah;</para>
  <para style="q1">a upaw hae see hae kyaze</para>
  <para style="q2">anyaa huapaw see lang tang sah,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tukoute Noah nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Ka Pachia <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">Shem kha hythuapya vae sah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Kanaan tuh Shem see lang tangsah.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pachia nynh Jafeth kha</para>
  <para style="q2">pungzaesah sah lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a ciihan tuh Shem a bu hae kya</para>
  <para style="q2">khuasah hae sah;</para>
  <para style="q1">Kanaan tuh Jafeth see lang</para>
  <para style="q2">tang sah,” cite bua a ho.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuipayn koute Noah tuh kum za thum sung pangaw hiin zah <verse number="29" style="v" />kum za takua sung pangaw acih te a chih.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Noah Ccaaw hae Ciihan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:5-23">1Sh 1.5-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hynh-e hae tuh Noah ccapaw hae Shem, Ham te Jafeth ciihan thua hae zah tuipayn koute a saah hae paw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jafeth ccapaw hae tuh: Gomer, Magog, Madai, Javan, Tubal Meshek te Tiras nynh thua hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Gomer ccapaw hae tuh Ashkenaz, Rifath te Togarmah nynh thua hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Javan ccapaw hae tuh Elishah, Tarshish, Kittim te Rodanim nynh thua hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Hynh-e hae kyate rili kin te tuikoih hae kya umpaw ccungccaw hae lang a pazaekuh hae. Hynh-e hae tuh Jafeth ciihan thua hae zah mih phuin raveihte mih ram kya khuasah hae zah mih bya raveih kha a mang hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ham ccapaw hae tuh Kush, Izip, Put te Kanaan nynh thua hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Kush ccapaw hae tuh Seba, Havilah, Sabtah, Raamah te Sabteka nynh thua hae. Raamah ccapaw hae tuh Sheba te Dedan nynh thua hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Kush nynh a min Nimrod cikuhpaw ccapaw lu kheit kha mah a saah; tuh-e ccapaw tuh laephi vawlan masaty a lesaepaw nynh thua. <verse number="9" style="v" />Aning tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang athawsaepaw sawkawthyapaw nynh thua; tukeiccuze phungtangbya kyaze “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang Nimrod hawte a thawsaepaw sawkawthyapaw” cite a um. <verse number="10" style="v" />Masaty a peenaw tuh Shinar ram umpaw Babilon, Erek te Akkad nynh thua hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuh-e ram kyate Assiria ram lang cceih zah Nineveh khua, Rehoboth Ir khua, Kalah khua, te <verse number="12" style="v" />Resen khua kha a rae hae, Resen khua tuh Nineveh khua te Kalah khua laku umpaw myarya lepaw khualipi nynh thua. <verse number="13" style="v" />Izip tuh Ludi hae, Anam hae, Lehab hae, Naftuh hae, <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathrus hae, Kasluh hae mih paaw nynh thua. Filistin ccungccaw hae tuh Koftor kyate nynh oun thokei hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kanaan tuh a ccatawccaw Sidon te Heth, <verse number="16" style="v" />Jebus hae, Amor hae, Girgash hae, <verse number="17" style="v" />Hiv hae, Arki hae, Sin hae, <verse number="18" style="v" />Arvad hae, Zemari hae te Hamath hae mih paaw nynh thua. Nyalangte Kanaan minphuin hae tuh phiakuh hae zah, <verse number="19" style="v" />Kanaan ramri tuh Sidon kyate Gerar langsang Gaza cia athua, te Sodom, Gomorrah, Admah, Zeboiim langsang Lasha cia athua. <verse number="20" style="v" />Hynh-e hae tuh Ham ciihan nynh thua hae, mih phuin raveihte mih ram raveih kya khuasah hae zah mih bya raveih kha a mang hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jafeth a upaw Shem nynh mah ccaaw hae kha a saah, aning tuh Eber ccungccaw hae balyn mih paaw nynh thua. <verse number="22" style="v" />Shem ccapaw hae tuh Elam, Asshur, Arpakshad, Lud te Aram nynh thua hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Aram ccapaw hae tuh Uz, Hul, Gether te Mash nynh thua hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Arpkshad tuh Shelah paaw thua zah Shelah tuh Eber paaw nynh thua. <verse number="25" style="v" />Eber nynh ccaaw lu ning saah zah lu kheit a min tuh Peleg nynh thua, pawccecize Peleg ccyh lyakhe laephi ccungccaw hae tuh pong la phiakuh hae; Peleg a neitaw min tuh Joktan nynh thua. <verse number="26" style="v" />Joktan tuh Almodad, Shelef, Hazarmaveth, Jerah, <verse number="27" style="v" />Hadoram, Uzal, Diklah, <verse number="28" style="v" />Obal, Abimael, Sheba, <verse number="29" style="v" />Afir, Havilah te Jobab mih paaw nynh thua; hynh-e hae balyn tuh Joktan ccaaw hae nynh thua. <verse number="30" style="v" />Mih umnaw ram tuh Mesha kyate Sefar langsang, nithua lang e mua alungnaw ram kyacia a ko. <verse number="31" style="v" />Hynh-e hae tuh Shem ciihan nynh thua hae, mih phuin raveihte mih ram raveih kya khuasah hae zah mih bya raveih kha a mang hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hynh-e hae tuh mih ram kya mih thokeinaw thyhte Noah ccaaw hae mih ciihan nynh thua; hynh-e hae kyate minphuin hae tuh laephi vawlan tuipayn koute apazaekuh.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Babel Innhangpaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Laephi vawlan ccungccaw balyn tuh bya phuin kheit kyalya la hoi hae zah alokuhpaw bya kha la ho hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Nithua lang te la nuekuh hae zah Shinar ram abialaenaw san kheit kya la thua hae zah tuin kya khua la sah hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Minmin nynh lu kheit te lu kheit hokuh hae zah, “Rang oh, anglae rae oh sih lah maee te hoyte rua oh sih,” a ciku hae. Te lung ccelang anglae kha mang hae zah bede nawlan bitumen kha a mang hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tukoute minmin nynh, “Rang oh, khuapi khua kheit rae oh sih, te adungpaccy te vaawlui phe phahpaw innhangpaw ccangkheit sak oh sih lah ahmaw hanlan minthaannaw rae oh sih; tuhkhyhze tuh laephi pynpi kya pong ah phiakusei cih oh,” a ciku hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Te tuh-e ccungccaw hae nynh a rae hae paw khuapi te innhangpaw kha do khylan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh yn rungbung. <verse number="6" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Minmin tuh minphuin phuin kheit thua hae zah mih balyn te bya phuin kheit nynh a ho hae; te hynh-e hynh a cyi lan hae paw kyaze masaty nynh athua ung; cyi lan cite a tuaku hae paw kha minmin hanlan athua kho leipaw um vae lan khyh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Rang oh, rungbung oh sih lah, lu kheit te lu kheit bya a thaekuh khyh ccaw hae, mih bya kha laesah oh sih,” a ci. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin kha tuin kyate laephi vawlan balyn phiasakuh hae zah khuapi kha rae leite a um vae hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze tuh-e khua min tuh Babel a ci hae, pawccecize tuin kyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh laephi ccungccaw balyn kya-e bya kha laesah zah tuin kyate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh laephi vawlan balyn a phiasakuh hae.</para>
  <para style="s">Shem Ciihan hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:24-27">1Sh 1.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hynh-e hae hynh Shem ciihan nynh thua hae. Tuipayn koute kum ning aro te Shem tuh kum za kheit cih zah ccapaw Arpachshad kha a saah; <verse number="11" style="v" />Arpachshad a pui koute Shem tuh kum za pangaw hiin zah ccangpaw ccapaw hae te ccanung hae mah a saah. <verse number="12" style="v" />Arpachshad nynh sung thum kum pangaw acih te Shelah kha a saah; <verse number="13" style="v" />Shelah a pui koute Arpachshad tuh za pali kum thum hiin zah ccangpaw ccapaw hae te ccanung hae mah a saah. <verse number="14" style="v" />Shelah nynh kum sung thum acih te Eber kha a saah; <verse number="15" style="v" />Eber a pui koute Shelah tuh za pali kum thum hiin zah ccangpaw ccapaw hae te ccanung hae mah a saah. <verse number="16" style="v" />Eber nynh sung thum kum pali acih te Peleg kha a saah; <verse number="17" style="v" />Peleg a pui koute Eber tuh kum za pali sung thum hiin zah ccangpaw ccapaw hae te ccanung hae mah a saah. <verse number="18" style="v" />Peleg nynh kum sung thum acih te Reu kha a saah; <verse number="19" style="v" />Reu a pui koute Peleg tuh za ning kum takua hiin zah ccangpaw ccapaw hae te ccanung hae mah a saah. <verse number="20" style="v" />Reu nynh sung thum kum ning acih te Serug kha a saah; <verse number="21" style="v" />Serug a pui koute Reu tuh za ning kum sari hiin zah ccangpaw ccapaw hae te ccanung hae mah a saah. <verse number="22" style="v" />Serug nynh kum sung thum acih te Nahor kha a saah; <verse number="23" style="v" />Nahor a pui koute Serug tuh kum za ning hiin zah ccangpaw ccapaw hae te ccanung hae mah a saah. <verse number="24" style="v" />Nahor nynh kum kuin lae takua acih te Terah kha a saah; <verse number="25" style="v" />Terah a pui koute Nahor tuh za kheit kum haw lae takua hiin zah ccangpaw ccapaw hae te ccanung hae mah a saah. <verse number="26" style="v" />Terah nynh kum sung sari acih te Abram, Nahor, te Haran kha a saah hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Hynh-e hae tuh Terah ccaaw hae nynh thua hae. Terah nynh Abram, Nahor, te Haran kha a saah hae; te Haran tuh Lot a paaw nynh thua. <verse number="28" style="v" />Haran tuh a puinaw Khaldi ccungccaw hae umnaw Ur khua kyakhe a paaw Terah a chi mawkhe a chih. <verse number="29" style="v" />Abram te Nahor tuh zu a hoi hae; Abram zu min tuh Sarai thua zah Nahor zu tuh Haran ccanung Milkah nynh thua. Haran tuh Milkah te Isakah mih paaw nynh thua. <verse number="30" style="v" />Sarai tuh tiin zah ccaawsaah khyh. <verse number="31" style="v" />Terah tuh a ccapaw Abram, te Haran ccapaw athuapaw a mintawpaw Lot, te a ccapaw Abram zu athuapaw a monung Sarai ryte Khaldi ram Ur khua kyate thokuh hae zah Kanaan ram lang pynkheihlan a cceih hae; thuasalama Haran khua a thua hae te tuin kya khua a sah hae. <verse number="32" style="v" />Terah tuh za ning kum pangaw hiin zah Haran khua khe a chih.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Pachia nynh Abraham A Ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Abram kha, “Na ram, na puizia hae te na paaw inn kyate pou lah, kae muihsah cih paw ram langkhe cciatua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:2-3">Loc 7.2-3</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:8">Heb 11.8</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang kha myarya lepaw minphuin lang kae rae cih, nang tuh hythua ccoupaw na thua nawlan na min kha kae thaansah cih zah hythua kae pya cih. <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang hythua ae pyapaw kha hythua ka pya cih zah nang thya ae lawpaw kha thya ka law cih; te laephi vawlan minphuin balyn tuh namaw liate hythuapya athua cih hae,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:8">Gal 3.8</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopya hawte Abram nynh cceih zah Lot mah amaw kya a cceihbua. Haran kyate Abram a pou lya tuh sung sari kum pangaw acih vae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Abram nynh a zu Sarai, a neitaw ccapaw Lot, a hoi hae paw uccaw balyn, te minmin nynh Haran khua kya a mue hae paw mih see hae ryte Kanaan ram lang cceih hae zah tuh-e ram kya a thua hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Abram tuh tuh-e ram kya po cceih zah Shekhem khua kya umpaw Moreh kya-e phaesi ku kya a thua. Tuh ccyh lya tuh tuh-e ram kya Kanaan ccungccaw hae a um hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Abram kya yn langkuh zah, “E ram hynh na ciihan hae kalan ka pya cih hae,” a ci. Tukeiccuze Abram nynh amaw kya yn langkuhpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanlan tuh-e hmin kya silawhang ccangkheit kha a rae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:5">Loc 7.5</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:16">Gal 3.16</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuin kyate Bethel khua nithua lang umpaw mua alungnaw ram lang nuekuh zah, niccaw lang umpaw Bethel khua te nithua lang umpaw Ai khua laku khe bu kha a sak; te tuin kyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanlan silawhang ccangkheit rae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min kha a ko. <verse number="9" style="v" />Te Abram tuh san kheit koute san kheit cceih zah Negeb pee kya a thua.</para>
  <para style="s">Abram Izip lang A Cceih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuh-e ram kya ccakan yn ccih. Tukeiccuze Abram tuh ramccang ccungccaw lu kheit hawte sohsoh um khylan Izip ram lang a cceihbung, pawccecize tuh-e ram kya ccakan myarya a ccih. <verse number="11" style="v" />Izip ram a teedyn hae khe Abram nynh a zu Sarai kha, “Nang tuh a puithyapaw nopi nynh na thua cipaw phe ka ny; <verse number="12" style="v" />Izip hae nynh nang kha he ae muih hae tuh, ‘E hynh a zu nynh thua,’ ae ci cih hae zah kae kha yn theih cih hae, thuasalama nang kha ae hiin cih hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ‘A ccianung nynh ka thua’ na cipah cih hae zah namaw liate kae kha hoyte yn do-oih cih hae, te namaw liate ka hiinnaw kha yn haang cih hae,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 20:2">Gen 20.2</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 26:7">26.7</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Abram nynh Izip ram he a tee tuh myarya puithyapaw a zu kha Izip hae nynh a muih hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Faro siapharan kya ryalahtu bawi hae nynh a muih hae tuh a puithyanaw kong kha Faro kya a hopya hae. Te nopinung kha Faro inn lang a cciakhae hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Sarai liate Faro nynh Abram kha hoyte a do-oih; te Abram tuh tuu hae, tangnuapaw hae, lanntepaw hae, seenung hae te seepaw hae, lann pinung hae te kalauh hae kha a hoi. <verse number="17" style="v" />Thuasalama Abram zu Sarai keiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Faro te a inn um hae paw kya shethya kha a sawnua hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Faro nynh Abram kha ko zah, “Pawcce ka tungvaw hynh-e hynh na rae? ‘Aning tuh ka zu nynh thua,’ cite pawcce nae hopya khyh? <verse number="19" style="v" />Kae nynh aning kha zu lang ka umkhae ccaw cite pawcce ‘Aning tuh ka ccianung nynh thua,’ cite na ho? Na zu kha atu ko lah cceih oh,” a cipya. <verse number="20" style="v" />Te Faro nynh Abram konglangte a ccungccaw hae kha kaw a pya hae; te minmin nynh Abram kha a zu te a hoipaw balyn ryte a deebia hae.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Abram te Lot A Phiakuh hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abram tuh a zu, a hoipaw balyn, te Lot ryte Izip ram kyate Negeb lang a cceihthung. <verse number="2" style="v" />Abram tuh sahiin, phua te sui khate myarya a hoirum. <verse number="3" style="v" />Abram tuh Negeb kyate san kheit koute san kheit cceih zah Bethel pee, Bethel khua te Ai khua laku masaty bu la sakkuh zah, <verse number="4" style="v" />masaty silawhang a la raenaw hmin kya bua a thua; te tuin kyakhe Abram nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min kha a ko. <verse number="5" style="v" />Abram te a cceihkheih hae paw Lot nynh mah tuu, miaa, vaetua, te amaw kya umpaw ccungccaw hae kha a hoi, <verse number="6" style="v" />tukeiccuze minmin parouhte umkheih nawlan loram nynh zaw vae khyh, pawccecize mih hoirumnaw tuh eih lung zah pynkheihlan um kho vae khyh hae, <verse number="7" style="v" />te Abram sahiin a rintu hae te Lot sahiin a rintu hae laku pekunaw a um. Tuh ccyh lya tuh Kanaan ccungccaw hae te Periz ccungccaw hae nynh tuh-e ram kya a um hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Te Abram nynh Lot kha, “Nang te kae laku thuasah, na sahiin rintu hae te ka sahiin rintu hae laku thuasah, pekunaw um nan sah; pawccecize aening tuh uno nynh ah thua. <verse number="9" style="v" />Ram balyn tuh na malang a um khaw? Nang tuh kamaw kyate phiakuh, nang nynh voilang na ccia ze kae tuh ranglang ka cceih cih; nang nynh ranglang na ccia ze kae tuh voilang ka cceih cih,” a cipya. <verse number="10" style="v" />Lot nynh do zah Jordan vahue Zoar khua lang ccianaw laanpi tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> khokhu hawkhate thuasah, Izip ram hawkhate thuasah, pawpaw kya balyn tui hoyte a umpaw kha a muih. E hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Sodom te Gomorrah khua hae a ro maw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:10">Gen 2.10</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Lot nynh Jordan vahue balyn kha pokuh zah nithua langkhe a cceih vae; tukeiccuze minmin tuh lu kheit te lu kheit a phiakuh vae hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Abram tuh Kanaan ram khe khua a sah, Lot tuh Vahue kya umpaw khuapi hae kyakhe khuasah zah Sodom khua pe khe bu a sakku. <verse number="13" style="v" />Sodom khua e ccungccaw hae tuh ahoy lei hae paw te seinaw patae raete <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a rawse hae paw nynh thua hae.</para>
  <para style="s">Hebron lang Abram Nuekunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Abram kyate Lot a phiakuh koute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Abram kha, “Na umnaw hmin kyate nithua, niccaw, palung lang te alia langkhe dotua; <verse number="15" style="v" />na muihpaw ram balyn kha namaw te na ciihan hae hanlan zungzae kae pya cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:5">Loc 7.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />Na ciihan hae tuh laephi kya-e laenoi hawte ka lungsah cih hae; lukhakheit nynh laephi kya-e laenoi kha a ria kho zetuh na ciihan hae kha a ria kho cih. <verse number="17" style="v" />Thokuh lah laephi asae lante thuasah, ako lante thuasah po cciatua, pawccecize tuh-e tuh nang kae pya cih,” a cipya. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Abram nynh a bu kha nue zah Hebron khua e Mamre kya-e phaesi ku hae pe khe khua a sah. Aning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanlan silawhang ccangkheit kha a rae.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Abram nynh Lot A Khum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Shinar siapharan Amrafel, Ellasar siapharan Ariok, Elam siapharan Khedorlaomer te Goiim siapharan Tidal tuh <verse number="2" style="v" />Sodom siapharan Bera, Gomorrah siapharan Birsha, Admah siapharan Shinab, Zeboiim siapharan Shemeber te Bela siapharan ryte rhaw a tukkuh hae (Bela tuh Zoar nynh thua). <verse number="3" style="v" />E siapharan lu pangaw nynh mih rhawkaw hae kha Siddim Vahue kya a suelua hae (Siddim Vahue tuh Rili Chihpaw nynh thua).<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Rili Chihpaw </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cikuhpaw hynh Hebru bya asuilan te </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Loi Rili </char><char style="ft" closed="false">a cikuh.</char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Minmin nynh Khedorlaomer kuihkaw kum haw lae ning a um hae, thuasalama kum haw lae thumnaw kya minmin nynh amaw kha a dou hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Kum haw lae palinaw kyakhe Khedorlaomer tuh amaw te a pankheih hae paw siapharan hae ryte oun thua hae zah Ashteroth-karnaim khua kya Refaim hae kha thuasah, Ham khua kya Zuzim hae kha thuasah, Kiriathaim vahue kya Emim hae kha thuasah, <verse number="6" style="v" />Mua alungnaw Seir ram kya-e Hor hae kha thuasah tae hae zah laesia ram pe a umpaw Elparan khua cia a deehui hae; <verse number="7" style="v" />te minmin tuh ki hae zah Kadesh ram umpaw En-mishpat kya a thua hae, te Amalek hae ram balyn te Hazazontamar kya umpaw Amor hae kha mah a tae hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Oute Sodom siapharan, Gomorrah siapharan, Admah siapharan, Zeboiim siapharan te Bela siapharan (Bela tuh Zoar nynh thua) nynh cceih hae zah Siddim Vahue khe <verse number="9" style="v" />Elam siapharan Khedorlaomer, Goiim siapharan Tidal, Shinar siapharan Amrafel te Ellasar siapharan Ariok kha a dou hae, siapharan lu pangaw te siapharan lu pali tuh a doukuh hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Siddim Accya tuh bitumen hunghua te phe abeih; tukeiccuze Sodom te Gomorrah siapharan hae nynh a ccue lya hae khe abang tuh tuh-e hunghua lungkhu lang a ccah hae, tuhlaepaw hae tuh mua lang a ccue hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze rhaw hae nynh Sodom te Gomorrah kya umpaw uccaw te looh balyn kha lah hae zah a cceih hae; <verse number="12" style="v" />rhaw hae nynh Sodom khua kya umpaw Abram a neitaw ccapaw Lot te a uccaw hae kha mah lah hae zah a cciakhae hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Oute tuh-e rhaw kyate a luepaw lu kheit tuh yn thua zah Hebru paw Abram kyakhe tuh-e kong kha a hopya, Abram tuh Amor paw Mamre kya-e phaesi ku hae pe khuasahpaw nynh thua, Mamre tuh Eshkol te Aner mih upaw thua zah, tuh-e hae tuh Abram te a hobung hae paw nynh thua hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Abram nynh a neitaw ccapaw phe kyng hae cipaw he a thae tuh a inn kya pui hae zah a ccangpya hae paw ccungccaw za thum lu haw lae tarya kha cciakhae hae zah Dan khua cia a deehui hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Abram nynh khuazi khe a ccungccaw hae kha phia hae zah rhaw hae kha a tuk hae, amaw te a ryalahtu hae nynh rhaw hae kha tuk hae zah Damaskas khua palung lang umpaw Hobah cia a deehui hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Oute aning nynh rhaw hae nynh a lua hae paw uccaw balyn kha thuasah, a neitaw ccapaw Lot te a uccaw hae kha thuasah, nopi hae te ccungccaw hae kha thuasah bua a kikhae hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Melkhizedek nynh Abram Hythua Pya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abram nynh Khedorlaomer te Khedorlaomer ryte a pankheih hae paw siapharan hae kha tae hae zah he yn ki tuh, Sodom siapharan nynh Shaveh Vahue kya Abram te tungku khylan a cceih (Shaveh Vahue tuh Siapharan Vahue nynh thua). <verse number="18" style="v" />Te Ahang Huaccepaw Pachia kya-e ranpibawi a thuapaw Salem Siapharan Melkhizedek nynh sanlou te misutui kha yn ccyng zah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.18-20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 7:1-10">Heb 7.1-10</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v" />“Vaaw te lae raetu</para>
  <para style="q1">Ahang Huaccepaw Pachia nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">Abram kha hythuapya sah;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />te na rhaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na kuih kalan ae pyatu</para>
  <para style="q1">Ahang Huaccepaw Pachia tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">thehoyte um sah!” cite</para>
  <para style="q1">hythua a pya.</para>
  <para style="m">Te Abram nynh atyn-are kya-e pumhaw pumkheit kha amaw kalan a pya. <verse number="21" style="v" />Oute Sodom siapharan nynh Abram kha, “Ccungccaw hae kha kamaw kalan bua yn pya, thuasalama uccaw hae kha tuh lawkuh,” a cipya. <verse number="22" style="v" />Te Abram nynh Sodom siapharan kha, “Vaaw te lae raetu Ahang Huaccepaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia malang thyalawkute bya ka kinkuh zah, <verse number="23" style="v" />‘Abram tuh ka hoirumsahpaw nynh thua,’ cite na ho khyh nawlan law syngtarawpaw thuasah, phanah rui ruikheit thuasah, na kya-e pawpaw sanmah ka lawkuh lan khyh, cite a hopya. <verse number="24" style="v" />Pawpaw mah ka lawkuh lan khyh, thuasalama ka ccungccaw hae nynh a ae vae hae paw te kae cceihkheihpaw Aner, Eshkol, te Mamre nynh mue lan accan hae paw uccaw hae kha thang nynh ka lawkuh cih. Minmin nynh mue lan accan hae paw kha lawkuh hae sah,” a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Abram kya Pachia Byakinkunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tukoute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh Abram kalan vizin lante yn thua zah, “Abram, na thinphang nan sah, kae tuh nang ae thungkhawpaw nynh ka thua; na lasung tuh myaryamaw ale cih,” a cipya. <verse number="2" style="v" />Thuasalama Abram nynh, “Pou Bawipaw PACHIA, kae tuh ccaawsaah leipaw ka thua keiccuze pawmou nae pya cih? Ka rhoccoutu tuh Damaskas khuapaw Eliezer nynh thua,” a cipya. <verse number="3" style="v" />Te Abram nynh, “Ciihan nae pya khyh, tukeiccuze ka inn kya a puipaw see lu kheit tuh ka rhoccoutu athua cih,” a ci. <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh amaw kalan yn thua zah, “E paw tuh na rhoccoutu thua lan khyh, thuasalama na ccapaw ccaccei nynh na rhoccoutu athua cih,” a ci. <verse number="5" style="v" />Te Abram kha atolang poukhae zah, “Vaawlui khuh dotua lah awsi hae khuh na ria kho ze riatua. Na ciihan hae tuh khuh-e awsi zeih acih cih hae,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:18">Rom 4.18</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:12">Heb 11.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Abram nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha zyn zah tuh-e a zynnaw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh dingnaw lang a riapya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:3">Rom 4.3</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:6">Gal 3.6</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:23">Jam 2.23</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Abram kha, “E ram hynh rho lang na ccou ccaw cite nang kha pya khylan Khaldi ccungccaw hae umnaw Ur khua kyate ae pousahpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka thua,” a ci. <verse number="8" style="v" />Abram nynh, “Bawipaw PACHIA, tuh-e ram tuh ka ccou cih cipaw pawtemou ka nyh cih?” a ci. <verse number="9" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Abram kha, “Kum thum cih paw vaetua tohlaw sa kheit, kum thum cih paw miaa nopi sa kheit, kum thum cih paw tuu pise sa kheit, vahu sa kheit te anopaw valaele sa kheit kha kamaw kalan yn thuakhae,” a cipya. <verse number="10" style="v" />Aning nynh tuh-e balyn tuh Pachia kalan thuakhae zah a theih koute ccangning cci lang ccarou a bua hae, tuh-e a bua hae paw tuh a hawiliakuh lante a nung hae, thuasalama pavaw hae kha tuh ccangning lang bua khyh hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />A nungpaw saw hae kha sawhe aepaw pavaw hae nynh he a zounua hae tuh Abram nynh a dee hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Khuanin he ccah zah Abram tuh marya a ihtheih, te ri lan um zah marae mohpaw mohnaw tuh Abram kya a ccah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 4:13">Job 4.13</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 4:14">14</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Abram kha, “Na ciihan hae tuh milae ram kya ramccang ccungccaw lang a tang cih hae, tuin kya see lang a tang cih hae zah kum za pali lungkhu vawsaw pyanaw a ing cih hae cipaw ccaerarih lan nytua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:1-14">Exo 1.1-14</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:6">Loc 7.6</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Thuasalama minmin rya a lawsahtu hae paw minphuin kha de ka tah cih hae, tuh-e koute minmin nynh hoirumnaw patae te a pou cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:40-41">Exo 12.40-41</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:7">Loc 7.7</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang tuh na minpaaw hae kalan daenaw te na cceih cih, te phe na taw te uu na thua cih. <verse number="16" style="v" />She palinaw kya na ciihan hae tuh hynh-e ram kalan a ki cih hae, pawccecize Amor ccungccaw hae cyiseimenaw tuh phe ccing loh khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="17" style="v" />Te khuanin ccah zah he yn moh tuh maeekhuh poupaw maee-ang ccangkheit te aruapaw maee tung ccangkheit oun langkuh hae zah abuakuhpaw saw hae laku khe a cceih hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuh-e nin khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Abram kya byakinnaw rae zah, “E ram hynh na ciihan hae ka pya hae, Izip vaw kyate vawpi athuapaw Zufrates kyacia,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:5">Loc 7.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v" />Ken hae ram, Keniz hae ram, Kadmon hae ram, <verse number="20" style="v" />Hit hae ram, Periz hae ram, Refaim hae ram, <verse number="21" style="v" />Amor hae ram, Kanaan hae ram, Girgash hae ram te Jebus hae ram kha ka pya hae,” a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Hagar te Ishmael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abram a zu Sarai tuh ccaawsaah khyh. Sarai nynh a min Hagar cikuhpaw Izip minphuin seenung lu kheit a hoi, <verse number="2" style="v" />Sarai nynh Abram kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha ccaaw yn saah sah khyh; ka seenung hynh ikhae tua; aning nynh imua yn saahpah kho,” a cipya. Te Abram nynh Sarai bya kha a ngae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Abram nynh Kanaan ram kya kum haw a um koute a zu Sarai nynh Izip minphuin a seenung Hagar kha a vawpaw Abram kalan zu lang a pya. <verse number="4" style="v" />Abram nynh Hagar kha ikhae zah Hagar tuh ccaaw a poi; Hagar nynh ccaaw a poipaw he nyhkuh tuh a bawinung kha pawlangria vae khyh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tetuh Sarai nynh Abram kha, “Hagar nynh pawlang yn ria khyhpaw hynh nang na meseinaw nynh thua, kae nynh ka seenung kha na by kya kae pya zah ccaawpoipaw he a nyhkuh tuh kae kha pawlang yn ria vae khyh. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nang te kae laku byapia vae sah,” a cipya. <verse number="6" style="v" />Abram nynh Sarai kha, “Na seenung tuh na kuihkaw nynh um; amaw kha na cyi ry thyhte cyih,” a cipya. Tetuh Sarai nynh Hagar kha thawte reih zah Hagar tuh amaw kyate po ccue vae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw nynh Hagar kha Shur lang ccianaw laanpi kya umpaw ramkaw e tuidy pe khe a muih. <verse number="8" style="v" />“Sarai seenung Hagar, paw kyate nae thua zah teilangmou na cceih cih?” a ci. Hagar nynh, “Ka bawinung Sarai kyate nynh kae ccue,” a ci. <verse number="9" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw nynh Hagar kha, “Na bawinung kalan kithui lah a kuihkaw khe la um,” a cipya. <verse number="10" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw nynh Hagar kha, “Na ciihan hae kha riatae um lei lan kae pungthungsahpah cih,” bua a cipya. <verse number="11" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw nynh Hagar kha,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Atu ccaaw na poi zah</para>
  <para style="q2">ccapaw lu kheit na saah cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">a min tuh Ishmael<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ishmael </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw tuh Hebru bya te </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pachia nynh a thae </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw nynh thua.</char></note> cite na phu cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">na riathaenaw kha ae nypya.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ishmael tuh apuapaw lann hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">athua cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">aning nynh ccungccaw miakaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a rawse cih zah</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw miakaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw kha a rawse cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">te a puizia balyn te arawsekuh lante</para>
  <para style="q2">a um cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hagar nynh, “Pachia kha ka muih ccaccing, thuasalama ka hiin ung khaw?” ci zah amaw kalan bya yn hopahpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha, “El-roi”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">El-roi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw tuh Hebru bya te </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Muihtu Pachia </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw nynh thua.</char></note> cite min a phu; pawccecize Hagar nynh, “Yn muihtupaw kha phe ka muih vae khaw?” a ci. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze tuisung kha Beer-lahai-roi cite a ko hae, tuh-e tuh Kadesh te Bered laku nynh a um.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Te Hagar nynh Abram kha ccapise lu kheit a saahpya; Hagar nynh a saahpyapaw a ccapaw kha Abram nynh Ishmael cite min a phu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:22">Gal 4.22</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />Hagar nynh Ishmael a saahpya lyaze Abram tuh sung tarya kum taruh acih vae.</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Byakinnaw kya-e Vingdungawkunaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 12:43-13:2">Exo 12.43—13.2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abram sung takua kum takua he cih tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh amaw kya langkuh zah, “Kae tuh Athunghuapaw Pachia nynh ka thua; ka malang khe cceih lah ccaenaw um lei lante um. <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang te kae laku ka byakinnaw kha ka rae cih zah nang kha kae pungthungsah cih,” a cipya. <verse number="3" style="v" />Te Abram nynh ccukharutungte a bakhung; <verse number="4" style="v" />Pachia nynh, “Hynh-e hynh na hanlan ka byakinnaw nynh thua: Nang tuh minphuin patae hae thokeinaw paaw na thua cih. <verse number="5" style="v" />Na min tuh Abram<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Abram </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw tuh </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Asung-epaw mih paaw </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw nynh thua.</char></note> thua vae leite Abraham<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Abraham </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw hynh Hebru bya kyaze </char><char style="fq" closed="false">minphuin patae paaw </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cite roi apoupaw te nynh aloku.</char></note> na cikuh vae cih; pawccecize nang kha minphuin patae hae thokeinaw paaw lang kae rae vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:17">Rom 4.17</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Nang kha myaryamaw a pungzaepaw lang kae rae cih; na kyate minphuin hae ka rae cih zah siapharan hae kha na kyate oun langkuh cih hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka byakinnaw tuh kae te nang laku, namaw koute na ciihan hae mih she takyh kya ka tynsah cih, pawccecize namaw te na ciihan hae Pachia ka thua cih, tuh-e tuh zungzae tynpaw byakinnaw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:55">Luk 1.55</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Atu ramccang ccungccaw lang na tangnaw oh Kanaan ram balyn hynh nang te namaw koute na ciihan hae kalan zungzae hanlan kae pya cih oh; te kae tuh mih Pachia ka thua cih,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:5">Loc 7.5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pachia nynh Abraham kha, “Nang te she takyh e na ciihan hae nynh ka byakinnaw hynh na zui cih oh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Hynh-e tuh kae, nang te namaw koute na ciihan hae laku umpaw na zui lan oh paw ka byakinnaw nynh thua: Nanning laku e pise miakaw tuh vingdung na awkuh cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:8">Loc 7.8</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 4:11">Rom 4.11</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Nae vingdung e ngesaw kha na awkuh cih oh, tuh-e tuh kae te nang laku byakinnaw muihsahnaw athua cih. <verse number="12" style="v" />Nae she takyh kya-e ccapise miakaw, nae inn e see kyate a puipaw thuasah, nae ciihan athua leipaw ramccang ccungccaw kya-e phua te na re oh paw lukhakheit thuasah, nin tarya he acih te vingdungaw athua cih. <verse number="13" style="v" />Nae inn e see kyate a puipaw te nae phua te na re oh paw kha vingdungaw athua cih hae. Tukeiccuze nae ngesaw kya ka byakinnaw tuh zungzae tynpaw byakinnaw athua cih. <verse number="14" style="v" />Vingdungawkuh leipaw ccapise humhung zemah a minphuin kyate vua athua cih; pawccecize aning nynh ka byakinnaw kha phe a ro vae,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pachia nynh Abraham kha, “Na zu Sarai kha Sarai cite na ko vae lan khyh, a min tuh Sarah<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sarah </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw tuh </char><char style="fq" closed="false">siapharan ccanung </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw nynh thua.</char></note> a cikuh vae cih. <verse number="16" style="v" />Sarah kha hythua ka pya cih zah amaw kyate ccapaw lu kheit kae pya cih. Aning kha hythua ka pya cih zah aning tuh minphuin hae nung athua cih; ccungccaw a uktu siapharan hae kha amaw kyate oun langkuh cih hae,” a cipya. <verse number="17" style="v" />Te Abraham tuh baling zah a nuin, te Abraham nynh, “Kum za kheit acih vae paw pise nynh ccaawsaah kho ung vema? Kum sung takua acih vae paw Sarah nynh ccaawsaah kho ung vema?” cite amaw te amaw kha a ciku. <verse number="18" style="v" />Te Abraham nynh Pachia kha, “Ishmael tuh namaw mitmuihnaw kya hiin vae sah,” a ci. <verse number="19" style="v" />Pachia nynh, “Tuhte thua khyh, na zu Sarah nynh ccapaw lu kheit ae saahpah cih zah Isak<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Isak </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw tuh </char><char style="fq" closed="false">a nuin </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw nynh thua.</char></note> cite min na phu cih. Amaw te amaw koute a ciihan hae hanlan zungzae tynpaw byakinnaw lang ka byakinnaw kha ka tynsah cih. <verse number="20" style="v" />Ishmael konglang te na bya kha kae thaepya vae; amaw kha hythua ka pya cih, ka pungthungsah cih zah myarya ka lungthungsah cih; aning tuh bawi lu haw lae ning hae paaw athua cih zah minphuin lepaw lang ka rae cih. <verse number="21" style="v" />Thuasalama khuavae atu ccyh kya Sarah nynh ae saahpah cih paw Isak kyakhe ka byakinnaw kha ka tynsah cih,” a cipya. <verse number="22" style="v" />Pachia te Abraham byahokuh kou hae te, Pachia nynh Abraham kha a cciataw vae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Oute a ccapaw Ishmael, a inn e see hae kyate a pui hae paw balyn, a phua te a re hae paw balyn, te a inn kya umpaw pise hae laku e ccapise miakaw kha Pachia nynh a hopya thyhte Abraham nynh mih vingdung kha tuh-e nin ccaccei khe a aw hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Abraham a vingdungaw athua lya tuh sung takua kum takua acih vae. <verse number="25" style="v" />A ccapaw Ishmael a vingdungaw athua lya tuh kum haw lae thum acih vae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuh-e nin ccaccei khe Abraham te a ccapaw Ishmael tuh vingdungaw athua hae; <verse number="27" style="v" />a inn kya puipaw see pise hae te ramccang ccungccaw kya-e phua te re hae paw pise hae, a inn e pise hae balyn tuh amaw ryte vingdungaw athua hae.</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Isak Puinaw hanlan Byakinnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh Abraham kya Mamre kya-e phaesi ku hae pe khe a langkuh, ninthu khuaninso lyakhe Abraham tuh a bu thuakawzung kya a dahung. <verse number="2" style="v" />Abraham nynh dothung zah amaw pe a thadynpaw pise hae lu thum kha a muih hae. Aning nynh minmin kha he a muih hae tuh tungku khylan a bu thuakawzung kyate ccue zah laephi kya a bakhung.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.2a: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 13:2">Heb 13.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Abraham nynh, “Ka bawipaw, na malang maehoynaw ka mue zetuh na seepaw kae hynh kawtawte yn cciataw nan. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tui beihtaraw kae lah hin sah, te nae ccu kha singkuh oh lah thingku kaw haeung oh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Na seepaw kamaw kalan nae thua keiccu vae oh ze, na ae lan oh paw sanlou beihtaraw kae lah hin sah, nae thawbangpaw hoy hin sah, tukoute na cceih cih oh,” a cipya hae. Tukeiccuze minmin nynh, “Na ho vae hawte cyih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Abraham tuh bu lungkhu umpaw Sarah kalan arangte tee zah Sarah kyakhe, “Ahoypaw vaekhui pung sung thum kha non lah sanlou lang arangte raetua,” a cipya. <verse number="7" style="v" />Abraham nynh vaetua phu kalan ccue zah ahoypaw te athopaw vaetuataw sa kheit kha lah zah a seepaw kalan pya zah arangte ang a hynsah. <verse number="8" style="v" />Oute samateitui ahaawpaw, samateitui te a paccyn vae paw vaetuataw a saw kha yn ccyng zah mih malang a nyapya hae; minmin nynh thingku kaw a ae lya hae khe mih pe khe a thadyn.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Minmin nynh Abraham kha, “Na zu Sarah teimou um?” a ci hae. Te aning nynh, “Bu lungkhu nynh um,” a cipya hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Oute minmin kya-e lu kheit nynh, “Khuavae atu ccyh kya na kalan solei kae thua ung cih, te na zu Sarah nynh ccapaw lu kheit a saah cih,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:9">Rom 9.9</ref></char></note> Sarah nynh tuh-e paw a nulang thuakawzung kyate bya kha a ngae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Abraham te Sarah tuh mih kum tang vae zah a taw vae hae; Sarah tuh nopiny mah nyh vae khyh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Sarah nynh nuin zah, “Kae mah ka taw vae zah ka vawpaw mah a taw vae, hoysahnaw tuh ka hoi ung vema?” cite amaw te amaw kha a ciku.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:6">1Pe 3.6</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Abraham kha, “Pawcce Sarah nynh nuin zah, ‘Phe ka taw vae zah imua tuh ka saah ccaccing ung vema?’ a ci. <verse number="14" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanlan pawpaw uccaw mah eih ru cipaw a um tou? Accyh yn zaw te khuavae atu ccyh kya na kalan bua kae thua cih zah Sarah nynh ccapaw lu kheit a saah cih,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:37">Luk 1.37</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Thuasalama Sarah nynh a ri keiccuze, “Ka nuin khyh,” cite a pheiku. Aning nynh, “Mang na nuin,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Sodom hanlan Abraham Sawsang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Oute tuh-e ccungccaw hae nynh tuin kyate pou hae zah Sodom khua langkhe dote a cceih hae; te Abraham tuh minmin kha dohaw khylan mih kya a cceihbua. <verse number="17" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Ka rae lanpaw hynh Abraham kya ka phei cih tou? <verse number="18" style="v" />Abraham tuh myarya lepaw te athawsaepaw minphuin athua cih zah, laephi vawlan minphuin balyn tuh amaw liate hythuapya athua cih hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Adingpaw te ahmepaw raenaw liate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> laanpi kha zui khylan Abraham nynh a ccaaw hae te amaw koute a innbyn hae kha a ccangpya ccaw hae cite amaw kha ka po vae, tuhcite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Abraham kya bya a kinpyaku thyhte a rae cih,” a ci. <verse number="20" style="v" />Oute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Sodom te Gomorrah khua e thethyanaw tuh myarya le zah mih seinaw mah myarya alung. <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka cceih cih zah kamaw kalan yn thuapaw mih thethyanaw thyhte minmin nynh a cyih hae tou, cyih khyh hae tou cipaw ka do cih; a cyi khyh hae ze a cyi khyhnaw hae kong kha ka nyh cih,” a ci. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tukeiccuze tuh-e ccungccaw hae tuh tuin kyate pou hae zah Sodom khua langkhe a cceih hae, tuh ccyh lya Abraham tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang phang a thadyn. <verse number="23" style="v" />Tukoute Abraham nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan naekuh zah, “Ading hae paw kha ccungccaw hoylei hae ryte na rohkheih ccaccing cih hae tou? <verse number="24" style="v" />Khuapi lungkhu miding sung pangaw a um lanze na roh cih tou? Tuh-e khua lungkhu um hae paw miding sung pangaw liate tuh-e khua kha ngaethya leite na roh cih tou? <verse number="25" style="v" />Miding hae kha ccungccaw hoylei hae hawte athua khyh nawlan hae, miding hae kha tuh-e hae ryte chiakheih lanpaw tuh namaw kyate sawkuh sah. Laephi pynpi Byapiatu nynh ahmete byapia lan khyh tou?” a ci. <verse number="26" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Sodom khua khe miding sung pangaw ka muih lanze tuh-e miding hae liate tuh-e hmin balyn tuh ka ngaethya cih,” a ci. <verse number="27" style="v" />Abraham nynh, “Kae tuh laenoi te buhhaw ka thua zemah Bawipaw kalan rawhoyte kae ho sah. <verse number="28" style="v" />Miding sung pangaw thua leite sung pali lu pangaw a um lanze pawte athua cih? Lu pangaw azyahua keiccuze khuapi balyn kha na roh cih tou?” a ci. Te Bawipaw nynh, “Tuin kya sung pali lu pangaw ka muih zetuh ka roh lan khyh,” a ci. <verse number="29" style="v" />Abraham nynh, “Tuin kya sung pali na muih lan zeso?” cite bua a ho. Bawipaw nynh, “Sung pali hae liate khua kha ka roh lan khyh,” a ci. <verse number="30" style="v" />Te Abraham nynh, “Bawipaw, na thinria nan sah, ka ho ung cih. Tuh-e khua kya sung thum a um lan zeso?” cite a ci. Bawipaw nynh, “Tuin kya sung thum ka muih zemah ka roh lan khyh,” a ci. <verse number="31" style="v" />Abraham nynh, “Bawipaw kalan rawhoyte kae ho sah, tuh-e khua kya lu kuin na muih lan zeso?” a ci. Bawipaw nynh, “Lu kuin hae liate khua kha ka roh lan khyh,” a ci. <verse number="32" style="v" />Te Abraham nynh, “Bawipaw, vaekheit ka ho ung cih, na thinria nan sah. Tuh-e khua kya lu haw na muih lan zeso?” a ci. Bawipaw nynh, “Lu haw hae liate khua kha ka roh lan khyh,” a ci. <verse number="33" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh Abraham te bya a hokuh kou hae te a cceih vae; Abraham mah a umnaw lang a ki vae.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Sodom Khuaccaaw hae Hoyleinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vaawpaw lu ning tuh zetesang khe Sodom khua a thua hae, Lot tuh Sodom khua koikua kya a la haung. Lot nynh minmin kha he a muih hae tuh cciadue khylan thokuh zah laephi kya a bakhung. <verse number="2" style="v" />Lot nynh, “Ka bawipaw oh, nae seepaw inn lang tee oh lah, khuazi rya oh, nae ccu kha singkuh oh; te awkhua takaw te na tho cih oh zah na cceih cih oh,” a cipya hae. Minmin nynh, “Kae tee lan khyh, khuazi khualae lungkhu kya nynh kae rya cih,” a ci hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Thuasalama Lot nynh thawte a soihbia hae keiccuze Lot inn lang cceih hae zah a tee hae; te Lot nynh minmin hanlan ransi phing leipaw sanlou kha thoupah hae zah minmin nynh a ae hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuasalama minmin a i maw hae khe Sodom khua e pise hae, pise adih ale balyn nynh inn kha a koihlu hae; <verse number="5" style="v" />Lot kha ko hae zah, “Atu khuazi na kalan oun thua hae paw pise hae kha teimou um hae? Minmin te kae ikheih ccaw, kae kalan yn poukhae hae,” a ci hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.5-8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 19:22-24">Bpt 19.22-24</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Lot nynh thuakaw kyate tuh-e pise hae kalan atolang pou zah thuakaw kha a khaw, <verse number="7" style="v" />te Lot nynh, “Uteno hae, hoyleinaw hynh beih rae nan oh cite kae ngia oh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Pise te a ikheih loh lei hae paw ccanung lu ning ka hoi, minmin kha nanning kalan kae cciakhae hae sah lah, minmin kyakhe nae rythyte rae oh; hynh-e pise hae kya pawpaw mah cyih nan oh, pawccecize minmin tuh ka mikhia hae thua hae zah ka thungkhaw lan hae paw nynh thua,” a ci. <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuasalama minmin nynh, “Cceih, khawkuh nan!” a ci hae. Tukoute minmin nynh, “Ramccang ccungccaw hawte nae thuapaw nang nynh byapiatu lang nae tansaku. Atu minmin tungvaw laeze namaw tungvaw accihhua lante kae cyih vae cih,” a ci hae. Te minmin nynh Lot kha ccaring eih hae zah thuakaw kha ro khylan thuakaw pe lang oun naekuh vae hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Thuasalama alungkhu e vaawccungccaw hae nynh mih kuih kha dyng hae zah Lot kha inn lungkhu lang sue hae zah thuakaw kha a khaw hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Te thuakaw pe um hae paw pise adih ale hae kha mih mit a mohsah hae, tukeiccuze minmin nynh thuakaw kha muih kho vae khyh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 6:18">2Si 6.18</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Sodom kyate Lot A Ccue</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Vaawccungccaw hae nynh Lot kha, “Hynh-e kya ccangpaw na ccungccaw lukhakheit a um ung tou? Na ccapaw hae, na ccanung hae, na ccanung hae mih vawpaw hae, te khua kya-e na ccungccaw athuapaw miakaw kha hynh-e kyate poukhae hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Pawccecize hynh-e hmin hynh kae roh cih. E ccungccaw hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> rawsete a siaruanaw hae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang myarya ale vae, tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Sodom khua ro khylan kaening hynh oun saw vae,” a ci hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Lot nynh atolang pou zah a ccanung hae kha zu lang a dy hae paw a paepaw hae kha, “Thokuh oh, hynh-e hmin kyate pou oh; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh khuapi hynh a roh vae cih,” a cipya hae. Thuasalama minmin nynh a ccyasahpaw cite a tua hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Awkhua takaw he yn thua tuh vaawccungccaw hae nynh Lot kha hopah hae zah, “Thokuh, hein kya umpaw na zu te na ccanung lu ning kha ko hae lah pou oh, tuhkhyhze tuh khuapi detahnaw kya maemih na thua vae cih oh,” a ci hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Thuasalama Lot tuh rarymamaw a um, te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Lot kha ngaethyaumsah keiccuze vaawccungccaw hae nynh amaw, a zu, te a ccanung lu ning kha mih kuih te sue hae zah khuapi atolang a poukhae kou hae te tuin kya a cciataw hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:7">2Pe 2.7</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Vaawccungccaw hae nynh minmin kha khuapi atolang he thuakhae hae te, vaawpaw nynh, “Nae hiinnaw hanlan ccue oh; nulang do nan oh, pawpaw Vahue kya sanmah thadyn nan oh; mua lang ccue oh, tuhkhyhze tuh na maemih cih oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Te Lot nynh minmin kha, “Ka bawipaw hae, tuhte thua khyh; <verse number="19" style="v" />nae seepaw kae tuh nae malang maehoynaw ka mue, te myarya ngaethya nae um sah oh zah, ka hiinnaw kha nae khum vae oh; thuasalama mua lang tuh ka ccue kho lan khyh, pawccecize ronaw nynh yn thuanua cih zah ka chihsei cih cipaw kha ka rih. <verse number="20" style="v" />Dotua, khuh-e khua tuh nae zah ccue kho a ung cih, adihpaw khua mah athua. Khuh-e khua lang beih kae ccuesah lah khuh-e khua tuh adihpaw khaw athua? Khuh-e khua taraw kalan ka ccue zetuh ka hiinnaw kha khum athua cih,” a ci. <verse number="21" style="v" />Aning nynh Lot kha, “Myarya hoy, nae ngiapaw kha kae ua cih zah na hopaw khua kha ka roh lan khyh. <verse number="22" style="v" />Rangsakuh, na lue ccaw, tuh-e khua kalan ccue, pawccecize tuin kya na thua makhia pawpaw mah ka cyih kho khyh,” a ci. Tukeiccuze tuh-e khua tuh Zoar<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Zoar </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw hynh Hebru bya kyaze </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Adihpaw </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cite roi apoupaw te nynh aloku.</char></note> a ci hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Lot nynh Zoar khua he athua tuh laephi vawlan khuanin phe thuabia vae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh vaawlui luki Amaw kyate kemaee kha Sodom te Gomorrah kya khuaa lang a rawsah;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.24-25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:15">Mat 10.15</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 11:23-24">11.23-24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:12">Luk 10.12</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 17:29">17.29</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:6">2Pe 2.6</ref>; <ref loc="JUD 1:7">Jud 7</ref></char></note> <verse number="25" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh tuh-e khuapi hae thuasah, Vahue balyn kha thuasah, khua hae kya umpaw ccungccaw balyn kha thuasah, laephi kya a popaw miakaw kha thuasah pong a ro. <verse number="26" style="v" />Lot zu tuh nulang do zah loi tung lang phe tang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:32">Luk 17.32</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Awkhua takaw khe Abraham tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang a la thadynnaw hmin kalan a cceih. <verse number="28" style="v" />Oute aning nynh Sodom te Gomorrah te Vahue balyn kha do zah maeephupi kya-e maeekhuh hawte a pouthungpaw laephi kya-e maeekhuh kha a muih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuhte Pachia nynh Vahue e khua hae kha he a roh tuh Abraham kha a liathui, tukeiccuze Lot nynh khua a la sahnaw khua hae kha Pachia nynh he a roh tuh ronaw lungkhu kyate Lot kha a pousah.</para>
  <para style="s1">Moab hae te Ammon hae Thokeinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Te Lot nynh Zoar khua kyate cceihthung zah mua kyakhe a ccanung lu ning ryte a um hae, pawccecize aning nynh Zoar khua kya um lan a rih; tukeiccuze a ccanung lu ning ryte lungkarung kya a um hae. <verse number="31" style="v" />Te atawccanung nynh asoinung kha, “Ah paaw tuh a taw vae, te laephi phung thyhte aening kha zu lang oun dy lanpaw pise laephi vawlan um vae khyh. <verse number="32" style="v" />Yn cceih, ah paaw hynh misutui niasah sih, ah paaw ciihan kha tynsah khylan amaw kha ikhae sih,” a ci. <verse number="33" style="v" />Tukeiccuze tuh-e khuazi khe minmin nynh mih paaw kha misutui a niasah hae; te atawccanung tuh a paaw te a ihkheih hae; atawccanung nynh a ihbuapaw te a thopaw kha a paaw nynh nyh khyh. <verse number="34" style="v" />Awkhualan khe atawccanung nynh asoinung kha, “Atazi khe kae tuh ka paaw te kae ihkheih vae; atu khuazi mah misutui niasah sih, te ah paaw ciihan kha tynsah khylan amaw te ihkheih oh,” a cipya. <verse number="35" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin nynh tuh-e khuazi khe mah mih paaw kha misutui a niasah hae; te asoinung nynh thokuh zah a paaw te a ihkheih hae; asoinung nynh a ibuapaw te a thopaw kha a paaw nynh nyh khyh. <verse number="36" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Lot ccanung hae tuh parouh mawte mih paaw liate ccaaw a poi vae hae. <verse number="37" style="v" />Atawccanung nynh ccapise saah zah Moab<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.37 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Moab </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw hynh Hebru bya kyaze </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ka paaw kyate </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cite roi apoupaw te nynh aloku.</char></note> cite min a phu; aning tuh atu Moab minphuin hae mih thokeinaw paaw nynh thua. <verse number="38" style="v" />Asoinung nynh mah ccapise saah zah Ben-ammi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.38 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ben-ammi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw hynh Hebru bya kyaze </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ka puizia ccapaw </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cite roi apoupaw te nynh aloku.</char></note> cite min a phu; aning tuh Ammon minphuin hae mih thokeinaw paaw nynh thua.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Abraham te Abimelek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abraham tuh Mamre kyate Negeb ram lang cceih zah Kadesh te Shur laku khe a um. Gerar khua kya ramccang ccungccaw hawte a um lyakhe, <verse number="2" style="v" />Abraham nynh a zu Sarah kong kha, “Aning tuh ka ccianung nynh thua,” cite a ho. Te Gerar siapharan Abimelek nynh Sarah kha a kosah hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:13">Gen 12.13</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 26:7">26.7</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Thuasalama khuazi Abimelek a maan kyakhe Pachia nynh langkuh zah, “Nang tuh na umkhaepaw nopi keiccuze na chih cih; pawccecize aning tuh vawpaw hoi vae paw nynh thua,” cite Abimelek kha a cipya. <verse number="4" style="v" />Abimelek nynh Sarah kha ikhae loh khyh; tukeiccuze aning nynh, “Bawipaw, seinaw hoi leipaw ccungccaw hae kha na roh cih tou? <verse number="5" style="v" />Abraham nynh, ‘Aning tuh ka ccianung nynh thua,’ a ci khaw? Te nopinung ccaccei nynh, ‘Aning tuh ka raepaw nynh thua,’ a ci. Hynh-e hynh adingpaw ka thinlung te athyaapaw ka kuih te nynh ka cyi,” a cipya. <verse number="6" style="v" />Te Pachia nynh Abimelek a maan kyakhe, “Athua, adingpaw na thinlung te nynh hynh-e hynh na cyi cipaw ka ny; tuh apiaze kamaw kha rawsete na sei khyh nawlan kae tuh ae thungkhawpaw nynh ka thua. Tukeiccuze aning kha kae ty sah khyh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Atu Abraham zu kha amaw kalan bua pya ccavae; pawccecize aning tuh profeh nynh thua, aning nynh namaw hanlan saw ae sangpah cih zah na hiin cih. Thuasalama nang nynh amaw kha bua na pya khyh zetuh nang te na umkheih oh paw balyn na chih ccaccing cih oh cipaw kha nytua,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Abimelek nynh awkhua takaw te tho zah a see hae balyn kha ko hae zah hynh-e acyihkuhpaw balyn kha a hopya hae; te minmin tuh myarya a rih hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Te Abimelek nynh Abraham kha ko zah, “Kae tungvaw na raepaw hynh pawmou athua? Na tungvaw paw ka sei keiccu mou hynhcih alepaw hoyleinaw hynh ka tungvaw te ka peenaw kya nae thuakhaepya? Nang nynh cyi lan accan leipaw uccaw hae kha ka tungvaw phe na cyi vae,” a cipya. <verse number="10" style="v" />Te Abimelek nynh, “Paw na tua keiccu mou e uccaw hynh na cyi?” cite Abraham kha a cipya. <verse number="11" style="v" />Abraham nynh, “E kya umpaw balyn tuh Pachia rih khyh hae zah ka zu keiccuze kamaw kha yn theih cih hae cite ka tua pawte nynh e hynh ka cyi. <verse number="12" style="v" />Te Sarah tuh ka ccianung ccaccing nynh thua, ka paaw ccanung nynh thua, thuasalama ka nung ccanung thua khyh; te aning tuh ka zu lang yn tang. <verse number="13" style="v" />Te Pachia nynh ka paaw inn kyate he yn khiasakuh te, Sarah kha, ‘E hynh ka tungvaw na cyi lanpaw thawccinaw nynh thua: ah ccianaw hmin takyh kya, Aning tuh ka raepaw nynh thua cite na ho cih,’ ” ka cipya. <verse number="14" style="v" />Oute Abimelek nynh tuu hae, vaetua hae, seenung hae te seepaw hae kha cciakhae zah Abraham kha a pya, te a zu Sarah kha mah bua a pya. <verse number="15" style="v" />Abimelek nynh, “Na muihpaw loram hynh ka ram nynh thua; na lungrynaw kya khuasah,” a cipya. <verse number="16" style="v" />Aning nynh Sarah kha, “Dotua, na raeepaw kha ngunphua thong kheit ka pya vae; tuh-e tuh nang te na umkheih oh paw ccungccaw balyn malang na thyaa cite langsakunawpaw nynh thua; nang tuh phe na thyaa ccaccing,” a cipya. <verse number="17" style="v" />Te Abraham nynh Pachia kalan sawsang zah Pachia nynh Abimelek, a zu te a seenung hae kha dansah hae zah ccaaw a saah hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Pawccecize Abraham zu Sarah keiccuze Abimelek inn kya umpaw nopi balyn kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh pong a tingsah hae.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Isak Puinaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="HEB 11:11">Heb 11.11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a la ho vae hawte Sarah kya a thua, te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh byakinpyaku thyhte Sarah hanlan a cyipya. <verse number="2" style="v" />Abraham phe a taw vae khe Sarah nynh ccaawpoi zah Pachia nynh a la hopaw ccyh kyakhe ccapaw lu kheit a saahpya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:11">Heb 11.11</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Sarah nynh a saahpyapaw a ccapaw kha Abraham nynh Isak cite min a phu. <verse number="4" style="v" />Te Abraham nynh a ccapaw Isak tuh nin tarya he acih te, Pachia nynh kaw a la pya thyhte a vingdung kha a aw.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:12">Gen 17.12</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:8">Loc 7.8</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />A ccapaw Isak a pui lya Abraham tuh kum za kheit acih vae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Sarah nynh, “Pachia nynh nuinnaw yn pya vae; tuh-e kong a thaepaw miakaw nynh kamaw ryte a nuin cih hae,” a ci. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukoute “Sarah nynh ccaaw kha matei a zusah cih cite hum nynh mou Abraham kalan a hopah boi? Thuasalama phe a taw vae khe, amaw hanlan ccapaw lu kheit ka saahpya vae,” cite Sarah nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Hagar te Ishmael A Saw hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Imua tuh yn le zah matei phia athua; te Abraham nynh Isak kha matei phia athua nin khe poi pi kha a tua. <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuasalama Izip ccungccaw Hagar nynh Abraham hanlan a saahpyapaw ccapaw te Sarah a ccapaw Isak nynh a zue hae paw kha Sarah nynh a muih. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Sarah nynh Abraham kha, “E seenung te a ccapaw hynh po dee hae; pawccecize e seenung a ccapaw hynh ka ccapaw Isak te rhoccoukheih lan khyh hae,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:29-30">Gal 4.29-30</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />A ccapaw konglang athua keiccuze tuh-e bya nynh Abraham kha myarya a lungvawsaw sah. <verse number="12" style="v" />Thuasalama Pachia nynh Abraham kha, “Imuapaw te na seenung keiccuze na lungvawsaw nan sah; Sarah nynh ae hopya thyhte cyitua, pawccecize Isak kya nynh na ciihan atyn cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:7">Rom 9.7</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:18">Heb 11.18</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Seenung ccapaw mah minphuin ccangkheit lang ka rae cih, pawccecize aning tuh na ciihan nynh athuabua,” a ci. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Abraham nynh awkhua takaw khe tho zah sanlou te saphua tui-ung te tui kaw kheit kha lah zah Hagar kha a pya. Te aning nynh tuh-e tuh Hagar a raw vawlan khangpah zah imua ryte a cciasah vae. Hagar nynh cceih zah Beersheba ramkaw khe a khiavuikuh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Saphua kya-e tui he athang tuh Hagar nynh imuapaw kha thabu kaw khe a nung. <verse number="16" style="v" />Oute Hagar nynh, “Imua a chipaw kha ka muih ry khyh,” cih zah kaih za kheit loukaw a sawnaw lang cceih zah imua te arawsekuh lante a dahung; aning nynh a dahung lyakhe thawmawte a rah. <verse number="17" style="v" />Te Pachia nynh imuapaw roi kha a thae; te vaawlang te Pachia vaawpaw nynh Hagar kha ko zah, “Hagar, pawcce na lungriathae? Rih nan; pawccecize Pachia nynh imuapaw a umnaw kya-e a rawpaw roi kha a thae vae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Thokuh, imuapaw kha hang lah na kuih te pom, pawccecize aning kha minphuin lepaw lang ka rae cih,” a ci. <verse number="19" style="v" />Oute Pachia nynh Hagar mit kha awsah zah aning nynh tuisung ccangkheit kha a muih. Hagar nynh cceih zah saphua tui-ung kyakhe tui phe beih lan the zah imuapaw kha a niasah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pachia nynh imuapaw kha umkhae zah aning tuh a lethung; imuapaw tuh ramkaw khe khuasah zah li myarya kawthyapaw lang yn tang. <verse number="21" style="v" />Aning tuh Paran ramkaw khe khua a sah; te a nung nynh Izip ram e zu kha a dypya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Abimelek ccyh lya, Abimelek te a rhawbawipaw Fikol nynh Abraham kha, “Na cyipaw balyn kya Pachia nynh ae umkhae;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 26:26">Gen 26.26</ref></char></note> <verse number="23" style="v" />tukeiccuze kamaw thuasah, ka ccaaw hae thuasah, ka ciihan hae thuasah, nae ling khyh nawlan, nang kha lungzite kae ccuepe hawte nang nynh kamaw kya thuasah, ramccang ccungccaw hawte na umnaw ram kya thuasah nae ccuepenaw lan atu Pachia malang byakinkuh,” a ci. <verse number="24" style="v" />Te Abraham nynh, “Bya ka kinku,” a ci. <verse number="25" style="v" />Abimelek see hae nynh a la luade hae paw tuisung ccangkheit kong a lung-ungnaw kha Abraham nynh Abimelek kha a hopya, <verse number="26" style="v" />Abimelek nynh, “Tuh-e tuh hum nynh a cyih cipaw ka nyh khyh; nae hopah khyh zah atunin cia tuh-e tuh ka thae khyh,” a ci. <verse number="27" style="v" />Te Abraham nynh tuu hae te vaetua hae kha Abimelek a pya, te mih lu ning te byakinnaw a rae hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Abraham nynh tuutaw sa sari kha tuuphu kyate ccanglang a phia hae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Te Abimelek nynh Abraham kha, “Na phiapaw hynh-e tuutaw hae sa sari asuilan hynh pawmou athua?” cite a khia. <verse number="30" style="v" />Abraham nynh, “E tuisung hynh kae nynh ka thaepaw cite ccaekia lang yn tangpya nawlan, e tuutaw sa sari hynh ka kuih kyate nae lawpakuh cih,” a cipya. <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuh-e hmin tuh Beersheba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.31 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Beersheba </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw hynh Hebru bya te </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Byakinnaw tuisung </char><char style="ft" closed="false">khyhze </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tuisung Ccangsari </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw nynh thua.</char></note> cite a ko hae, pawccecize mih lu ning te tuin kya byakinnaw kha a rae hae. <verse number="32" style="v" />Minmin nynh Beersheba kya byakinnaw a rae kou hae te, Abimelek te rhawbawipaw Fikol tuh cceih hae zah Filistin hae ram lang a ki vae hae. <verse number="33" style="v" />Abraham nynh Beersheba kyakhe mangking ku kukheit ling zah, zungzae tynpaw Pachia, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min kha a ko. <verse number="34" style="v" />Te Abraham tuh Filistin hae ram kya ramccang ccungccaw hawte khaw cia a um.</para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Isak te Silawnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tukoute Pachia nynh Abraham kha a syntawtua. Pachia nynh, “Abraham,” cite ko zah Abraham nynh, “Hein kya mang ka um,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.1-13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:17-19">Heb 11.17-19</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Pachia nynh, “Na sungsahpaw na ccapaw, lu kheit kyalyapaw Isak kha hoei lah Moriah ram lang cciatua, te kae muihsah cih paw mua muakheit vawlan khe Isak khate maee-ute silawnaw kha raetua,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 3:1">2Sh 3.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Abraham nynh awkhua takaw te tho zah a lann kha ade de zah a ccapaw Isak te a ccangvae hae lu ning kha a hoei hae; aning nynh maee-ute silawnaw kha rae nawlan maeething kha tya zah Pachia nynh a hopyapaw asawnaw hmin lang a cceih. <verse number="4" style="v" />Nin thumnaw kya Abraham nynh dothung zah tuh-e hmin kha asawnaw kyate a muih. <verse number="5" style="v" />Te Abraham nynh a ccangvae hae kha, “Hein kya lann ryte la um oh; imuapaw te kae tuh khuhlang khuin kae la cceih cih; Pachia kae la beik cih zah athang te nae kalan bua kae ki cih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Abraham nynh maee-ute silawnawpaw unaw lanpaw maeething kha lah zah Isak kha a puihsah, te amaw nynh maee te tangpaw kha ccyng zah lu ning te a cceih hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Isak nynh a paaw Abraham kha, “Apang,” cite ko zah a paaw nynh, “Ka ccaaw, hein kya mang ka um,” a ci. Isak nynh, “Maee te maeething tuh mang um zah maee-ute silawnaw lanpaw tuutaw teimou um?” a ci. <verse number="8" style="v" />Abraham nynh, “Ka ccapaw, maee-ute silawnaw lanpaw tuutaw kha Pachia nynh oun pya cih,” cipah zah mih lu ning te pynkheihlan a cceih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pachia nynh a la langsahpyapaw hmin kya a thua hae tuh, Abraham nynh silawhang ccangkheit kha rae zah maeething kha a khang. A ccapaw Isak kha he zah silawhang vawlan umpaw maeething vawlan khe a nung.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 2:21">Jam 2.21</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Te Abraham nynh a kuih kha dyng zah a ccapaw chia nawlan tangpaw kha a law. <verse number="11" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw nynh vaawlang te, “Abraham, Abraham!” cite ko zah Abraham nynh, “Hein kya mang ka um,” a ci. <verse number="12" style="v" />Vaaw ccungccapaw nynh, “Imuapaw tungvaw na kuih hang nan, amaw kha pawpaw mah cyih nan; nang nynh Pachia kha na ri cipaw atu ka ny, pawccecize na ccapaw lu kheit kyalyapaw kha kamaw hanlan na hysah,” a ci. <verse number="13" style="v" />Te Abraham nynh dothung zah a ki te thabu kya phang bawkuhpaw tuutepaw sa kheit kha a muih. Abraham nynh cceih zah a ccapaw ccelang tuutepaw kha lah zah maee-ute silawnaw kha a rae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Abraham nynh tuh-e hmin kha, “Jehovah-jireh,”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jehovah-jireh </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw tuh </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bawipaw nynh a pya </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw nynh thua.</char></note> cite min a phu; atu she cia zemah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mua vawlan tuh-e tuh paccynpya athua cih,” a ci hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw nynh Abraham kha vaawlang te vaeningnaw ko zah, <verse number="16" style="v" />“<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kamaw min ccaccei te byakinnaw ka rae cih ci zah hynhte a ho: Nang nynh na ccapaw lu kheit kyalyapaw kha kamaw hanlan na hysah zah hynh-e hynh na cyi keiccuze,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.16-17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 6:13-14">Heb 6.13-14</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />nang kha hythua kae pya ccaccing cih, na ciihan kha vaawlui kya-e awsi zeih, te rili kin umpaw laesia zeih alung lan kae pungthungsah cih. Te na ciihan nynh mih rhaw hae khua koikua kha a uk cih hae,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:12">Heb 11.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v" />te na ciihan liate laephi vaw e minphuin balyn hythuanaw a ccou cih hae, pawccecize ka kaw kha na ngae vae,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:25">Loc 3.25</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v" />Te Abraham nynh a ccangvae hae kalan a ki, te minmin nynh thokuh hae zah Beersheba lang pynkheihlan a cceih vae hae; Abraham tuh Beersheba kya khua a sah.</para>
  <para style="s1">Nahor Ccaaw hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tukoute, “Na neitawpaw Nahor zu Milkah nynh ccaaw hae kha a saah,” cite Abraham kha a hopya hae: <verse number="21" style="v" />Uz tuh ccatawccaw thua zah a neitaw tuh Buz nynh thua, Kemuel tuh Aram a paaw nynh thua, <verse number="22" style="v" />te Khesed, Hazo, Pildash, Jidlaf te Bethuel nynh thua hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Bethuel tuh Rebekah a paaw nynh thua. Milkah nynh Abraham neitaw Nahor kha e ccapaw lu tarya hynh a saahpya hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuhpiaze Nahor a lovaenung Reumah nynh Tebah, Gaham, Tahash te Maakah kha a saah hae.</para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Sarah Chinaw te Uunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sarah tuh za kheit kum kuin lae sari cia a she sae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Te Sarah tuh Kanaan ram Kiriath-arba khua kya a chih (Kiriath-arba tuh Hebron khua nynh thua); Abraham tuh Sarah hanlan rawkhui khylan a cceih. <verse number="3" style="v" />Abraham nynh a zu rhua pe te thokuh zah Hit ccungccaw hae kyakhe, <verse number="4" style="v" />“Kae tuh nanning laku a um buapaw ramccang ccungccaw te mikhiapaw ka thua zah ka zu rhua uu nawlan shaw hmin san kheit beih yn pyabua oh,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:9">Heb 11.9</ref>, <ref loc="HEB 11:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:16">Loc 7.16</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Te Hit ccungccaw hae nynh Abraham kha, <verse number="6" style="v" />“Nang tuh kaening laku a thawsaepaw bawi lu kheit nynh na thua. Kae shawku hmin kyakhe pokuh lah na zu rhua kha uh; na zu rhua uu nawlan shaw hmin sankhakheit kha namaw hanlan a hysah leipaw kae um lan khyh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Abraham nynh thokuh zah tuh-e ram e Hit ccungccaw hae malang bakhung zah, <verse number="8" style="v" />“Ka zu rhua kha uhsah cite nae ry oh zetuh Zohar ccapaw Efron nynh <verse number="9" style="v" />a hoipaw Makpelah lungkaryn kha yn zuapya nawlan beih hopah oh; tuh-e tuh a loo kin umpaw nynh thua. Khah-e shaw hmin kha a mee thathyhte nae malang yn zuapya nawlan yn soihbiapah oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Efron tuh Hit ccungccaw hae laku a haungbua; te Hit ccungccapaw Efron nynh tuh-e khua koikua lungkhu umpaw Hit ccungccaw hae balyn a thaenaw hae khe Abraham kha, <verse number="11" style="v" />“Bawipaw, tuhte thua khyh, loo thuasah, loo lungkhu umpaw lungkaryn thuasah ka ccungccaw hae malang kae pya; na zu rhua kha uh ccaleih,” a cipya. <verse number="12" style="v" />Oute Abraham nynh tuh-e ram e ccungccaw hae malang a bakhung. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuh-e ram e ccungccaw hae nynh a thaenaw hae khe Abraham nynh Efron kha, “Ka bya hynh yn ngaepya tua, ka zu rhua kha tuin kya ka uu ccaw, loo mee hynh kae pya cih, yn lawpakuh,” a cipya. <verse number="14" style="v" />Efron nynh Abraham kha, <verse number="15" style="v" />“Ka bawipaw, tuh-e laephi tuh phua za pali nynh a mee, nang te kae laku tuh-e tuh pawsang thua zawtou? Na zu rhua tuh uh ccaleih,” a cipya. <verse number="16" style="v" />Abraham nynh Efron hopaw kha a nawccaw; te aning nynh Efron hanlan Hit ccungccaw hae nynh a thaenaw hae khe, kungku hae nynh a tou hae thyhte phua za pali kha toupah zah a pya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuhcite Mamre nithua lang e Makpelah kya umpaw Efron loo thuasah, loo lungkhu umpaw lungkaryn te thingku hae thuasah, <verse number="18" style="v" />Hit ccungccaw balyn a umnaw hae, tuh-e khua koikua lungkhu a teepaw ccungccaw balyn malang khe Efron nynh Abraham kha a pya. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tukoute Abraham nynh a zu Sarah kha Kanaan ram, Mamre te a hawiliakuh hae paw Makpelah loo kya umpaw lungkaryn kyakhe a uu. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuh-e loo te loo lungkhu umpaw lungkaryn kha Abraham nynh a hoipaw shawku hmin lang Hit ccungccaw hae nynh a pya hae.</para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Isak Zudynaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abraham tuh taw vae zah a kum myarya tang vae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Abraham kha atyn-are kya hythua a pya. <verse number="2" style="v" />Abraham nynh a inn kyaze a kum tang huapaw, a hoipaw balyn kha a uktupaw a seepaw kyakhe, <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ka umnaw Kanaan ccungccaw hae mih ccanung hae hynh ka ccapaw zu lang na dypya khyh nawlan, <verse number="4" style="v" />te ka ram, ka uno hae kalan na cceih cih zah ka ccapaw Isak hanlan zu na dypya nawlan, na kuih kha ka phae kaw nung lah vaaw te lae Pachia, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min te bya kae kinsakuh cih,” a cipya. <verse number="5" style="v" />A seepaw nynh Abraham kha, “Nopinung nynh e ram kalan kamaw kha zui ry leite a um lanze na ccapaw kha nae thuanaw ram lang ka kikhae cih tou?” a cipya. <verse number="6" style="v" />Abraham nynh a seepaw kha, “Tuh-e ram lang ka ccapaw kha na kikhae khyh nawlan raeringkuh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka paaw inn kyate thuasah, ka puinaw ram kyate thuasah yn cciakhae zah, ‘E ram hynh na ciihan kha ka pya cih,’ cite bya yn kinpakuhpaw, vaawlui Pachia, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a vaawccungccaw kha na malang a saw cih zah nang nynh ka ccapaw hanlan tuh-e ram kya-e zu kha na dypah cih. <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuasalama nopinung nynh nang kha ae zui ry khyh ze nang tuh hynh-e ka byakin kyate na lue cih; ka ccapaw kha tuh-e ram lang na kikhae lan khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze a seepaw nynh a kuih kha a bawipaw Abraham phae kaw nung zah tuh-e kong lante bya a kinku.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Oute tuh-e seepaw nynh a bawipaw kalauh sa haw kha cciakhae zah a bawipaw kya-e ahoypaw lasung aphuinphuin kha phu zah Mesopotamia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mesopotamia </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hynh </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Aram-naharaim </char><char style="ft" closed="false">a ci hae.</char></note> ram Nahor khua lang a thokuh vae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuh-e seepaw nynh khua atolang e tuisung pe khe kalauh hae kha a ryasah hae; tuh-e ccyh tuh zetesang, nopi hae nynh tui the lan a ccia ccyh hae nynh thua. <verse number="12" style="v" />Te seepaw nynh sawsang zah, “Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, ka bawipaw Abraham Pachia, atunin ka laan ka sui yn uasahpah lah ka bawipaw Abraham kya apaleihkuh leipaw na lungzinaw kha tynsah tua. <verse number="13" style="v" />Kae tuh hynh-e tuisung pe khe ka thadyn zah khuaccaaw hae mih ccanung hae tuh tui the lan oun cceih vae hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Liaccanung kyakhe, ‘Thawccinawte tui ka nia ccaw, na tui-re kha beih yn pyatua,’ cite ka ho zah, ‘Neih ccaleih, na kalauh hae kha mah tui kae niasahpah cih hae,’ cite a hopaw liaccaw tuh na seepaw Isak hanlan na popaw thuasah. Tuhte athua zetuh ka bawipaw kya apaleihkuh leipaw na lungzinaw kha na tynsah vae cipaw ka nyh cih,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A sawsangnaw athang mawkhe Rebekah tuh a tui-re kha a raw vawlan yn khangkuh zah yn thua vae. Rebekah tuh Bethuel ccanung thua zah Bethuel tuh Abraham neitaw Nahor zu Milkah a ccapaw nynh thua. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuh-e liaccanung tuh myarya do ry um zah pise nynh a ikhae loh leipaw liaccady nynh thua. Aning nynh tuisung lang cceihbung zah a tui-re kya tui a the koute a cceihthung. <verse number="17" style="v" />Oute seepaw nynh liaccanung kha tungku khylan ccuenua zah, “Thawccinawte na tui-ung kya-e tui beihtaraw kae niatua,” a cipya. <verse number="18" style="v" />Aning nynh, “Ka bawipaw, neih ccaleih,” cih zah a tui-re kha a kuih kya nya kangmaw zah seepaw kha a niasah. <verse number="19" style="v" />Seepaw kha tui he a pya koute liaccanung nynh, “Na kalauh hae hanlan mah tui phe a byn lan hae, ka la thepah ung cih hae,” a cipya. <verse number="20" style="v" />Te tui-re kya-e tui kha tui nianawpaw banang lungkhu lang arangte ccae zah tui the khylan tuisung lang bua ccue zah kalauh hae balyn hanlan tui a thepya hae. <verse number="21" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka khuaccongnaw kya laansui-uanaw yn pya tou, yn pya khyh tou cipaw ny nawlan pisepaw nynh liaccanung kha yccae leite phang a do.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kalauh hae tui he neih kou hae te, pisepaw nynh naduh kya huingkupaw sui ngawmuh aripaw te kia haw aripaw suikhawccan ccangning kha poh thuaa zah, <verse number="23" style="v" />“Hum ccanung mou na thua? Yn hopya tua. Khuazi kae rya nawlan na paaw inn kya akhaan a um tou?” cite a khia. <verse number="24" style="v" />Liaccanung nynh, “Kae tuh Nahor zu Milkah ccapaw Bethuel a ccanung nynh ka thua,” a cipya. <verse number="25" style="v" />Te “Aroupaw loohku hae, ae lanpaw patae te khuazi ryanaw lanpaw hmin mah kae hoi,” a cipya. <verse number="26" style="v" />Pisepaw nynh a lu bakhung zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha beik zah, <verse number="27" style="v" />“Ka bawipaw hanlan atynpaw a sungsahnaw te a lungzinaw kha a zosah leipaw, ka bawipaw Abraham Pachia, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh thehoyte um sah. Ka bawipaw a uno hae inn lang cceihpaw laanpi kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh yn cciakhae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Oute liaccanung nynh ccue zah a nung inn kyakhe e konglang balyn kha a hopya hae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Rebekah nynh Laban cikuhpaw rae lu kheit a hoi; Laban nynh pisepaw umnaw tuisung lang a ccue. <verse number="30" style="v" />Laban nynh a ccianung naduh kya a huingkupaw te a kuih kya-e khawccan hae kha muih zah, “Pisepaw nynh tuhte nynh yn hopya,” cite a ccianung Rebekah nynh a hopaw kha he a thae tuh, tuisung kya kalauh hae pe a thadynpaw pisepaw kalan a cceih. <verse number="31" style="v" />Laban nynh, “Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hythua a pyapaw, kae inn lang yn cceih; pawcce atolang phang na thadyn? Inn te kalauh hae hanlan hmin kha phe ka paccyn kou vae,” a cipya. <verse number="32" style="v" />Tukeiccuze pisepaw tuh inn lungkhu lang a tee; te Laban nynh kalauh hae mih uccaw kha khahpah hae zah, aroupaw loohku hae te ae lanpaw kha a pya hae, te pisepaw te a umkheih hae paw ccungccaw hae nynh mih ccu a singku nawlan hae paw tui kha a pya hae. <verse number="33" style="v" />Oute pisepaw a malang khe ae lanpaw looh kha a nungpya. Thuasalama pisepaw nynh, “Ho lan ka hoipaw kha ka ho maw tuh ka ae lan khyh,” a ci. Laban nynh, “Hotua,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tukeiccuze pisepaw nynh, “Kae hynh Abraham seepaw nynh ka thua. <verse number="35" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka bawipaw kha hythua patae pya zah a hoirumpaw lang a tang vae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh tuuphu, vaetua phu, sui, phua, seepaw hae te seenung hae, kalauh hae te lann hae kha a pya. <verse number="36" style="v" />Te ka bawipaw zu Sarah nynh he a taw vae khe, ka bawipaw hanlan ccapaw lu kheit a saahpya; te a hoipaw balyn kha a ccapaw pong a pya vae. <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka bawipaw nynh bya yn kinsakuh zah hynhte yn hopya: ‘Ka umnaw ram e Kanaan ccungccaw hae mih ccanung hae kha ka ccapaw zu lang na dypah lan khyh; <verse number="38" style="v" />ka paaw inn lang te ka uno hae kalan na cceih cih zah ka ccapaw hanlan zu na dypah cih,’ cite yn tawsya. <verse number="39" style="v" />Kae nynh ka bawipaw kha, ‘Nopinung nynh kamaw kha zui leite yn um kho,’ ka cipah zah, <verse number="40" style="v" />ka bawipaw nynh, ‘<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang a cceihpaw nynh ka thua; tuh-e <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a vaawccungccaw kha nang te cciakheih lan ae sawpah cih zah na laansui kha ae uasahpah cih. Ka ccapaw hanlan ka uno hae kya-e, ka paaw innbyn kya-e zu kha na dypah cih. <verse number="41" style="v" />Oute ka uno hae kya na thua zetuh bya kae kinsakupaw kyate na lue cih; minmin nynh nopinung kha ae pya khyh hae zemah bya kae kinsakupaw kyate na lue cih,’ yn cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Atunin tuisung kya ka thua lyaze saw ka sang zah, ‘Ka bawipaw Abraham Pachia, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, ka khuaccongnaw hynh ka laansui nae uasahpya zetuh, <verse number="43" style="v" />tuisung pe ka thadyn lya, tui the lan yn cceihpaw liaccanung kyakhe, “Thawccinawte na tui-re kya-e tui beihtaraw kha nia lan yn pyatua,” cite ka hopah cih zah, <verse number="44" style="v" />aning nynh kamaw kha, “Neih ccaleih, na kalauh hae hanlan kha mah tui ka la the cih,” cite yn khungpaw liaccanung tuh ka bawipaw ccapaw hanlan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a paccynpaw nopi thuasah,’ ka ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />“Ka thinlung kya ka sawsangnaw athang mawkhe Rebekah tuh a tui-re kha a raw vawlan yn khangkuh zah yn thua vae; te tuisung lang cceihbung zah tui a the. Kae nynh amaw kha, ‘Thawccinawte tui beih yn niasah,’ ka cipya. <verse number="46" style="v" />Aning nynh a tui-re kha a raw kyate nya kangmaw zah, ‘Neih ccaleih, na kalauh hae kha mah tui kae niasahpah cih hae,’ a ci. Tukeiccuze ka neih zah, aning nynh kalauh hae kha mah a niasah hae. <verse number="47" style="v" />Oute, ‘Hum ccanung mou na thua?’ cite ka khia zah aning nynh, ‘Milkah nynh Nahor a saahpyapaw, Nahor ccapaw Bethuel ccanung nynh ka thua,’ a ci. Tukeiccuze naduhnakahuing kha a naduh kya ka huingsah zah khawccan hae kha a kuih kya ka nawsaku. <verse number="48" style="v" />Te ka lu kha ka bakhung zah, ka bawipaw a unopaw ccanung kha ka bawipaw a ccapaw zu lang dy khylan ahmepaw laanpi yn cciakhaepaw, ka bawipaw Abraham Pachia, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha ka beik zah the ka hoysah. <verse number="49" style="v" />Tukeiccuze atu, nanning nynh ka bawipaw kha thanccingte thaw na ccih cih oh tou, na ccih lan khyh oh tou cipaw yn hopah oh, tuhteze nynh kae nynh ranglang laanpi khyhze voilang laanpi ka zuithya cih,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Oute Laban te Bethuel nynh, “E uccaw hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kyate yn thuapaw thua zah kaening nynh athya ahoy kha kae hopah kho khyh. <verse number="51" style="v" />Dotua, Rebekah tuh na malang phang um, amaw kha ko lah cceih oh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ho vae thyhte Rebekah tuh na bawipaw a ccapaw zu lang tangsah,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Abraham seepaw nynh mih bya kha he a thae tuh, laephi kya bakhung zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a beik. <verse number="53" style="v" />Te seepaw nynh phua, sui te boeining hae kha thuaa zah Rebekah kha a pya; a nung te a raeepaw kha mah amee rupaw lasung a pya hae. <verse number="54" style="v" />Oute seepaw te a umkheih hae paw pise hae tuh ae hae, neih hae zah khuazi tuh tuin kya a rya hae. Awkhua he a tho hae tuh seepaw nynh, “Ka bawipaw kalan kae la ki ccavae,” a cipya hae. <verse number="55" style="v" />A nung te a raeepaw nynh, “Liaccanung tuh kaemaw kya azyahua nin haw loukaw sohsoh umbua hin sah; tukoute a cceih cih,” a ci hae. <verse number="56" style="v" />Thuasalama seepaw nynh, “Accyh yn rosah nan vae oh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka khuaccongnaw kha laansui phe yn uasahpya vae; ka bawipaw kalan beih yn kisah ccavae oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="57" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “Liaccanung kha kae ko cih zah kae khia cih,” a ci hae. <verse number="58" style="v" />Te minmin nynh Rebekah kha ko hae zah, “E ccungccapaw kya na cceihbua cih tou?” cite khia hae zah, aning nynh, “Ka cceihbua cih,” a ci. <verse number="59" style="v" />Tukeiccuze mih ccianung Rebekah te Rebekah a do-oihtu kha Abraham seepaw te a ccungccaw hae kyakhe a cciasah bua hae. <verse number="60" style="v" />Te minmin nynh Rebekah kha hythuapya hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Kae ccianung, nang tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw athong patae nung lang</para>
  <para style="q2">la tang vae ii;</para>
  <para style="q1">na ciihan hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih rhaw hae khua kha</para>
  <para style="q1">la tae vae hae sah,” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Te Rebekah te a see liaccaw hae nynh kalauh hae kha ccikuh hae zah seepaw kha a zui vae hae; tukeiccuze seepaw nynh Rebekah kha ko zah a cceih vae hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Negeb kya khuasahpaw Isak tuh Beer-lahai-roi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.62 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Beer-lahai-roi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw tuh </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Oun muihtu Ahiinpaw Pachia tuisung </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw nynh thua.</char></note> kyate yn thua. <verse number="63" style="v" />Zetesang khe Isak nynh ramkaw lang a cceih; te ngaw he a do tuh kalauh hae oun cceih hae paw kha a muih. <verse number="64" style="v" />Te Rebekah nynh dothung zah Isak kha he a muih tuh kalauh tungvaw te arangte rung zah, <verse number="65" style="v" />seepaw kyakhe, “Aening te tungku khylan ramkaw kya yn cceihpaw pisepaw khuh hummou?” cite a khia. Seepaw nynh, “Ka bawipaw nynh thua,” cite a khung. Tukeiccuze Rebekah nynh mae kya bongkupaw boei kha lah zah a bongku. <verse number="66" style="v" />Te seepaw nynh a la cyipaw atyn-are kha Isak kya a hopya. <verse number="67" style="v" />Oute Isak nynh Rebekah kha a nung Sarah bu lungkhu lang a teekhae. Aning nynh Rebekah kha ko zah a zu lang a tang vae; Isak nynh Rebekah kha a sungsah. Tukeiccuze Isak tuh a nungchih koute Rebekah liate lungtangnaw a mue.</para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ccangpaw Abraham Ciihan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:32-33">1Sh 1.32-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abraham nynh ccangpaw zu a min Keturah cikuhpaw kha dy zah, <verse number="2" style="v" />Keturah nynh Zimran, Jokshan, Medan, Midian, Ishbak te Shuah kha a saahpya. <verse number="3" style="v" />Jokshan tuh Sheba te Dedan mih paaw nynh thua. Dedan ccapaw hae tuh Asshurim, Letushim, te Leummim nynh thua hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Midian ccapaw hae tuh Efah, Efer, Hanok, Abida te Eldaah nynh thua hae. Tuh-e hae balyn tuh Keturah ccaawno hae nynh thua hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Abraham nynh a hoipaw balyn kha Isak a pya. <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuasalama Abraham nynh amaw a hiin lyakhe a lovaenung te a saah hae paw ccapaw hae kha lasung pya hae zah a ccapaw Isak kyate asawnaw nithua lang umpaw ram kalan a cciasah hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Abraham Chinaw te Uunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Abraham tuh za kheit sung sari kum pangaw cia a she sae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Abraham tuh a hiinkhua sae zah kou a tawthya, te accyh zaw tuh a chih. Amaw kha a ccungccaw hae kalan khe a sueluabua hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />A ccaaw hae Isak te Ishmael nynh Makpelah lungkaryn kyakhe a uu hae, tuh-e lungkaryn tuh Mamre nithua lang umpaw Hit ccungccapaw Zohar ccapaw Efron loo kya nynh a um, <verse number="10" style="v" />tuh-e loo tuh Abraham nynh Hit ccungccaw hae kyate a la repaw nynh thua. Tuin kyakhe Abraham tuh a zu Sarah te a uukheih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:3-16">Gen 23.3-16</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Abraham a chih koute Pachia nynh a ccapaw Isak kha hythua a pya. Te Isak nynh Beer-lahai-roi khe khua a sah.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ishmael Ciihan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:28-31">1Sh 1.28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />E hae tuh Abraham ccapaw Ishmael ciihan nynh thua hae, Ishmael tuh Sarah seenung a thuapaw Izip ccungccanung Hagar nynh Abraham a saahpyapaw nynh thua. <verse number="13" style="v" />E hae tuh Ishmael ccapaw hae mih min thua zah mih puinaw azuiku thyhte nynh thua: Ishmael a ccatawccaw tuh Nebaioth nynh thua; te Kedar, Adbeel, Mibsam, <verse number="14" style="v" />Mishma, Dumah, Massa, <verse number="15" style="v" />Hadad, Tema, Jetur, Nafish, te Kedemah nynh thua hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />E hae tuh Ishmael ccapaw hae mih min, mih khua te mih umnaw hmin thyhte thua zah, mih phin thyhte bawi lu haw lae ning nynh thua hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />(Ishmael tuh za kheit sung thum kum sari cia a she sae; aning tuh a hy thang zah a chih, te a ccungccaw hae kalan khe a sueluabua hae.) <verse number="18" style="v" />Ishmael ciihan hae tuh Havilah kyate Shur kyacia a um hae. Tuh-e ram tuh Izip ram nithua lang, Assiria lang ccianaw laanpi kya nynh a um; aning tuh a ccungccaw hae balyn pepan khe nynh a um.</para>
  <para style="s1">Esau te Jakob Puinaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ROM 9:10-12">Rom 9.10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Abraham ccapaw Isak a ciihan hae tuh hynh-e hae nynh athua hae: Abraham tuh Isak a paaw nynh thua, <verse number="20" style="v" />Isak nynh kum sung pali he acih te Rebekah kha a dy, Rebekah tuh Mesopotamia ram umpaw Aramean minphuin Bethuel ccanung thua zah Aram minphuin Laban ccianung nynh thua. <verse number="21" style="v" />Isak a zu tuh a tiin keiccuze Isak nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan saw a sang; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a sawsangnaw kha thaepah zah a zu Rebekah tuh ccaaw a poi. <verse number="22" style="v" />A lungkhu e imua hae tuh lu kheit te lu kheit a dyykuh hae; te a nung nynh, “Hynhcite a cyiku lanze pawcce ryakhae ka la hiin?” a ci. Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha khia khylan a cceih. <verse number="23" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Na vue kya minphuin</para>
  <para style="q2">phuin ning a um,</para>
  <para style="q1">na saahpaw minphuin phuin ning hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">phia athua cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">lu kheit tuh ccangpaw lu kheit laeze</para>
  <para style="q2">a thawsaehua cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">atawccapaw nynh asoipaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">rya a lawpah cih,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:12">Rom 9.12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ccaaw pui ccyh yn zaw tuh a vue kya ccaawphei hae paw a la um hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Masaty a puipaw tuh se zah a pyn balyn tuh aming saepaw boeining nynh alo; tukeiccuze Esau cite min a phu hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Tukoute a neitaw he yn pui tuh a upaw Esau ccukhung kha phang a kyng; tukeiccuze Jakob cite min a phu hae. Minmin a pui lya hae tuh Isak tuh kum sung taruh acih vae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Imua hae tuh he oun lethung hae zah Esau tuh sawkawthyapaw lang yn tang, rampou a huapaw lang yn tang. Jakob tuh daebabipaw thua zah bu kya a um thyapaw nynh thua. <verse number="28" style="v" />Isak nynh Esau a kawpaw saw kha palei a ae keiccuze Esau kha a sungsah; thuasalama Rebekah nynh Jakob kha a sungsah.</para>
  <para style="s1">Esau nynh Ccatawccaw Thuanaw A Zua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Vaekheit tuh Jakob nynh bia ehang la sah lyakhe Esau tuh rampounaw kyate yn thua zah myarya a vuelaw. <verse number="30" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Esau nynh Jakob kha, “Myarya ka vuelaw, asepaw aepaw abang kha beih yn dang,” a cipya. (Tukeiccuze Esau kha Edom<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25.30 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Edom </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw hynh Hebru bya kyaze </char><char style="fq" closed="false">asepaw </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cite roi apoupaw te nynh aloku.</char></note> cite a ko hae.) <verse number="31" style="v" />Jakob nynh, “Ccatawccaw na thuanaw kha masaty yn zuapah,” a ci. <verse number="32" style="v" />Esau nynh, “Ka chih vae cih; ccatawccaw thuanaw nynh kamaw hanlan ccungkianaw pawmou a um cih?” a ci. <verse number="33" style="v" />Jakob nynh, “Masaty bya yn kinpakuh,” a ci. Tukeiccuze Esau nynh byakinpakuh zah ccatawccaw a thuanaw kha Jakob kalan phe a zua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:16">Heb 12.16</ref></char></note> <verse number="34" style="v" />Oute Jakob nynh a pyapaw sanlou te bia ehang kha Esau nynh ae zah a nia, te thokuh zah a cceih vae. Tuhcite Esau nynh ccatawccaw a thuanaw kha pawlangria khyh.</para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Gerar te Beersheba kya Isak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abraham she lya-e langmaw ccakannaw a pui apiaze tuh-e ram kya ccangpaw ccakannaw a pui. Tukeiccuze Isak tuh Filistin hae mih Siapharan Abimelek umnaw Gerar khua lang a cceih. <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Isak kya langkuh zah, “Izip ram lang cceihbung nan; kae muihsah cih paw ram kya khuasah tua. <verse number="3" style="v" />E ram kya ramccang ccungccaw hawte umtua, nang kha kae umkhae cih zah hythua kae pya cih; pawccecize e ram balyn hynh namaw te na ciihan hae kae pya cih oh zah na paaw Abraham kya ka kinkupaw byakinnaw kha ka ccingsah cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.3-4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:16-18">Gen 22.16-18</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Na ciihan tuh vaawlui e riatae lei awsi zeih kae pungzaesah cih zah, e ram balyn hynh ka pya cih hae; te laephi vaw e minphuin balyn tuh na ciihan liate hythuanaw a ccou cih hae, <verse number="5" style="v" />pawccecize Abraham nynh ka bya kha ngae zah ka kawbya hae balyn kha a zui,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Isak nynh Gerar kyakhe khua a sah. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuh-e ram kya umpaw ccungccaw hae nynh a zu kong kha he khia hae ze, Isak nynh, “Aning tuh ka ccianung nynh thua,” a ci; pawccecize “Ka zu,” cite ho lan a rih, “Rebekah tuh a puithyapaw thua zah tuin ram e ccungccaw hae nynh Rebekah keiccuze kamaw kha yn theihsei cih hae,” cite a tuaku.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:13">Gen 12.13</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 20:2">20.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Isak nynh tuin kya khaw a um tuh, a zu Rebekah te a balokuh hae paw kha Filistin hae Siapharan Abimelek nynh thanlan-aw kyate do zah a muih. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Abimelek nynh Isak kha ko zah, “Rebekah tuh na zu khaw athua! Pawcce, ‘Aning tuh ka ccianung nynh thua,’ na ci?” cite a khia. Isak nynh, “Aning keiccuze ka chihsei cih cite ka tua keiccu nynh thua,” a cipya. <verse number="10" style="v" />Abimelek nynh, “Pawcce kae tungvaw hynhte na cyi? Lukhakheit nynh na zu kha zoikadeih lan a ikhaesei ze kae tungvaw hoyleinaw kha na thuakhae cih,” a ci. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Abimelek nynh ccungccaw balyn kha raeringnaw pya hae zah, “Humhung zemah e ccungccapaw hynh thuasah, a zu hynh thuasah a typaw tuh chia athua cih,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Isak nynh tuh-e ram kya ccacii ccou zah tuh-e kum kya aleit za kheit a rue. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh amaw kha hythuapya zah, <verse number="13" style="v" />Isak tuh a hoirum; aning nynh houhouh hoirum zah myarya a hoirumpaw lang a tang. <verse number="14" style="v" />Aning nynh tuuphu hae, vaetua phu hae te see patae a hoi keiccuze Filistin hae nynh a tungvaw eiungnaw a hoi hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />(A paaw Abraham she lyaze a paaw see hae nynh a la thae hae paw tuisung balyn kha Filistin hae nynh laephi phe beih lan a thei hae.) <verse number="16" style="v" />Te Abimelek nynh Isak kha, “Kaemaw kyate cceih ccavae; nang tuh kaening laeze eih na lesaehua vae,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Isak nynh tuin kyate pou zah Gerar vahue kyakhe khua a sah. <verse number="18" style="v" />A paaw Abraham she lyaze la thae hae zah, Abraham he a chih te Filistin hae nynh laephi a la thei hae paw tuisung hae kha Isak nynh bua a thae; tuh-e tuisung hae kha a paaw nynh min a la phu hawte Isak nynh min a phu hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Isak see hae nynh vahue kya he a thae hae tuh tuidy ccangkheit a muih hae, <verse number="20" style="v" />Gerar khua e sahiin rintu hae nynh Isak sahiin rintu hae te pekuh hae zah, “Tui hynh kae tui nynh thua,” a ci hae. Tuhte minmin nynh amaw te a luakuh hae keiccuze Isak nynh tuh-e tuisung tuh Esek cite min a phu. <verse number="21" style="v" />Oute Isak see hae nynh ccangpaw tuisung bua thae hae zah, tuh-e tuisung mah bua a luakuh hae keiccuze Isak nynh Sitnah cite min a phu. <verse number="22" style="v" />Aning nynh tuin kyate nuekuh zah ccangpaw tuisung kha a thae, tuh-e tuisung tuh luakuh vae khyh hae, tukeiccuze tuh-e tuisung tuh Rehoboth cite min a phu, te aning nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh aening hanlan umnaw hmin kha atu yn pya vae zah, e ram kya ah pungthung vae cih oh,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Isak tuh tuin kyate Beersheba lang a cceihthung. <verse number="24" style="v" />Te tuh-e khuazi ccaccei khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Isak kya langkuh zah, “Kae tuh na paaw Abraham Pachia nynh ka thua; rih nan, pawccecize nang kha kae umkhae zah, ka seepaw Abraham liate hythua kae pya cih zah na ciihan kha patae kae pungzaesah cih,” a cipya. <verse number="25" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Isak nynh tuin kya silawhang ccangkheit rae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min kha a ko, te a bu kha tuin kya sak zah a see hae nynh tuisung ccangkheit a thae hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Isak te Abimelek Byakinkunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Oute Abimelek tuh tuanaw pyatu Ahuzzath, a rhawbawipaw Fikol ryte Gerar khua kyate Isak kalan a cceih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:22">Gen 21.22</ref></char></note> <verse number="27" style="v" />Isak nynh minmin kha, “Nanning tuh kamaw kha nae hua oh zah nae kyate nae dee oh paw khaw na thua oh, pawccemou ka kalan nae ccia oh?” a ci hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nang kha ae umkhae cipaw ccaerarih lan kae muih vae; tukeiccuze nang te kaening laku thyalawkute byakinnaw rae oh sih, <verse number="29" style="v" />tuhteze nynh na tungvaw ahoy leipaw rae leite hoyte daenaw te kae cciasah hawte kaening tungvaw kya ahoy leipaw na rae lan khyh. Nang tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hythua a pyapaw nynh na thua,” a cipya hae. <verse number="30" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Isak nynh poi tuapah hae zah ae hae zah a neih hae. <verse number="31" style="v" />Minmin nynh awkhua takaw te tho hae zah lu kheit te lu kheit thyalawkute byakinnaw kha a rae hae; te Isak nynh minmin kha dohaw hae zah daenaw te a cceih vae hae. <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuh-e nin khe Isak see hae nynh oun thua hae zah tuisung a thae hae paw kong kha Isak kyakhe, “Kaening nynh tui kae muih vae,” cite a hopya hae. <verse number="33" style="v" />Aning nynh tuh-e tuisung kha Shibah cite min a phu; tukeiccuze tuh-e khua min tuh atunin cia Beersheba cite a ko hae. <verse number="34" style="v" />Esau nynh kum sung pali he acih tuh Hit ccungccaw Beeri ccanung Judith te Hit ccungccapaw Elon ccanung Basemath kha zu lang a dy hae; <verse number="35" style="v" />tuh-e nopi hae nynh Isak te Rebekah kha mih lungvawsaw sah hae.</para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Isak nynh Jakob Hythua Pya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Isak tuh taw vae zah a mitmoh keiccuze ngawmuih kho vae khyh. A ccatawccaw Esau kha, “Ka ccapaw,” cite ko zah Esau nynh, “Hein kya mang ka um,” a ci. <verse number="2" style="v" />Isak nynh, “Ka taw vae zah ka chih cih nin kha ka nyh khyh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tukeiccuze na zunghe hae, na the te na li kha lawkuh lah ramkaw lang sawde lan la cceih lah saw yn kawpya tua. <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka chi maw hythua kae pya ccaw, leih ka rythyapaw, kou thuapaw looh kha yn paccynpah lah, ka ae lan yn pyatua,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Isak nynh a ccapaw Esau a hopyapaw kha Rebekah nynh zya a la ngae. Tukeiccuze Esau nynh sawkaw lan zah thuakhae lan cite ramkaw lang a ccia lyakhe, <verse number="6" style="v" />Rebekah nynh a ccapaw Jakob kha, “Na paaw nynh na upaw Esau kyakhe, <verse number="7" style="v" />‘Ka chi maw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang nang kha hythua kae pya ccaw, saw yn kaw lah kou thuapaw looh kha ka ae lan yn paccynpah,’ cite a hopyapaw kha phe ka thae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ka ccapaw, kaw kae pyapaw ka bya thyhte cyitua. <verse number="9" style="v" />Na paaw nynh leih a rythya hawte, kou thuapaw looh kha na paaw elang ka paccynpya ccaw, miaa phu kalan la cceih lah miaa taraw sa ning kha yn po lah yn thuakhae; <verse number="10" style="v" />a chi maw hythua ae pya ccaw, tuh-e looh tuh na paaw a ae lan na cciakhae cih,” a cipya. <verse number="11" style="v" />Thuasalama Jakob nynh a nung Rebekah kha, “Ka upaw Esau tuh a mingrungpaw thua zah kae tuh ngesaw anaepaw nynh ka thua. <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka paaw nynh poh yn haetua zetuh, yn lingpaw nynh thua cite yn tua cih zah ka tungvaw hythuapya leite thya yn lawsei cih,” a cipya. <verse number="13" style="v" />A nung nynh, “Ka ccapaw, na tungvaw thyalawnaw ccaw lan accan lanze, ka tungvaw ccah vae sah, ka bya kha ngaete cceih lah miaa taraw hae kha yn thuakhae,” a cipya. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze aning nynh cceih zah miaa taraw hae kha a nung kalan a thuakhae; te a nung nynh kou thuapaw looh kha a paaw nynh leih a ry hawte a paccynpya. <verse number="15" style="v" />Oute Rebekah nynh a ccatawccaw Esau kya-e innvaw umpaw boeining ahoy huaccepaw kha lah zah a ccasoi Jakob kha a lawsaku; <verse number="16" style="v" />te miaa taraw phua kha a ccapaw kuih kya te a ming um leinaw a nging kyakhe a voipya. <verse number="17" style="v" />Oute a paccynpaw kou thuapaw looh te sanlou kha a ccapaw Jakob kha a pya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Te Jakob nynh a paaw kalan cceih zah, “Apang,” cite ko zah a paaw nynh, “Hein kya mang ka um, ka ccapaw, nang tuh hummou na thua?” a ci. <verse number="19" style="v" />Jakob nynh a paaw kha, “Na ccatawccaw Esau nynh ka thua. Nae hopya hawte phe kae cyi vae; thokuh lah dahungtua, hythua nae pya ccaw, saw kae kawpyapaw hynh aetua ccavae,” a cipya. <verse number="20" style="v" />Thuasalama Isak nynh a ccapaw kha, “Ka ccapaw, hynhcih arang lante nae thuakhaepaw hynh pawtemou athua?” cite khia zah Jakob nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh ka laan ka sui yn uasahpya keiccu nynh thua,” a cipya. <verse number="21" style="v" />Oute Isak nynh Jakob kha, “Ka ccapaw, nang hynh ka ccapaw Esau na thuate na thua khyh kha ny nawlan haetua kae ry zah ka kalan yn naeku tua,” a ci. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Jakob nynh a paaw Isak kalan naekuh zah a paaw nynh haetua zah, “Roi tuh Jakob roi nynh thua, thuasalama kuih tuh Esau kuih nynh thua,” a ci. <verse number="23" style="v" />A kuih tuh a upaw Esau kuih hawte a mingrung keiccuze a paaw nynh syntaw khyh zah hythua a pya. <verse number="24" style="v" />A paaw nynh, “Nang hynh ka ccapaw Esau na thua ccaccing tou?” cite bua khia zah, “Ka thua,” a cipya. <verse number="25" style="v" />Oute a paaw nynh, “Saw tuh yn cciakhae tua, tuh-e tuh ka ae cih zah hythua kae pya cih,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze Jakob nynh saw kha cciakhae zah a paaw nynh a ae; te misutui kha cciakhae zah a paaw nynh a nia. <verse number="26" style="v" />Oute a paaw Isak nynh Jakob kha, “Ka ccapaw, yn naekuh lah yn myngtua,” a cipya. <verse number="27" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Jakob nynh naekuh zah a paaw kha a myng; te Isak nynh a boeining myng kha thae zah Jakob kha hythua a pya, te a paaw nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Ka ccapaw myng tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hythuapyapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">loram myng te nynh a loku.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.27-29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:20">Heb 11.20</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pachia nynh vaawlang e</para>
  <para style="q2">vuiraw kha thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">laephi kya-e lae hoy kha thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">looh patae te misutui patae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasah ae pya vae sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">na rya ae lawpah hae sah lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">minphuin hae nynh na malang</para>
  <para style="q2">bakhung hae sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">Na uno hae kya bawi lang tang lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">na nung ccapaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">na malang bakhung hae sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">Nang kha thya ae lawpaw miakaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">thyalaw thua sah lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">nang kha hythua ae pyapaw miakaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">hythuapya thua sah,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:3">Gen 12.3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Esau tuh Hythuanaw A Shung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Isak nynh Jakob hanlan hythuapyapaw he a thangsah te, Jakob tuh a paaw Isak kyate zya he a pou lyakhe, a upaw Esau tuh sawdenaw kyate yn thua vae. <verse number="31" style="v" />Esau nynh mah kou thuapaw looh kha paccynpah zah a paaw kalan a ccyngpya. Te a paaw kha, “Apang, hythua nae pya ccaw, na ccapaw nynh kae kawpyapaw saw hynh ae lan thokuh lah dahungtua,” a cipya. <verse number="32" style="v" />A paaw Isak nynh, “Hummou na thua?” cite khia zah, Esau nynh, “Na ccatawccaw Esau nynh ka thua,” a ci. <verse number="33" style="v" />Oute Isak nynh phe thyngku biate, “Saw yn kaw zah yn pyapaw kha hummou athua? Nang nae thua maw, saw kha pong ka ae zah hythua phe ka pya kou vae, aning tuh hythua ccoupaw athua ccaccing vae cih,” a ci. <verse number="34" style="v" />Esau nynh a paaw bya he a thae tuh myarya accae lante thawte rah zah a paaw kha, “Apang, kae mah hythua yn pyabua,” a cipya. <verse number="35" style="v" />Thuasalama a paaw nynh, “Na neitaw nynh yn ling zah na hythuanaw kha phe a lawku vae,” a cipya. <verse number="36" style="v" />Esau nynh, “Amaw kha Jakob cite minphu a la thuapaw tuh a min te phe angaekuhpaw khaw a la thua? Pawccecize vae ning yn ling vae. Aning nynh ccatawccaw thuanaw kha phe yn lawpahku zah, atu ka hythuanaw kha bua a lawku vae. Kamaw hanlan hythuanaw ccangkheit san nae hangpah vae khyh tou?” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:29-34">Gen 25.29-34</ref></char></note> <verse number="37" style="v" />Isak nynh Esau kha, “Amaw kha na bawipaw lang phe ka la rae vae, te a uno hae balyn tuh a see hae lang phe ka pya vae hae, looh te misutui kha amaw phe ka pya vae. Ka ccapaw, na hanlan pawmou kae cyipah kho vae cih?” a ci. <verse number="38" style="v" />Esau nynh a paaw kha, “Apang, hythuanaw tuh ccangkheit rou tou na hoi? Apang, kae mah hythua yn pyabua,” a cipya. Te Esau tuh accae lante thawte a rah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:17">Heb 12.17</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Oute a paaw Isak nynh khung zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Dotua, na umnaw kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">lae hoy um lan khyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ahangnaw vaawlang e</para>
  <para style="q2">vuiraw mah um lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.39-40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:20">Heb 11.20</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Na thaloi te na ryakuh cih,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 36:8">Gen 36.8</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 8:20">2Si 8.20</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2">te na neitaw kha rya na lawpah cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama he na douru te</para>
  <para style="q2">na nging kya-e a taphu kha</para>
  <para style="q1">na khyapah cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Esau Thinrianaw kyate Jakob A Ccue</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />A paaw nynh Jakob a pyapaw hythuanaw keiccuze Esau nynh Jakob kha hua zah a thinlung kya, “Ka paaw hanlan rawkhuinaw nin tuh anae vae; oute ka neitaw Jakob kha ka theih cih,” cite a tuaku. <verse number="42" style="v" />Te a ccatawccaw Esau bya kha Rebekah nynh a thae tuh, a ccasoi Jakob kha ko zah, “Na upaw Esau nynh a lungdae nawlan nang kha chia lan a paccynku. <verse number="43" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ka ccapaw, ka bya hynh ngaetua; Haran khua umpaw ka raeepaw Laban kalan la ccue, <verse number="44" style="v" />na upaw a thinrianaw phe ahoy cia Laban kya sohsoh la um, <verse number="45" style="v" />na upaw nynh na hanlan a lungdae zah a tungvaw na la cyipaw kha phe a ning cia la um; oute ccungccaw kae saw cih zah kae hoeisah cih hae. Nin kheit lungkhu nanning lu ning kha parouhte pawccemou ka shung lanpaw tuh?” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Oute Rebekah nynh Isak kha, “Hit nopi hae nynh ka hiinnaw kya eih yn khin vae hae. Jakob nynh e ram e ccungccaw hae tahawpaw Hit nopi kha zu lang a dy zetuh ka hiinnaw hynh pawmou a thane ung cih?” a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Oute Isak nynh Jakob kha ko zah hythua a pya koute byatawsya zah, “Kanaan minphuin nopi kha zu lang na dy lan khyh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Mesopotamia ram umpaw na nung a paaw Bethuel inn lang la cceih lah, na nung a raeepaw Laban ccanung hae lu kheit kha zu lang na dy cih. <verse number="3" style="v" />Ccungccaw patae paaw na thua nawlan Athunghuapaw Pachia nynh hythua ae pyasah lah a pungzaepaw te myarya alungpaw lan ae rae vae sah. <verse number="4" style="v" />Pachia nynh Abraham a pyapaw ram, atu ramccang ccungccaw hawte na umnaw ram hynh na ram lang a tang nawlan, Abraham kya-e hythuanaw kha nang ae pya vae sah,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:4-8">Gen 17.4-8</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuhcite Isak nynh Jakob kha a cciasah; te Jakob nynh Mesopotamia ram umpaw Aramean minphuin Bethuel ccapaw Laban kalan a cceih. Laban tuh Esau te Jakob mih nung Rebekah a raeepaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Esau nynh Ishmael Ccanung Zu lang A Dy</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Isak nynh Jakob kha hythuapya zah zudy lan Mesopotamia ram lang a cciasah cipaw kha Esau nynh a ny, te Isak nynh Jakob kha hythuapya zah, “Kanaan minphuin nopi kha zu lang na dy lan khyh,” cite bya a tawsyapaw te <verse number="7" style="v" />Jakob nynh a nung te a paaw bya kha ngae zah Mesopotamia ram lang a cceih cipaw kha Esau nynh a ny. <verse number="8" style="v" />Te a paaw Isak nynh Kanaan nopi hae kha ry khyh hae cipaw Esau nynh he a nyh tuh, <verse number="9" style="v" />Abraham ccapaw Ishmael a ccanung Mahalath cikuhpaw Nebaioth ccianung kha zu lang dy khylan Ishmael kalan a cceih, tuh-e nopinung tuh ccangpaw zu hae a hoi koute a dy chihpaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Bethel kya Jakob Maan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jakob nynh Beersheba kha cciataw zah Haran khua lang a cceih. <verse number="11" style="v" />Aning nynh hmin san kheit kya thua zah khuanin a ccaw vae keiccuze tuin kya a rya. Tuin kya umpaw lung ccangkheit kha lungngya lang ngya zah a ih. <verse number="12" style="v" />Te Jakob nynh maansah zah a maan kyakhe, nawkui ccangkheit tuh laephi vawlan duakuh zah adung tuh vaawlang phe a phah; Pachia kya-e vaawccungccaw hae nynh nawkui kya a kae, a rung bungthung hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:51">Joh 1.51</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Jakob pe thadyn zah, “Kae tuh na paaw Abraham Pachia, Isak Pachia, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka thua; na inaw ram hynh namaw te na ciihan kalan kae pya cih oh;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:14-15">Gen 13.14-15</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />na ciihan tuh laephi vawlan laenoi hawte alung cih zah, nang tuh nithua lang, niccaw lang, alia lang, palung lang na pazaekuh cih; namaw te na ciihan liate laephi vawlan minphuin balyn tuh hythuapya athua cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:3">Gen 12.3</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 22:18">22.18</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang kha kae umkhae zah na ccianaw takyh kya kae rin cih, te e ram lang bua kae kikhae cih; pawccecize bya kae kinpyakupaw kha ka cyi kou makhia nang kha kae cciataw lan khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="16" style="v" />Oute Jakob nynh a inaw kyate thaekuh zah, “E hmin kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a um ccaccing, tuh-e tuh ka la nyh khyh,” a ci. <verse number="17" style="v" />Aning nynh rih zah, “E hmin hynh pawcih baban ri lan um! E hmin tuh ccangpaw thua khyh, Pachia inn te vaawram thuakaw nynh thua,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Jakob nynh awkhua takaw te tho zah lungngya lang a ngyapaw lung kha lah zah lungbing lang a bing koute adungparyh khe chitui a bu. <verse number="19" style="v" />Aning nynh tuh-e hmin kha Bethel cite min a phu; masaty lyaze tuh-e khua min tuh Luz a la cikuh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Oute Jakob nynh byakinkuh zah, “Pachia nynh kae kha yn umkhae zah, ka ccianaw hynh-e laanpi kya yn do-oih zah, ae lanpaw sanlou te lawku lanpaw uccaw kha yn pya zah, <verse number="21" style="v" />ka paaw inn lang daebabi lan bua ka thua zetuh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh ka Pachia athua cih zah, <verse number="22" style="v" />lungbing lang ka bingpaw e lung hynh Pachia inn lang a tang cih; te nae pyapaw balyn kya-e pumhaw pumkheit kha kae pya ccaccing cih,” a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jakob te Rachel Tungkunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jakob nynh po cceih zah nithua lang umpaw ccungccaw hae ram kya a thua. <verse number="2" style="v" />Jakob nynh dothung zah loo kya tuisung ccangkheit te tuh-e pe a rya hae paw tuu sa thum kha a muih; pawccecize tuuphu kha tuh-e tuisung kya tui leih a niasah hae. Tuisung ahukuhpaw lung tuh myarya ale. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuu hae balyn nynh tuin kya a tungkuh vae hae ze, tuurin hae nynh tuisung ahukuhpaw lung kha nue hae zah tuu hae kha tui a niasah hae, te lung kha a umnaw kya bua leih a nung hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jakob nynh minmin kha, “Ka u te ka neitaw hae, tei te mou nae thua oh?” cite khia hae zah, minmin nynh, “Haran khua te nynh kae thua,” a ci hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Jakob nynh minmin kha, “Nahor ccapaw Laban kha na nyh oh tou?” cite khia hae zah, minmin nynh, “Kae nyh,” a ci hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Te aning nynh, “Ngedante a um tou?” cite khia hae zah, minmin nynh, “A dan, a ccanung Rachel mah tuu hae ryte yn thua cih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Te Jakob nynh, “Khuanin myarya asae ung; sahiin hae kha pynkheihlan suelua ccyh thua loh khyh. Tuu hae hynh tui niasah oh, cceih oh lah, paeesakuh hin oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuasalama minmin nynh, “Tuu hae balyn kha pynkheihlan kae suelua zah tuisung ahukuhpaw lung kha kae nue makhia tuh tui kae niasah kho khyh hae; lung kae nue koute nynh tuu hae kha tui kae niasah hae,” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuhte aning nynh minmin ryte bya a hokuh cciamang lya hae khe Rachel tuh a paaw tuu hae ryte yn thua vae; pawccecize Rachel tuh a paaw tuu a rintu nynh thua. <verse number="10" style="v" />Jakob nynh a nung raeepaw Laban ccanung Rachel te a nung raeepaw Laban a tuu hae kha a muih tuh, cceihthung zah tuisung ahukuhpaw lung kha a nue, te a nung raeepaw Laban tuu hae kha tui a niasah hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Oute Jakob nynh Rachel kha myng zah thawte a rah. <verse number="12" style="v" />Te Jakob nynh Rachel kha, “Kae tuh na paaw ccianung Rebekah ccapaw nynh ka thua,” cite a hopya; Rachel nynh ccue zah, a paaw kha a hopya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Laban nynh a ccianung ccapaw kong kha a thae tuh, tungku khylan a ccuenua; Laban nynh aning kha pom zah a myng, te a inn lang a cciakhae. Jakob nynh Laban kha a konglang pong a hopya. <verse number="14" style="v" />Laban nynh Jakob kha, “Nang tuh ka ru te ka saw ccaccing nynh na thua,” a cipya. Te Jakob tuh Laban kya sawpaw sah kheit a umbua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jakob nynh Laban Ccanung Zu lang A Dy</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Oute Laban nynh Jakob kha, “Nang tuh ka uno na thua keiccuze alakawte rya nae lawpya lan accan zawtou? Na ryalaw mee hohzeihmou?” a cipya. <verse number="16" style="v" />Laban tuh ccanung lu ning a hoi; atawccanung min tuh Leah cikuh zah asoinung min tuh Rachel acikuh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Leah mitdae tuh sungsah lan a um, thuasalama Rachel tuh a pynrua hoy zah a puithya. <verse number="18" style="v" />Jakob nynh Rachel kha a sungsah; tukeiccuze Jakob nynh, “Na ccasoinung Rachel hanlan kum sari rya kae lawpah cih,” a ci. <verse number="19" style="v" />Laban nynh, “Rachel hynh ccangpaw pise lukhakheit kha pya laeze nang kae pyapaw tuh ahoyhua; kamaw kya umbua,” a cipya. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Jakob nynh Rachel mue khylan kum sari rya a lawpya, Rachel tungvaw a hoipaw sungsahnaw keiccuze tuh-e kum sari tuh nin beihtaraw lan nynh a ria.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Oute Jakob nynh Laban kha, “Kamaw te ikheih khylan ka zu kha yn pya ccavae, pawccecize accyh phe ccing vae,” a cipya. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Laban nynh a umnaw e ccungccaw hae kha pynkheihlan suelua hae zah poi a tua. <verse number="23" style="v" />Thuasalama zete riryngmoh khe Laban nynh a ccanung Leah kha Jakob kalan a thuakhae; te Jakob nynh a ikhae. <verse number="24" style="v" />(Laban nynh a seenung Zilpah kha a ccanung Leah hanlan a thosakhaeku). <verse number="25" style="v" />Awkhua he thua tuh, Leah nynh athua cipaw Jakob nynh he nyh te, Laban kyakhe, “Pawcce ka tungvaw hynhte na cyi? Rya kae lawpyapaw kha Rachel mue khylan thua khyh tou? Pawcce nae ling?” a cipya. <verse number="26" style="v" />Laban nynh khung zah, “Kaening ram kya tuh asoinung nynh atawccanung laeze tungtuh ty phung thua khyh. <verse number="27" style="v" />Zuvaw lang na tangnaw oh hynh naw kheit ccing hin sah, te kum sari cia rya bua nae lawpya ung zetuh Rachel kha kae pya cih,” a cipya. <verse number="28" style="v" />Jakob nynh a nawccah zah zuvaw lang a tangnaw hae kha naw kheit a ccingsah; tukoute Laban nynh a ccanung Rachel kha Jakob zu lang a pya. <verse number="29" style="v" />(Laban nynh a seenung Bilhah kha a ccanung Rachel hanlan a thosakhaeku). <verse number="30" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Jakob nynh Rachel kha mah a ikhae vae, te aning nynh Rachel kha Leah laeze a sungsahua. Jakob nynh Laban kha kum sari cia rya bua a lawpya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jakob nynh Leah a sungsah khyhpaw kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh he a nyh tuh, Leah kha ccaawsaah khonaw a pya; thuasalama Rachel tuh a tiin. <verse number="32" style="v" />Leah nynh ccaawpoi zah ccapaw lu kheit a saah, a min tuh Reuben<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29.32 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Reuben </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw hynh Hebru bya te </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Muih </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cite roi apoupaw te nynh aloku.</char></note> cite a phu; pawccecize Leah nynh, “Ka vawsawnaw kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh yn muihpya vae; tukeiccuze ka vawpaw nynh yn sungsah ccaccing vae cih,” a ci. <verse number="33" style="v" />Leah nynh ccaaw bua poi zah ccapaw lu kheit saah zah, “Huanaw ka teingpaw kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh thae zah, e ccapaw hynh mah yn pya,” cih zah Semeon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29.33 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Semeon </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw hynh Hebru bya te </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Thae </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cite roi apoupaw te nynh aloku.</char></note> cite min a phu. <verse number="34" style="v" />Aning nynh ccaaw bua poi zah ccapaw lu kheit saah zah, “Ccapaw lu thum ka saahpya keiccuze atu tuh ka vawpaw nynh kamaw kya ccavyng a mungkuh vae cih,” a ci; tukeiccuze Levi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29.34 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Levi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw hynh Hebru bya te </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mungku </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cite roi apoupaw te nynh aloku.</char></note> cite min a phu. <verse number="35" style="v" />Leah nynh ccaaw bua poi zah ccapaw lu kheit saah zah, “Atu tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha the ka hoysah vae cih,” a ci; tukeiccuze Judah<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29.35 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Judah </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw hynh Hebru bya te </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Thehoysah </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cite roi apoupaw te nynh aloku.</char></note> cite min a phu; oute aning tuh a ccasaah ady vae.</para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Rachel nynh Jakob hanlan ccaaw a saahpya khyhpaw kha he nyhkuh tuh, a unung tungvaw a eiung zah Jakob kha, “Ccaaw yn pya, tuhkhyhze ka chih vae cih,” a cipya. <verse number="2" style="v" />Jakob nynh Rachel tungvaw myarya a thinria zah, “Kae tuh ccaawsaahnaw kaw ae pya leipaw Pachia lang tou nae ria?” a cipya. <verse number="3" style="v" />Oute Rachel nynh, “Ka seenung Bilhah hein kya mang um; cceih lah ikhae tua, aning tuh ccaaw a saah kho, aning liate kae zemah ccaaw ka hoi kho,” a ci. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tukeiccuze aning nynh a seenung Bilhah kha Jakob zu lang a pya; te Jakob nynh seenung kha a ikhae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Bilhah nynh ccaawpoi zah Jakob kha ccapaw lu kheit a saahpya. <verse number="6" style="v" />Oute Rachel nynh, “Pachia nynh kamaw hanlan bya yn piapya vae, ka roi kha mah Pachia nynh yn thaepah zah ccapaw lu kheit yn pya vae,” a ci; tukeiccuze Dan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30.6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Dan </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw hynh Hebru bya te </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bya a pia </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cite roi apoupaw te nynh aloku.</char></note> cite min a phu. <verse number="7" style="v" />Rachel seenung Bilhah nynh ccaaw bua poi zah Jakob kha lu ningnaw ccapaw a saahpya. <verse number="8" style="v" />Oute Rachel nynh, “Ka unung tae khylan ka zuakuh zah phe ka tae vae,” a ci; tukeiccuze Naftali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30.8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Naftali </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw hynh Hebru bya te </char><char style="fq" closed="false">zuaku </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cite roi apoupaw te nynh aloku. </char></note> cite min a phu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Leah nynh a ccasaah ady vae paw kha he a nyhkuh tuh, a seenung Zilpah kha ko zah Jakob zu lang a pya. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tukoute Leah seenung Zilpah nynh Jakob kha ccapaw lu kheit a saahpya. <verse number="11" style="v" />Te Leah nynh, “Ka vehoy,” a ci. Tukeiccuze Gad<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30.11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Gad </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw hynh Hebru bya te </char><char style="fq" closed="false">vehoy </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cite roi apoupaw te nynh aloku.</char></note> cite min a phu. <verse number="12" style="v" />Leah seenung nynh Jakob kha lu ningnaw ccapaw a saahpya. <verse number="13" style="v" />Te Leah nynh, “Lungtuanung nynh ka thua! Pawccecize nopi hae nynh a lungtuanung cite yn ko cih hae,” a ci; tukeiccuze Asher<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30.13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Asher </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw hynh Hebru bya te </char><char style="fq" closed="false">lungtua </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cite roi apoupaw te nynh aloku.</char></note> cite min a phu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ccathae rue ccyh he thua tuh, Reuben nynh cceih zah loo kya mandarek kha muih zah a nung Leah kalan a thuakhae. Rachel nynh Leah kha, “Thawccinawte na ccapaw kya-e mandarek abang kha yn pyabua,” a cipya. <verse number="15" style="v" />Thuasalama Leah nynh, “Ka vawpaw na ccuekhaepaw hynh adihpaw uccaw thua zawtou? Ka ccapaw kya-e mandarek hynh mah ccuekhae na ry ung tou?” a ci. Rachel nynh, “Na ccapaw kya-e mandarek nae pya zetuh atu khuazi Jakob te na ihkheih cih oh,” a cipya. <verse number="16" style="v" />Zete ccyh kya Jakob nynh loo kyate he yn thua tuh, Leah nynh cciadue zah, “Kamaw kalan na ryabua cih; pawccecize nang kha ka ccapaw kya-e mandarek te phe kae hoh vae,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze tuh-e khuazi kya Jakob tuh Leah te a ihkheih hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Pachia nynh Leah kha thaepah zah ccaaw a poi, te Jakob hanlan lu pangawnaw ccapaw a saahpya. <verse number="18" style="v" />Leah nynh, “Ka seenung kha ka vawpaw kalan ka pya keiccuze Pachia nynh amee yn pya,” a ci; tukeiccuze Issakhar<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30.18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Issakhar </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw hynh Hebru bya te </char><char style="fq" closed="false">amee </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cite roi apoupaw te nynh aloku.</char></note> cite min a phu. <verse number="19" style="v" />Te Leah nynh ccaawpoi zah Jakob hanlan lu taruhnaw ccapaw lu kheit a saahpya. <verse number="20" style="v" />Oute Leah nynh, “Ahoypaw lasung ccangkheit kha Pachia nynh yn pya; ccapaw lu taruh ka saahpya vae keiccuze ka vawpaw nynh kae kha yn thehoysah cih,” a ci; tukeiccuze Zebulun<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30.20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Zebulun </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw hynh Hebru bya te </char><char style="fq" closed="false">lasung ka ccou </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cite roi apoupaw te nynh aloku.</char></note> cite min a phu. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tukoute Leah nynh ccanung lu kheit saah zah Dinah cite min a phu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Oute Pachia nynh Rachel kha liathuite a bya ngaepah zah ccaawsaah khonaw a pya. <verse number="23" style="v" />Aning nynh ccaawpoi zah ccapaw lu kheit saah zah, “Saryanaw ka teingpaw kha Pachia nynh yn lawpya vae,” a ci; <verse number="24" style="v" />te Rachel nynh Josef<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30.24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Josef </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw hynh Hebru bya te </char><char style="fq" closed="false">yn pyachih </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cite roi apoupaw te nynh aloku.</char></note> cite minphu zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ccangpaw ccapaw kha yn pya hin vae sah,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jakob te Laban Hoirumnaw Neekunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Rachel nynh Josef he a saah tuh, Jakob nynh Laban kha, “Ka inn te ka ram lang yn cciasah ccavae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka ryalaw mee ka zu hae te ka ccaaw hae kha yn pya hae lah, ka la cceih ccavae; pawccecize myarya hoy lan rya kae lawpyapaw kha phe na ny,” a ci. <verse number="27" style="v" />Laban nynh Jakob kha, “Byahonaw kaw yn pyatua, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh namaw liate hythua yn pya cipaw ka ny; <verse number="28" style="v" />na ryalaw mee hokuh lah kae pya cih,” a cipya. <verse number="29" style="v" />Jakob nynh, “Pawcihtemou rya kae lawpya cipaw te pawcihtemou na sahiin hae hynh kamaw kya a um hae cipaw phe na ny. <verse number="30" style="v" />Pawccecize ka thua maw tuh beihtaraw nynh na hoi, atu tuh myarya alungthung vae; te pawpaw kya ka ccia zemah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nang kha hythua ae pya. Ka innbyn hae so hohtuhmou ka do-oih cih hae?” a cipya. <verse number="31" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Laban nynh, “Pawmou kae pya cih?” cite khia zah Jakob nynh, “Pawpaw mah nae pya lan khyh. E uccaw hynh nae cyipya zetuh na sahiin hae kha bua ka dang cih hae zah ka rin ung cih hae: <verse number="32" style="v" />atunin na sahiin hae balyn laku ka la khiakuh cih zah apyaapaw te ccapoh-ccapoh apyaapaw tuu hae te man phaphuhpaw tuu taraw miakaw, te miaa hae lakuze apyaapaw te ccapoh-ccapoh apyaapaw miakaw kha ka phia cih hae zah tuh-e hae tuh ka ryalaw mee athua cih hae. <verse number="33" style="v" />Te ka ryalaw mee kha do khylan nyalang he nae thua te, ka dingnaw nynh kamaw kha yn thungkhaw cih. Miaa hae lakuze apyaa leipaw te ccapoh-ccapoh apyaa leipaw miakaw, te tuu taraw hae lakuze man phaphuh leipaw miakaw kha he na muih zetuh ka rupaw athua cih,” a ci. <verse number="34" style="v" />Laban nynh, “Ahoy! Na ho hawte thua vae sah,” a ci. <verse number="35" style="v" />Thuasalama tuh-e nin khe Laban nynh ccapoh-ccapoh apyaapaw te apyaapaw miaatepaw hae te miaapinung hae, mih pyn kya apyaapaw miakaw te man phaphuhpaw tuu taraw miakaw kha a ccapaw hae a rinsah hae; <verse number="36" style="v" />te Jakob umnaw te amaw umnaw kha nin thum laanccia a sawsakuh hae, te Laban kya-e alaepaw tuu hae te miaa hae kha Jakob nynh a rinbia hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Oute Jakob nynh poplar thing, almond thing te plane thing ahinpaw akaran hae kha lah hae zah akaloh he kia hae tuh araw lante apyaa vae hae. <verse number="38" style="v" />Te tuu hae, miaa hae nynh tui nia lan oun ccia vae hae ze, sahpaw a dekuh ccaw hae cite tuh-e thingpyng hae kha sahiin tui nianawpaw kua malang khe a bing. <verse number="39" style="v" />Tukeiccuze tuu hae, miaa hae nynh tuh-e akaran hae malang khe sahpaw dekuh hae zah apyaapaw, ccapoh-ccapoh pyaapaw, aphae lante pyaapaw lang a than vae hae. <verse number="40" style="v" />Jakob nynh tuutaw hae kha phia hae zah Laban sahiin hae kya-e pong aman hae paw te apyaa hae paw kalan khe mih mae hawi sah hae; te a sahiin phu hae kha phia hae zah Laban sahiin hae te nungkheih khyh hae. <verse number="41" style="v" />Athawsaepaw sahiin hae nynh sahpaw he a ry vae hae ze, thingpyng hae laku khe sahpaw dekuh hae sah cite Jakob nynh thingpyng hae kha sahiin hae malang kua kyakhe a bingpya hae, <verse number="42" style="v" />thuasalama anyaa hae paw nynh sahpaw a ry hae zetuh mih malang thingpyng kha nungpah khyh hae; tukeiccuze anyaa hae paw tuh Laban kya-e thua hae zah athawsae hae paw tuh Jakob kya-e nynh thua hae. <verse number="43" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Jakob a hoirumnaw tuh lungthung zah sahiin phu patae, seepaw hae te seenung hae, kalauh hae te lann hae kha a hoi.</para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Laban kyate Jakob A Ccue</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Laban ccapaw hae nynh, “Ah paaw uccaw balyn kha Jakob nynh pong a lawku vae; ah paaw uccaw te nynh e hoirumnaw balyn hynh a mue,” cite a ho hae paw kha Jakob nynh a thae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Te Laban mah langmaw hawte a mitmae hoy vae khyh cipaw kha Jakob nynh a muih. <verse number="3" style="v" />Oute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Jakob kha, “Na minpaaw hae ram lang te na uno hae kalan ki ccavae, nang kha kae umkhae cih,” a ci. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Jakob nynh ccungccaw saw zah a sahiin phu a paeenaw hmin kalan Rachel te Leah kha kosah hae zah, <verse number="5" style="v" />“Nae paaw tuh langmaw hawte ka tungvaw a mitmae hoy vae khyh cipaw ka muih. Thuasalama ka paaw a Pachia nynh kamaw kha yn umkhae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka thawzung balyn te nae paaw kha rya ka lawpya vae cipaw phe na ny oh; <verse number="7" style="v" />tuhzemah nae paaw nynh yn ling zah ka ryalaw mee kha vae haw yn hynpya, thuasalama ka tungvaw hoyleinaw rae lan Pachia nynh ua khyh. <verse number="8" style="v" />‘Ccapoh-ccapoh apyaa hae paw tuh na ryalaw mee athua cih,’ cih zah, sahiin phu balyn nynh ccapoh-ccapoh pyaapaw lang a than hae; te ‘Apyaa hae paw tuh na ryalaw mee athua cih,’ cih zah sahiin phu balyn tuh apyaapaw lang a than hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuhcite Pachia nynh nae paaw kya-e sahiin-awvaw balyn kha lah zah kamaw kha yn pya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Sahiin hae sahpaw a dekuh hae ccyh lyaze maan ka sah, ka maan kyaze, ngaw ka la do zah sahpawdepaw miaatepaw hae tuh apyaapaw, ccapoh-ccapoh pyaapaw te pyaari-pyaaraepaw athua hae paw kha ka la muih. <verse number="11" style="v" />Oute ka maan kyakhe Pachia vaawpaw nynh, ‘Jakob,’ cite yn ko zah, ‘Hein kya mang ka um!’ ka cipya. <verse number="12" style="v" />Te aning nynh, ‘Dotua, sahpawdepaw miaatepaw balyn tuh apyaapaw, ccapoh-ccapoh pyaapaw te pyaari-pyaaraepaw cci nynh athua hae; pawccecize Laban nynh na tungvaw a cyisahnaw balyn kha ka muih vae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Kae tuh lungbing kha chitui na thuh zah kamaw kya bya na kinkunaw Bethel khua kyaze namaw kya a langkuhpaw Pachia nynh ka thua. Atu e ram hynh poutaw lah na puinaw ram lang ki ccavae,’ yn cipya,” cite a hopya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:18-22">Gen 28.18-22</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Oute Rachel te Leah nynh, “Kae paaw inn kya-e kae ccou lanpaw rho te neeku bua lanpaw paw sanmah a um zawtou? <verse number="15" style="v" />Kaening hynh ramccang ccungccaw hae lang oun riapaw kae thua khyh tou? Pawccecize kaening kha oun zua zah, oun zuanaw mee phua kha phe a mang vae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Pachia nynh kae paaw kyate a lawpaw sisua balyn tuh kaening te kae ccaaw hae kya-e nynh thua; tukeiccuze Pachia nynh ae hopyapaw miakaw kha cyih ccaleih,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Jakob nynh thokuh zah a ccaaw hae te a zu hae kha kalauh hae tungvaw a ccisaku hae; <verse number="18" style="v" />te a sahiin hae balyn, a muepaw sisua balyn, Mesopotamia ram kya a muepaw sahiin hae kha Kanaan ram umpaw a paaw Isak kalan a cciakhae vae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Laban tuh a tuuming ngo lan a ccia loukaw khe Rachel nynh a paaw innbyn kya-e pachia hae kha a rupya. <verse number="20" style="v" />Jakob nynh Aram ccungccapaw Laban kha ling zah ccue lan a paccynkupaw kha hopah khyh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuhcite Zufrates vaw kha zua zah Gilead mua langkhe a hoipaw balyn ryte a ccue.</para>
  <para style="s1">Laban nynh Jakob A Dee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nin thumnaw nin khe Jakob phe ccue vae cipaw Laban kha a hopya hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Tukeiccuze a uno hae ryte nin sari deehui hae zah Gilead mua kyakhe Jakob kha a phya hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Thuasalama Pachia nynh Aram ccungccapaw Laban kalan khuazi a maan kyakhe yn langkuh zah, “Jakob kya athya ahoy bya kaw kheit sang na ho khyh nawlan raeringkuh,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Laban nynh Jakob kha he a phah tuh, Jakob tuh mua kya bu phe la sakkuh ty vae, te Laban nynh a uno hae ryte Gilead mua kya bu a sakku bua hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Laban nynh Jakob kha, “Pawcce hynhte na cyi? Nae ling zah ka ccanung hae tuh rhaw kya-e kyng hae paw hawte na cciakhae hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Kae kha nae ling zah hopya leite pawcce aruh lante na ccue? Nae hopya zetuh lungtuanaw te, hlaw te, tintang te tyng te kae cciasah cih paw. <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka ccanung hae te ka mintaw hae kha pawcce beihsyate nae myngsah sya khyh hae? Na cyisahnaw hynh ngaeepaw nynh thua. <verse number="29" style="v" />Na tungvaw vawsawnaw kae pya kho; thuasalama na paaw a Pachia nynh atazi khe, ‘Jakob kya athya ahoy na ho khyh nawlan raeringkuh,’ yn cipya. <verse number="30" style="v" />Na paaw inn kha eih na ngae keiccuze na la cciapaw athua zeso pawcce ka pachia hae kha na ru?” a ci. <verse number="31" style="v" />Jakob nynh Laban kha, “Ka ri keiccu nynh thua, pawccecize na ccanung hae kha kamaw kyate nae luadesei cih cipaw ka tua. <verse number="32" style="v" />Na pachia hae kha a tungvaw na muih biapaw humhung zemah chia thuasah. Kae uno hae mitmuihnaw kya na uccaw tuh ccungkuh lah lawkuh,” a cipya. Rachel nynh pachia hae a la rupaw kha Jakob nynh nyh khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Laban nynh Jakob bu, Leah bu, seenung lu ning bu lungkhu lang tee zah a ccung, thuasalama a pachia hae kha muih khyh. Te aning nynh Leah bu kyate pou zah Rachel bu lungkhu lang a tee. <verse number="34" style="v" />Rachel nynh innbyn pachia hae kha lah zah kalauh khungnin kya nung zah phang a dahungthin. Laban nynh bu kya pong a ccung, thuasalama muih khyh. <verse number="35" style="v" />Rachel nynh a paaw kha, “Bawipaw, na malang ka thadyn kho khyhpaw na thinria nan sah, pawccecize nopiny ka ny ccyh nynh thua,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze Laban nynh ccung salamah innbyn pachia hae kha muih khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Oute Jakob nynh thinriate bo zah Laban kha, “Paw seinaw mou ka rae? Paw ka cyihsei zahte mou thawte nae deehui? <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka uccaw hae balyn kya pong na ccung zah na innbyn kya-e uccaw hae pawmou na muih? Aening lu ning laku na uno hae te ka uno hae nynh byapae khylan tuh-e uccaw tuh minmin malang nungtua. <verse number="38" style="v" />Namaw kya kum kuin ka um vae; na tuupinung hae te na miaapinung hae tuh mih taw thansei boi khyh hae. Na tuuphu kya-e tuutepaw hae mah ka ae boi khyh. <verse number="39" style="v" />Sarepaw hae nynh a tei hae paw mah namaw kalan kae cciakhae boi khyh; kamaw nynh hung ka rung; khuadae kya thuasah, khuazi kya thuasah a ru hae zemah kamaw kha nae ngiaru. <verse number="40" style="v" />Khuadae ccyh kya asopaw nynh yn u zah khuazi ccyh kya akyaapaw kha ka teing, i kho leite mah ka um. <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuhcite na inn kya kum kuin ka um vae; na ccanung lu ning hanlan kum haw lae pali, na sahiin phu hanlan kum taruh rya kae lawpya, ka ryalaw mee kha vae haw nae ling. <verse number="42" style="v" />Ka paaw a Pachia, Abraham Pachia, Isak nynh a ripaw Pachia nynh yn la pankhae khyh zetuh ka kuih ccakaete solei nae cciasah cih. Pachia nynh ka vawsawnaw, ka ryalawnaw kha muih zah atazi khe nang kha phe ae pe vae,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jakob te Laban Byakinkunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Oute Laban nynh Jakob kha, “E ccanung hae hynh ka ccanung hae nynh thua hae, e ccaaw hae hynh ka ccaaw hae nynh thua hae, e sahiin-awvaw hae hynh mah ka sahiin-awvaw hae nynh thua hae, na muihpaw balyn hynh ka kya-e nynh thua. Thuasalama e ka ccanung hae tungvaw thuasah, minmin nynh a saah hae paw mih ccaaw hae tungvaw thuasah, atunin pawmou ka cyih kho ung cih? <verse number="44" style="v" />Atu yn cceih lah nang te kae byakinkunaw rae sih; tuh-e tuh nang te kae laku ccaekia lang tang sah,” a ci. <verse number="45" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Jakob nynh lung ccangkheit lah zah lungbing lang a bing. <verse number="46" style="v" />Te Jakob nynh a uno hae kha, “Lung hae kha pum oh,” cipah hae zah minmin nynh lung hae kha lah hae zah lungpum lang a pum hae; te minmin nynh lungpum pe khe a ae hae. <verse number="47" style="v" />Laban nynh tuh-e lungpum tuh Jegar-sahadutha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31.47 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jegar-sahadutha </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw hynh Aramaik bya te </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ccaekia lungpum </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cite roi apoupaw te nynh aloku.</char></note> cite minphu zah Jakob nynh Galeed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31.47 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Galeed </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw hynh Hebru bya te </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ccaekia lungpum </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cite roi apoupaw te nynh aloku. </char></note> cite min a phu. <verse number="48" style="v" />Laban nynh, “Atunin hynh-e lungpum hynh nang te kae laku ccaekia ccangkheit nynh thua,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze Galeed cite min a phu, <verse number="49" style="v" />Mizpah<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31.49 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mizpah </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw hynh Hebru bya te </char><char style="fq" closed="false">donaw hmin </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cite roi apoupaw te nynh aloku. </char></note> lungbing cite mah a ko hae, pawccecize Laban nynh, “Aening lu kheit te lu kheit he ah sawkuh te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nang te kae laku oun do-oih kalang sah. <verse number="50" style="v" />Ka ccanung hae kha hoyte na ccuepe khyh hae ze thuasah, ka ccanung hae laelan zu na dychih ze thuasah, aening laku ccungccaw um khyh, nang te kae laku Pachia tuh ccaekia nynh thua cipaw kha nytua,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Oute Laban nynh Jakob kha, “Nang te kae laku ka nungpaw e lungpum te lungbing hynh dotua. <verse number="52" style="v" />Kae nynh nang kha vawsaw pya khylan e lungpum hynh ka lue lan khyh, te nang nynh kae kha dou khylan e lungpum te lungbing hynh na lue lan khyh. E lungbing te lungpum tuh nang te kae hanlan ccaekia nynh thua. <verse number="53" style="v" />Abraham Pachia, Nahor Pachia te mih paaw Pachia nynh nang te kae laku bya oun pia sah,” a cipya. Te Jakob a paaw Isak nynh a ripaw Pachia min te Jakob nynh thya a lawku. <verse number="54" style="v" />Oute Jakob nynh mua vawlan silawnaw rae zah a uno hae kha sanlou ae lan a ko hae. Te minmin nynh sanlou kha ae hae zah tuh-e khuazi tuh mua vawlan a um hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Laban nynh awkhua takaw te tho zah a mintaw hae te a ccanung hae kha myng hae zah hythua a pya hae. Te Laban nynh cceih zah a umnaw lang a ki vae.</para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Esau te Tungku lan Jakob Paccynnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jakob tuh cceih zah Pachia vaawccungccaw hae nynh amaw kha oun tungku hae; <verse number="2" style="v" />Jakob nynh minmin kha he muih hae tuh, “E hynh Pachia rhawkaw phu nynh thua,” a ci. Tukeiccuze tuh-e hmin kha Mahanaim cite min a phu. <verse number="3" style="v" />Jakob nynh locceihtu hae kha amaw malang khe Edom ram, Seir pee umpaw a upaw Esau kalan saw hae zah, <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ka bawipaw Esau kha hynhte la hopah oh: Na seepaw Jakob nynh, ‘Laban kya ramccang ccungccaw hawte atu cia ka umbua vae; <verse number="5" style="v" />vaetua hae, lann hae, tuu hae, miaa hae, seenung hae te seepaw hae kha ka hoi; te ka bawipaw, na malang maehoynaw ka mue nawlan hopya khylan ccungccaw kae saw,’ a ci cite ka bawipaw Esau kha la hopah oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Locceihtu hae nynh Jakob kalan oun ki hae zah, “Na upaw Esau kya kae thua, namaw kha tungku khylan pise za pali ryte oun cceih hae,” a cipya hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Oute Jakob tuh myarya rih zah a lungvawsaw vae; amaw te umkheih hae paw ccungccaw hae, tuu hae, miaa hae, vaetua hae te kalauh hae kha phu ning lang a phia hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Pawccecize, “Esau nynh phu kheit kha thuanua zah a ro zemah phu kheit tuh a lue cih,” cite a tua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Te Jakob nynh, “Pou ka paaw Abraham te ka paaw Isak Pachia, ‘Na ram te na uno hae kalan ki lah na tungvaw hoynaw ka rae cih,’ cite yn hopahpaw pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, <verse number="10" style="v" />Na seepaw nae muihsahpaw apaleihkuh leipaw lungzinaw balyn te atynpaw sungsahnaw balyn kya-e adih huapaw te sanmah ka ngaekuh khyh, pawccecize ka hoitang kyalya te nynh e Jordan vaw hynh ka zua; atu tuh phu ning lang ka tang vae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka upaw Esau kuih kyate beih yn luesah, pawccecize amaw kha ka rih; aning nynh yn cceih cih zah kaening balyn, nung hae ccaaw hae ryte pong oun theih vae cih. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuhzemah nang nynh, ‘Na tungvaw hoynaw ka rae ccaccing cih zah na ciihan kha riatae um leipaw rili laesia zeih lang ka rae cih,’ nae cipya,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:17">Gen 22.17</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khuazi tuh tuin kya a rya, te a hoipaw uccaw kya-e kha a upaw Esau hanlan lasung lang pya lan cite <verse number="14" style="v" />miaapinung za ning te miaatepaw sah kuin, tuu nopi za ning te tuutepaw sah kuin, <verse number="15" style="v" />kalauh mateisu sung thum te mih taw hae, vaetua pinung sung pali te tangnuapaw sa haw, lann pinung sa kuin te lanntepaw sa haw kha a po hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Khah-e hae kha aphuphute phia hae zah phu kheit ze seepaw lu kheit cci kalan ap hae zah, “Ka malang la cceih ty oh lah phu kheit te phu kheit kha sawsakuh oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Masaty a cceihpaw kha byataw zah, “Ka upaw Esau te he na tungkuh oh zah, ‘Nang hynh hum ccungccaw mou na thua? Teilangmou nae ccia? Na malang umpaw sahiin hae hynh hum kya-e mou athua hae?’ cite ae khia ze, <verse number="18" style="v" />‘Na seepaw Jakob kya-e nynh thua hae; ka bawipaw Esau namaw hanlan lasung lang ae pyapaw nynh thua hae; Jakob amaw mah kae nulang nynh a um,’ cite na hopah cih oh,” a cipya. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuhawte lu ningnaw, lu thumnaw te sahiin phu a zui hae paw balyn kha, “Esau te na tungkuh oh ze hynhte na hopah cih oh: <verse number="20" style="v" />‘Na seepaw Jakob mah kae nulang nynh a um,’ cite na hopah cih oh,” cite a taw hae. Pawccecize Jakob nynh, “Ka malang a cceih typaw lasung khate Esau kha a lung ka hoysah cih zah nyalangte he kae tungkuh te kamaw kha naw yn ccaw ze yn ccaw kho,” cite a tuaku. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tukeiccuze lasung kha amaw malang cciasah ty zah amaw tuh tuin a ryanaw hae kyakhe tuh-e khuazi tuh a rya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jakob te Vaawpaw Theikunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuh-e khuazi khe Jakob tuh thokuh zah a zu hae lu ning, a seenung hae lu ning, a ccaaw hae lu haw lae kheit kha cciakhae hae zah Jabbok vawkhu kha adeinaw kyate a zua. <verse number="23" style="v" />Aning nynh minmin kha cciakhae hae zah vaw khuraw lang a zuasah hae, tuhawte a hoipaw atyn-are kha khuraw lang a zuasah hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Jakob tuh a makhaete a umhy; te ccungccapaw te khuadae cia a theikuh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32.24-26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 12:3-4">Hos 12.3-4</ref></char></note> <verse number="25" style="v" />Ccungccapaw nynh Jakob kha ka tae vae khyh cipaw he nyh tuh, Jakob a kung kha phah a thong, te tuh-e paw te a theikuh lya hae khe Jakob a kungru tuh poh suhliakuh. <verse number="26" style="v" />Oute ccungccapaw nynh, “Oun cciasah ccavae, pawccecize khua vyavya dae vae,” a cipya. Thuasalama Jakob nynh, “Hythua nae pya khyh zetuh kae cciasah lan khyh,” a ci. <verse number="27" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ccungccapaw nynh, “Na min hummou?” cite khia zah “Jakob” cite a khung. <verse number="28" style="v" />Oute ccungccapaw nynh, “Na min tuh Jakob cikuh vae lan khyh, Israel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32.28 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Israel </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw hynh Hebru bya te </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pachia te a theikuh hae paw </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cite roi apoupaw te nynh aloku.</char></note> cikuh vae cih, pawccecize nang tuh Pachia te mah na taekuh oh, ccungccaw te mah na taekuh oh zah phe na tae hae,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32.28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:10">Gen 35.10</ref></char></note> <verse number="29" style="v" />Oute Jakob nynh, “Na min beih yn hopah,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32.29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 13:17-18">Bpt 13.17-18</ref></char></note> Thuasalama aning nynh, “Pawcce ka min tuh nae khia?” a ci. Te tuin kyakhe Jakob kha hythua a pya. <verse number="30" style="v" />Jakob nynh, “Pachia kha hawiliakute ka muih salamah ka hiin ung,” ci zah tuh-e hmin kha Peniel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32.30 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Paniel </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw hynh Hebru bya te </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pachia mae </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cite roi apoupaw te nynh aloku.</char></note> cite min a phu. <verse number="31" style="v" />Jakob nynh Peniel kyate a pou lyakhe khuanin mah he a thua, a kungru keiccuze Jakob tuh a bae. <verse number="32" style="v" />Tukeiccuze atunin cia Israel ciihan hae nynh kung kya umpaw tharuipi kha ae khyh hae, pawccecize Jakob a kung kya-e tharuipi tuh aning nynh a thongnaw nynh thua.</para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jakob te Esau Tungkunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jakob nynh dothung zah Esau te ccungccaw za pali oun ccia hae paw kha a muih. Tukeiccuze imua hae kha Leah, Rachel te seenung lu ning kyakhe a nee hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Seenung hae kha mih ccaaw hae ryte malang khe a nung hae, tukoute Leah te a ccaaw hae, te Rachel te Josef kha nulang kou khe a nung hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Jakob tuh minmin malang khe cceih zah a upaw pe a thua maw laephi kya vae sari a bakhung.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Esau nynh Jakob kha ccuenua zah phang a pom, te Jakob kha myng zah lu ning te a rawkhaekuh hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Esau nynh dothung zah nopi hae te ccaaw hae kha he muih tuh, “Namaw kya a um hae paw khuh hum hae mou?” cite khia zah Jakob nynh, “Pachia nynh na seepaw kae kha thawccinawte yn pyapaw ccaaw hae nynh thua hae,” a ci. <verse number="6" style="v" />Oute seenung hae tuh mih ccaaw hae ryte oun naekuh hae zah a bakhung hae; <verse number="7" style="v" />Leah tuh a ccaaw hae ryte oun naekuh hae zah a bakhung hae; te nyathyakou kya Josef te Rachel oun naekuh hae zah a bakhung hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Esau nynh, “Kae tungkuhpaw aphu hae balyn kha paw suilan mou athua?” cite khia zah Jakob nynh, “Ka bawipaw, na malang maehoynaw ka mue ccaw cite kae saw hae paw nynh thua,” cite a leih. <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuasalama Esau nynh, “Ka neitaw, phe azaw lan mang ka hoi; na hoipaw kha namaw hanlan nungkuh,” a cipya. <verse number="10" style="v" />Jakob nynh, “Tuhte thua khyh, na malang maehoynaw ka mue zetuh kae pyapaw lasung hynh yn lawpakuh; pawccecize hynhcite maehoynaw he ka mue tuh na mitmae muihpaw hynh Pachia mitmae muihpaw te nynh a loku. <verse number="11" style="v" />Namaw kalan kae ccyngpyapaw ka lasung hynh beih yn lawpakuh, Pachia nynh thaw yn ccih zah ka rypaw tynre kha yn pya,” a ci. Jakob nynh Esau kha a soihbia keiccuze Esau nynh khah-e kha a lawku.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Oute Esau nynh, “Cceih ccavae oh sih, kamaw laan ka maw cih,” a ci. <verse number="13" style="v" />Thuasalama Jakob nynh Esau kha, “Ka bawipaw, imua hae tuh mih thaw azya, tuu hae, miaa hae te vaetua hae tuh mih taw hae ryte ka do-oih lan hae paw nynh thua cipaw kha na ny; arangte eih ka cciakhae hae zetuh sahiin hae hynh nin kheit mawte pong chih cih hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ka bawipaw, nang tuh ka malang la cceihlo, kae tuh ka malang umpaw sahiin hae te imua hae nynh a ccia kho hae thyhte ka bawipaw na umnaw Seir ram kae thua makhia byabyate kae cciakhae cih hae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Te Esau nynh, “Ka kya umpaw ccungccaw abang hynh na kyakhe kae cciataw hae sah,” a ci. Thuasalama Jakob nynh, “Pawccemou ka bawipaw nang nynh ka tungvaw hynhcih baban na hoy?” a ci. <verse number="16" style="v" />Te Esau tuh tuh-e nin khe Seir ram lang bua a ki. <verse number="17" style="v" />Jakob tuh Sukkoth<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33.17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sukkoth </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw tuh </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw nynh thua.</char></note> lang cceih zah amaw hanlan inn te a sahiin hae hanlan bu kha a sak; tukeiccuze tuh-e hmin tuh Sukkoth a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jakob Shekhem A Thua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jakob tuh Mesopotamia ram kyate yn ki zah Kanaan ram umpaw Shekhem khua kya khyndadyh lante a thua; te tuh-e khua malang khe bu kha a sakku. <verse number="19" style="v" />Te Shekhem paaw Hamor a ccapaw hae kyate bu a saknawpaw laephi hmin kha ngunphua za kheit te a re.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 24:32">Jos 24.32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:5">Joh 4.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuin kyakhe silawhang kha rae zah El, Elohe-Israel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33.20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">El, Elohe-Israel </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw tuh </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pachia, Israel Pachia </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw nynh thua.</char></note> cite min a phu.</para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Dinah kha A Kyngde hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jakob te Leah nynh a saah hae paw mih ccanung Dinah tuh tuh-e ram kya umpaw nopi hae kalan a paebua. <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuh-e ram kyaze bawi athuapaw, Hiv minphuinpaw Hamor ccapaw Shekhem nynh Dinah kha he a muih tuh kyngdete ikhae zah a thethyasah. <verse number="3" style="v" />Te a thinlung tuh Jakob ccanung Dinah kyakhe phang a um; aning nynh liaccanung kha sungsah zah nebaleih lante bya leih a beih. <verse number="4" style="v" />Shekhem nynh a paaw Hamor kha, “E liaccanung hynh ka zu lang yn dypah,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jakob nynh a ccanung Dinah kha Shekhem nynh a thethyasah cipaw a ny; thuasalama a ccapaw hae tuh a sahiin hae ryte ramkaw kya a um hae keiccuze Jakob tuh minmin oun thua hae makhia daebabi lan a um. <verse number="6" style="v" />Te Shekhem paaw Hamor tuh Jakob te byahoku khylan cceih zah <verse number="7" style="v" />tuh lyatuin Jakob ccapaw hae tuh ramkaw kyate la thua hae. Shekhem nynh Jakob ccanung kha ikhae zah Israel minphuin kya ahoy leipaw, cyi lan accan leipaw kha a cyi keiccuze minmin tuh mih thinlungccih zah myarya mih thinria.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hamor nynh minmin kyakhe, “Ka ccapaw Shekhem nynh nae ccanung kha a sungsah; tukeiccuze a zu lang beih pya oh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Nanning nynh kaening te zudykunaw kha rae oh lah nae ccanung hae kha zu lang oun pya oh, te kae ccanung hae hynh mah zu lang dykuh oh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Nanning tuh kaening kya umbua oh lah, e ram tuh nanning elang ua athua cih, e ram kya khuasah oh lah kungkunaw kha rae oh, te na hoi oh paw uccaw tuh nae uccaw lang a tang cih,” a ci. <verse number="11" style="v" />Shekhem nynh Dinah a paaw te a raee hae kyakhe, “Ngaethya oun umsah oh lah, na ho oh paw miakaw kae pya cih oh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Lasung te mee zemah na ry oh zeihte hokuh oh lah nae ngia oh paw miakaw kae pya cih oh; liaccanung rou kha ka zu lang oun pya oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Shekhem nynh mih ccianung Dinah kha a thethyasah keiccuze Jakob ccaaw hae nynh Shekhem te a paaw Hamor kha lingpaw bya te a leih hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Jakob ccaaw hae nynh, “Kae ccianung tuh vingdungawkuh leipaw kalan kae pya kho khyh, pawccecize kae pya zetuh kaening kha the oun thyasah cih. <verse number="15" style="v" />Kae nawccaw kho nawlan ccangkheit kyalya um zah tuh-e tuh: nanning nynh kaening hawte pise miakaw vingdung na awkuh cih oh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuhteze nynh kae ccianung hae kha nae zu lang kae pya cih oh zah nae ccianung hae kha zu lang kae dykuh cih, te nanning kya kae umbua cih zah minphuin phuin kheit lang ah tang cih oh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Thuasalama kae bya kha na ngae khyh oh zah vingdung na awkuh khyh oh zetuh kae ccanung kha kae ko cih zah kae cceih vae cih,” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mih bya tuh Hamor te a ccapaw Shekhem nynh mih nawccah. <verse number="19" style="v" />Te ccangvaepaw tuh Jakob ccanung kha a lungrythua zah cyi lanpaw kha arangte a cyi vae. Aning tuh a innbyn hae balyn kyaze sawtua lan um huapaw nynh thua. <verse number="20" style="v" />Oute Hamor te a ccapaw Shekhem nynh mih khua koikua tungkunaw hmin kalan cceih hae zah mih khuaccaaw hae kyakhe, <verse number="21" style="v" />“E ccungccaw hae tuh aening te ccawku lan a um hae; ah ram kya khuasah hae sah lah kungku hae sah, pawccecize ah ram tuh minmin hanlan mah phe azawbia; mih ccanung hae kha zu lang dy oh sih lah ah ccanung hae kha mah zu lang dy hae sah. <verse number="22" style="v" />Thuasalama minmin nynh vingdung a awku hae hawte aening pise miakaw vingdung ah awku oh ze rou nynh aening ryte umkheih lan te minphuin phuin kheit lang tang lang mih nawccah cih. <verse number="23" style="v" />Minmin kya-e sahiin hae, sisua te sahiin-awvaw balyn tuh aening uccaw lang a tang cih khaw? Minmin rynaw kha ah nawccaw ze rou nynh aening kya a umbua cih hae,” a ci hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Hamor te a ccapaw Shekhem nynh a ho hae paw kha a khua koikua kyate a pou hae paw balyn nynh mih nawccah zah pise miakaw tuh vingdung a awkuh vae hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Dinah A Raee hae kyate Liarunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tukoute nin thumnaw kya mih vaemaw a cci lyakhe Jakob ccaaw hae lu ning Simeon te Levi, Dinah a raee hae nynh mih thaloi hae kha lawkuh hae zah aphirute tuh-e khua lungkhu lang tee hae zah pise balyn kha pong a chia hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Hamor te a ccapaw Shekhem kha thaloi te phe a chia hae, te Dinah kha Shekhem inn kyate ko hae zah a cciakhae hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Mih ccianung tuh a thethya vae keiccuze ccangpaw Jakob ccaaw hae nynh a chia vae hae paw ccungccaw hae kalan cceih hae zah, khua kha thiing hae zah <verse number="28" style="v" />mih sahiin hae, mih lann hae, te khua kya te loo kya umpaw atyn-are kha phe lawpya hae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Mih sisua balyn, mih ccaaw hae balyn te mih zu hae, inn kya umpaw balyn kha pong lua hae zah a cciakhae hae. <verse number="30" style="v" />Oute Jakob nynh Simeon te Levi kha, “E ram kya umpaw Kanaan hae te Periz hae nynh kamaw kha nae huasah vae oh keiccuze vawsawnaw nae thuakhaepya vae oh; ka ccungccaw hae tuh a zya hae, te minmin nynh sueluakuh hae zah kamaw kha rawsete oun tuk hae zetuh kamaw te ka innbyn hae tuh kae chih vae cih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="31" style="v" />Thuasalama minmin nynh, “Kae ccianung tuh ohhuanung hawte cyisah lan accan tou?” a ci hae.</para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jakob Bethel lang Bua A Ki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pachia nynh Jakob kha, “Thokuh, Bethel lang cceihthung lah, tuin kya khuasah. Na upaw Esau kyate na ccue lyaze namaw kya a langkuhpaw Pachia hanlan silawhang ccangkheit kha tuin kya rae,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:11-17">Gen 28.11-17</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Jakob nynh a innbyn te amaw kya a um hae paw balyn kha, “Nae kya umpaw ramccang pachia hae kha vua oh, te naemaw te naemaw kha thyaasakuh oh lah nae uccaw kha liakuh oh; <verse number="3" style="v" />rang oh, Bethel lang cceih oh sih, ka vawsaw ccyh lya yn bawmtupaw te ka ccianaw takyh kya yn umkhaepaw Pachia hanlan silawhang ccangkheit kha tuin kya ka rae cih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin nynh a hoi hae paw ramccang pachia hae te mih nakua kya umpaw nakuahuing hae kha Jakob kalan a pya hae; te Jakob nynh khah-e hae kha Shekhem pe umpaw phaesi ku kaw khe a thuruh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Minmin nynh a ccia lya hae khe Pachia kyate ri lan umpaw kha mih pepan e khua hae kyakhe a ccaw keiccuze humhung nynh mah Jakob ccaaw hae kha deehui vae khyh hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Jakob tuh amaw kya umpaw ccungccaw hae ryte Kanaan ram umpaw Luz khua a thua hae, (Luz tuh Bethel nynh thua), <verse number="7" style="v" />te tuin kyakhe silawhang ccangkheit kha rae zah tuh-e hmin tuh El-bethel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35.7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">El-bethel </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw tuh </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bethel Pachia </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw nynh thua.</char></note> cite min a phu, pawccecize a upaw kyate a ccue lyaze Pachia nynh a langpyakunaw hmin nynh thua. <verse number="8" style="v" />Te Rebekah kha a do-oihtu Deborah tuh chih zah Bethel akawlan umpaw phaesi ku kaw khe a uu hae. Tukeiccuze tuh-e thingku tuh Allon-bacuth<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35.8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Allon-bacuth </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw tuh </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Rawnaw phaesi ku </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw nynh thua.</char></note> cite min a phu hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jakob nynh Mesopotamia kyate bua a thua tuh Pachia nynh amaw kya bua langkuh zah hythua a pya. <verse number="10" style="v" />Pachia nynh Jakob kha, “Na min tuh Jakob nynh thua; atu te Jakob cite ko na thua vae lan khyh, thuasalama na min tuh Israel a cikuh vae cih,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze Israel cite ko athua vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:28">Gen 32.28</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Pachia nynh amaw kha, “Kae tuh Athunghuapaw Pachia nynh ka thua: na pungzae cih zah na lungthung cih; minphuin phuin kheit te minphuin patae kha namaw kyate oun langkuh cih hae, te siapharan hae kha namaw kyate oun pou cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35.11-12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:4-8">Gen 17.4-8</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Abraham te Isak ka pya hae paw ram kha nang kae pya cih, tuh-e ram tuh namaw koute na ciihan hae kha ka pya cih hae,” a cipya. <verse number="13" style="v" />Oute Pachia tuh Jakob te bya a hokunaw hae hmin kyate vaawlang a kae vae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Jakob nynh Pachia te bya a la hokunaw hae hmin kyakhe lungbing ccangkheit bing zah a vawlan khe niapaw silawnawpaw kha bu zah chitui kha mah a bu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35.14-15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:18-19">Gen 28.18-19</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Jakob nynh Pachia te bya a hokunaw hae hmin kha Bethel cite min a phu.</para>
  <para style="s1">Rachel A Chih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tukoute Bethel kyate cceih hae zah Efrath khua te tabeih asawnaw kyakhe he a thua hae tuh Rachel tuh a ccaaw pui zaw zah neitangia ccinaw kha myarya a teing. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuhte neitangia a cci lyakhe neitaw puisanung nynh Rachel kha, “Rih nan, pawccecize atu ccangpaw ccapaw na hoi vae cih,” a cipya. <verse number="18" style="v" />Rachel nynh a hy athang dyn khe ccapaw kha Ben-oni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35.18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ben-oni </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw tuh </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ka ngaethyanaw ccapaw </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw nynh thua.</char></note> cite min a phu; thuasalama a paaw nynh Benjamin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35.18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Benjamin </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw tuh </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ranglang kuih ccapaw </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tuhkhyhze </char><char style="fq" closed="false">alia lang ccapaw </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw nynh thua.</char></note> cite min a phu. <verse number="19" style="v" />Rachel tuh chih zah Efrath lang ccianaw laanpi kya a uu hae (Efrath tuh Bethlehem nynh thua), <verse number="20" style="v" />te Jakob nynh a shawku kyakhe lungbing ccangkheit a bing; tuh-e tuh Rachel shawku kya-e lungbing nynh thua, tuh-e tuh atunin cia tuin kya a um. <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel nynh cceih zah Eder innhangpaw arawlang khe a bu kha a sak.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jakob Ccapaw hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 2:1-2">1Sh 2.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel nynh tuin ram kya a um lyakhe Reuben nynh a paaw lovaenung Bilhah kha a ikhae; te Israel nynh tuh-e tuh a thae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:4">Gen 49.4</ref></char></note> Jakob ccapaw hae tuh lu haw lae ning acih hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Leah ccapaw hae tuh: Reuben (Jakob a ccatawccaw), Simeon, Levi, Judah, Isakhar te Zebulun nynh thua hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Rachel ccapaw hae tuh: Josef te Benjamin nynh thua hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Rachel seenung Bilhah ccapaw hae tuh: Dan te Naftali nynh thua hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Leah seenung Zilpah ccapaw hae tuh: Gad te Asher nynh thua hae. E hae tuh Mesopotamia ram kya a pui hae paw Jakob ccapaw hae nynh thua hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Isak Chinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jakob tuh Mamre kya umpaw a paaw Isak kya a thua, Mamre tuh Abraham te Isak nynh ramccang ccungccaw hae hawte a la umnaw hae nynh thua, (Mamre tuh Kiriath-arba cite mah cikuh zah Hebron cite mah a cikuh).<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35.27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:18">Gen 13.18</ref></char></note> <verse number="28" style="v" />Isak tuh kum za kheit sung tarya acih vae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Te Isak tuh a kum tang vae zah he a taw vae te a chih, te a ccungccaw hae kalan a sueluabua hae; a ccaaw hae Esau te Jakob nynh amaw kha a uu hae.</para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Esau Ciihan hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:34-37">1Sh 1.34-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Edom cikuhpaw Esau ciihan tuh hynh-e hae nynh thua hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Esau nynh Kanaan minphuin hae kha zu lang a dyku hae, tuh-e hae tuh: Hit ccungccaw Elon ccanung Adah, Hiv minphuinpaw Zibeon ccapaw Anah ccanung Oholibamah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 26:34">Gen 26.34</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />te Ishmael ccanung Basemath nynh thua hae; Basemath tuh Nebaioth a ccianung nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:9">Gen 28.9</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Adah nynh Esau hanlan Elifaz kha saahpah zah Basemath nynh Reuel kha a saahpya; <verse number="5" style="v" />te Oholibamah nynh Jeush, Jalam te Korah kha a saahpya hae. E hae tuh Kanaan ram kya a puipaw Esau ccapaw hae nynh thua hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Oute Esau nynh a zu hae, a ccapaw hae, a ccanung hae, a innbyn balyn, a sahiin hae, a sahiin-awvaw balyn te Kanaan ram kya a hoipaw sisua balyn kha lah zah a neitawpaw Jakob kyate asawnaw ram langkhe a nuekuh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Pawccecize mih hoirumnaw tuh eih lung kaesy zah pynkheihlan um kho vae khyh hae; mih sahiin-awvaw hae keiccuze a umnaw hae ram nynh minmin hanlan zaw vae khyh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Esau tuh mua alungnaw Seir ram kya khua a sah; Esau tuh Edom nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />E hae tuh mua alungnaw Seir ram kya umpaw Edom minphuin hae mih paaw Esau ciihan nynh thua hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />E hae tuh Esau ccapaw hae mih min nynh thua: Esau a zu Adah ccapaw Elifaz; te Esau a zu Basemath ccapaw Reuel nynh thua. <verse number="11" style="v" />Elifaz ccapaw hae tuh Teman, Omar, Zefo, Gatam te Kenaz nynh thua hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />(Timna tuh Esau ccapaw Elifaz a lovaenung thua zah aning nynh Elifaz hanlan Amalek kha a saahpya.) E hae tuh Esau a zu Adah ccapaw hae nynh thua hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Reuel ccapaw hae tuh: Nahath, Zerah, Shammah te Mizzah nynh thua hae. E hae hynh Esau a zu Basemath ccapaw hae nynh thua hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Esau zu Oholibamah ccapaw hae tuh Jeush, Jalam te Korah nynh thua hae. Oholibamah tuh Zibeon ccapaw Anah a ccanung nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />E hae tuh Esau ccapaw hae lakuze ciihan paaw hae nynh thua hae. Esau a ccatawccaw Elifaz ciihan hae kyaze ciihan paaw hae tuh Teman, Omar, Zefo, Kenaz, <verse number="16" style="v" />Korah, Gatam te Amalek nynh thua hae. E hae tuh Edom ram umpaw Elifaz ciihan hae lakuze ciihan paaw nynh thua hae; minmin tuh Adah ccapaw hae nynh thua hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />E hae tuh Esau ccapaw Reuel a ccapaw hae nynh thua hae, minmin lakuze ciihan paaw hae tuh: Nahath, Zerah, Shammah te Mizzah nynh thua hae; e hae tuh Edom ram kya umpaw Reuel ciihan hae lakuze bawi nynh thua hae; minmin tuh Esau zu Basemath a ccapaw hae nynh thua hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />E hae tuh Esau zu Oholibamah ccapaw hae nynh thua hae: ciihan paaw hae tuh Jeush, Jalam te Korah nynh thua hae; e hae tuh Anah ccanung, Esau zu Oholibamah nynh a saah hae paw ciihan paaw hae nynh thua hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />E hae tuh Esau a cikuhpaw Edom ccapaw hae thua hae zah bawi hae mah a thua hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuin ram kya umpaw Hor minphuin a thuapaw Seir ccapaw hae tuh Lotan, Shobal, Zibeon, Anah, <verse number="21" style="v" />Dishon, Ezer te Dishan nynh thua hae; e hae tuh Hor minphuin kyaze ciihan paaw hae thua hae zah Edom ram umpaw Seir a ccapaw hae nynh thua hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Lotan ccapaw hae tuh Hori te Heman nynh thua hae; Timna tuh Lotan ccianung nynh thua. <verse number="23" style="v" />Shobal ccapaw hae tuh: Alvan, Manahath, Ebal, Shefo te Onam nynh thua hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Zibeon ccapaw hae tuh Aiah te Anah nynh thua hae; Anah tuh a paaw Zebeon kya-e lann hae kha ramkaw kya a rin lyaze tuidy a muihtupaw nynh thua. <verse number="25" style="v" />Anah a ccapaw tuh Dishon thua zah Anah a ccanung tuh Oholibamah nynh thua. <verse number="26" style="v" />Dishon ccapaw hae tuh Hemdan, Eshban, Ithran te Kheran nynh thua hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Ezer ccapaw hae tuh Bilhan, Zaavan te Akan nynh thua hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Dishan ccapaw hae tuh Uz te Aran nynh thua hae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Hor minphuin kya-e ciihan paaw hae tuh Lotan, Shobal, Zebeon, Anah, <verse number="30" style="v" />Dishon, Ezer, te Dishan nynh thua hae; e hae tuh mua alungnaw Seir ram kyaze mimaw phin raveihte Hor ccungccaw hae kya-e ciihan paaw hae nynh thua hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Edom Siapharan hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:43-54">1Sh 1.43-54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Israel ccungccaw hae a uktupaw siapharan humhung mah a um mawze, e hae tuh Edom ram a uk hae paw siapharan hae nynh thua hae. <verse number="32" style="v" />Beor ccapaw Bela nynh Edom ram kha a uk, a khua min tuh Dinhabah nynh thua. <verse number="33" style="v" />Bela he chih te, Bozrah khuapaw Zerah ccapaw Jobab nynh siapharan lang a tang. <verse number="34" style="v" />Jobab he chih te, Teman minphuin hae ram umpaw Husham nynh siapharan lang a tang. <verse number="35" style="v" />Husham he chih te, Moab ram e Midian hae a la taepaw Bedad ccapaw Hadad nynh siapharan lang a tang, a khua min tuh Avith nynh thua. <verse number="36" style="v" />Hadad he chih te, Masrekah khuapaw Samlah nynh siapharan lang a tang. <verse number="37" style="v" />Samlah he chih te, Zufrates vaw kin umpaw Rehoboth khua kya-e Shaul nynh siapharan lang a tang. <verse number="38" style="v" />Shaul he chih te, Akbor ccapaw Baalhanan nynh siapharan lang a tang. <verse number="39" style="v" />Akbor ccapaw Baalhanan he chih te, Hadar nynh siapharan lang a tang, a khua min tuh Pau nynh thua, a zu min tuh Mehetabel cikuh zah Matred ccanung nynh thua, Matred tuh Mezahab ccanung nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />E hae tuh Esau ciihan hae kyaze ciihan paaw thua hae zah mih phin raveihte mih umnaw raveihte mih min nynh thua hae: Timna, Alvah, Jetheth, <verse number="41" style="v" />Oholibamah, Elah, Pinon, <verse number="42" style="v" />Kenaz, Teman, Mibzar, <verse number="43" style="v" />Magdiel te Iram; e hae tuh Edom ciihan paaw hae nynh thua hae, mih ram kyaze khua a la sahnaw hae raveihte nynh thua (Esau tuh Edom ccungccaw hae mih paaw nynh thua).</para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Josef te A Uno hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jakob tuh a paaw nynh ramccang ccungccaw hawte a la umnaw Kanaan ram kyakhe a um. <verse number="2" style="v" />E tuh Jakob a innbyn phungpaw nynh thua. Josef nynh kum haw lae sari he cih tuh, a upaw hae ryte tuu hae te miaa hae kha leih a rin hae; a paaw zu hae Bilhah te Zilpah mih ccapaw hae kha leih a bawm hae. Josef nynh a upaw hae hoyleinaw kong kha mih paaw kya leih a hopya. <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel nynh Josef kha phe a taw vae te a saahpaw ccapaw athua keiccuze ccangpaw a ccaaw hae laeze a sungsahua; te aning nynh apyaapaw angkiccuapaw kha a raepya. <verse number="4" style="v" />Mih paaw nynh Josef kha a upaw hae balyn laeze a sungsahua cipaw a upaw hae nynh he a nyh hae tuh, Josef kha hua hae zah hoyte byabeih ry vae khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vaekheit tuh Josef nynh maansah zah a maan kha a upaw hae kya he a hopah hae tuh minmin nynh amaw kha houh a hua vae hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Josef nynh minmin kha, “E ka maan hynh ngaetua oh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Aening nynh loo kya loohku acce kha ah la tung oh. Ka loohku acce nynh vaekheit mawte la thokuh zah lawbabin lan a la thadyn; oute nae loohku acce hae nynh ka loohku acce kha la koihlu hae zah bakhungte a la beik hae,” a ci. <verse number="8" style="v" />A upaw hae nynh, “Nang nynh kaening kya siapharan lang nae tang cih tou? Nang nynh kaening kha nae uk cih tou?” a cipya hae. Tukeiccuze a maan te a bya keiccuze amaw kha houh a hua vae hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Josef nynh ccangpaw maan kha bua sah zah a upaw hae kyakhe, “Ngaetua oh, ccangpaw maan kha bua ka sah vae: khuanin, sawpaw te awsi haw lae kheit nynh ka malang bakhungte yn la beik hae,” a ci. <verse number="10" style="v" />A maan kha a paaw te a upaw hae kya he a ho tuh a paaw nynh amaw kha pe zah, “Pawcihawpaw maan mou na sah? Kaening, kamaw, na nung te na upaw hae nynh na kalan kae cceih cih zah na malang khe laekhu kya kae bakhung cih tou?” a cipya. <verse number="11" style="v" />A upaw hae nynh Josef tungvaw mih eiung, thuasalama a paaw nynh tuh-e tuh a thinlung kya palei a tua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:9">Loc 7.9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Uno hae nynh Josef Zuanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Josef a upaw hae tuh mih paaw kya-e tuuphu kha Shekhem kya rin lan a cceih hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Te Israel nynh Josef kha, “Na upaw hae tuh Shekhem kya tuuphu kha a rin hae khaw? Oun cceih, minmin kalan kae saw cih,” cipah zah Josef nynh, “Phang ka paccynkuh,” a cipya. <verse number="14" style="v" />A paaw nynh Josef kha, “La cceih lah na upaw hae te tuu hae kha ngedante a um hae tou cipaw la dotua hae lah, kamaw kha nae thaesah cih,” a cipya. Tuhcite a paaw nynh Hebron accya kyate a saw. Josef nynh Shekhem kya a thua tuh, <verse number="15" style="v" />ccungccapaw lu kheit nynh loo kya a khiakuhpaw Josef kha muih zah, “Pawmou na ccung?” cite a khia. <verse number="16" style="v" />Josef nynh, “Ka upaw hae nynh ka ccung hae, tuuphu kha teimou a rin hae cipaw beih yn hopah,” a ci. <verse number="17" style="v" />Ccungccapaw nynh, “Phe cceih vae cih hae, pawccecize, ‘Dothan lang cceih oh sih,’ cite a hokuh hae paw kha ka thae,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze Josef nynh a upaw hae nulangte cceih zah minmin kha Dothan khe a muih hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />A upaw hae nynh asawnaw kyate Josef kha a muih hae, mih pe a thua mawkhe amaw kha chia lan cite a paccynku hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Minmin nynh mimaw te mimaw kha, “Maansahtupaw hein kya yn thua vae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Rang oh, amaw kha theih oh sih lah, hunghua ccangkheit lungkhu lang vua oh sih; oute sarepaw nynh phe tei cite ho lan, te a maan hae kha pawlangmah yn tang cipaw dotua lan,” a ciku hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Thuasalama Reuben nynh he thae tuh, “Amaw kha theih nan oh sih,” cipah hae zah mih kuih kyate Josef kha a luesah. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tukoute Reuben nynh minmin kha, “A chii luasah nan oh, e ramkaw umpaw hunghua lungkhu lang vua oh, kuih hangnua nan oh,” a cipya hae. Amaw kha mih kuih kyate ka luesah cih zah apang kya bua ka thuakhae sah cite a tuaku. <verse number="23" style="v" />Josef nynh a upaw hae kya he a thua tuh, minmin nynh apyaapaw angkiccuapaw, a kikupaw kha a khah hae; <verse number="24" style="v" />te amaw kha lah hae zah hunghua lungkhu lang a vua hae. Hunghua lungkhu kya pawpaw mah um khyh, tui mah um khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Oute ae lan cite a dahung hae; te he do hae tuh Gilead ram kyate oun cceih hae paw Ishmael ccungccaw khuaccong hae paw phu kheit kha a muih hae. Tuh-e hae nynh amynkhuhpaw ehang kya thungpaw, amynkhuhpaw thuhkuhpaw te therih angro aphuinphuin kha mih kalauh phusah hae zah Izip ram lang oun ccia hae paw kha a muih hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Oute Judah nynh a uno hae kha, “Ah neitaw tuh ah theih cih oh zah phe ah pheikuh oh zeso pawmou athane? <verse number="27" style="v" />Rang oh, amaw kha Ishmael hae kalan zua oh sih, amaw tungvaw ah kuih hang nan oh sih, pawccecize aning tuh ah neitaw thua zah ah chiisaw nynh thua,” a ci. Te a uno hae nynh mih nawccaw. <verse number="28" style="v" />Te Midian kungku hae he la thua hae tuh, Josef kha hunghua lungkhu te poh thuaa hae zah Ishmael minphuin hae kya ngunphua kia kuin lang a zua hae. Te minmin nynh Josef kha Izip ram lang a cciakhae hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37.28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:9">Loc 7.9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Reuben nynh yn ki zah Josef kha hunghua lungkhu he a muih khyh tuh a ngaethah zah a boeining kha a seiiku. <verse number="30" style="v" />A uno hae kalan yn ki zah, “Imuapaw um vae khyh, teilangmou ka cceih vae cih,” a ci. <verse number="31" style="v" />Oute minmin nynh Josef angki kha a law hae, miaa kha theih hae zah miaa chii kyakhe Josef angki kha a dung hae. <verse number="32" style="v" />Minmin nynh apyaapaw angkiccuapaw kha mih paaw kalan cciakhae hae zah, “Kaening nynh e angki hynh kae muih, na ccapaw angki athua thua khyh cipaw dotua,” a cipya hae. <verse number="33" style="v" />Aning nynh tuh-e angki tuh syntaw zah, “E hynh ka ccapaw angki nynh thua! Sarepaw nynh amaw kha phe a tei vae; Josef kha zoihtatyh lan pong a pae vae cipaw phe aria vae,” a ci. <verse number="34" style="v" />Oute Jakob nynh a ngaethya keiccuze a boeining kha seii zah buriboei kha a tae kya a voiku; te a ccapaw hanlan khaw cia rawkhuite a um. <verse number="35" style="v" />A ccapaw hae balyn te a ccanung hae balyn nynh mih paaw kha lungtangnaw bya a hopya hae; thuasalama mih paaw nynh a lungtangsakuh kho khyh zah, “Ka ccapaw umnaw michi khua lang rawkhuite ka cceih cih,” a cipya hae. Tuhcite a paaw tuh aning hanlan rawkhuite a um. <verse number="36" style="v" />Te Midian hae nynh Josef kha Izip ram umpaw Faro siapharan kya-e bawi lu kheit a thuapaw Potifar kalan a zua hae; aning tuh siapharan do-oihtu hae kyaze bawi nynh thua.</para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jakob Te Tamar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyakhe Judah tuh a uno hae kyate cceih zah Adullam khuapaw Hirah kya a um. <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuin kyakhe Judah nynh Kanaan ccungccapaw a min Shua cikuhpaw a ccanung kha a muih; tuh-e nopinung kha zu lang umkhae zah a ikhae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuh-e nopinung nynh ccaawpoi zah ccapaw kha a saah; Judah nynh tuh-e ccapaw kha Er cite min a phu. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tukoute ccaawpoi zah ccapaw bua saah zah Onan cite min a phu. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tukoute ccapaw bua saah zah Shelah cite min a phu. Shelah a pui lya Judah tuh Khezib khua nynh a um. <verse number="6" style="v" />Judah nynh a ccatawccaw Er hanlan zu a dypya; a zu min tuh Tamar a cikuh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Judah a ccatawccaw Er tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang ahoy leipaw thua zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh amaw kha phe a chisah. <verse number="8" style="v" />Oute Judah nynh Onan kha, “Na upaw zu kha la ikhae lah zu lang la umkhae; na upaw hanlan ccaawno kha la saahpah,” a cipya. <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuasalama Onan nynh kae saahpaw hynh kamaw ccaaw lang tang lan khyh cipaw a ny, te a upaw kha ccaawno a pya ry khyh keiccuze a upaw zu kha a ikhae takyh vae ze, a buatui kha laephi kalan leih a pousah han. <verse number="10" style="v" />A cyisahnaw nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> lung kha tung khyh, tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Onan kha mah phe a chisah. <verse number="11" style="v" />Oute Shelah hynh a u hae hawte yn chihsei cih cite Judah nynh a phang keiccuze a monung Tamar kha, “Ka ccapaw Shelah a zaw makhia na paaw inn kya nomaenung lante la um,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze Tamar nynh a paaw inn lang cceih zah a um.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuinte aro mawze Shua ccanung Judah zu tuh phe a chih; Judah nynh a rawkhuinaw ccyh he athang te, a bangpaw Adullam khuapaw Hirah ryte Timnah khua e a tuuming ngotu hae kalan a cceih hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tamar kha, “Na ranpaw Judah tuh Timnah lang a tuuming ngo lan a cceih cih,” cite a hopya hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tamar nynh a nomae uccaw kha liakuh zah mae bongkupaw boei te a mae kha a bongku, a pyn kha mah phang lungkuh zah Timnah lang cceihpaw laanpi kya umpaw Enaim khua teenaw koikua kyakhe a haung. Shelah tuh phe a zaw vae, tuhzemah zu lang yn umkhae sah khyh hae cipaw kha Tamar nynh a ny. <verse number="15" style="v" />Judah nynh nopinung kha he a muih tuh, a mae a bongku keiccuze ohhuanung nynh thua cite a tua. <verse number="16" style="v" />Laanpi pe lang ccianua zah, “Rangtua, ikheih tua sih,” a ci, pawccecize a monung nynh thua cipaw nyh khyh. Nopinung nynh, “Ah ihkheih ze pawmou nae pya cih?” a ci. <verse number="17" style="v" />Judah nynh, “Miaa phu kya-e miaa taraw sa kheit kha kae pya cih,” a ci. Te nopinung nynh, “Tuh-e tuh nae pya mawze byakinku nawpaw ccangkhakheit kha nae pya ze rou,” a cipya. <verse number="18" style="v" />Judah nynh, “Pawcihawpaw byakinkunaw uccaw mou kae pya cih?” a ci. Nopinung nynh, “Na tazeih, na kya-e akhekuhpaw arui te na ccyngpaw hoitang kha,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze Judah nynh khah-e hae kha pya zah a ikhae, te Judah liate ccaaw kha a poi. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tukoute nopinung tuh thokuh zah a cceih vae, te a mae bongkupaw boei kha hungkuh zah a nomae boeining kha bua a lawku.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Judah nynh nopinung kya byakinku nawpaw uccaw kha bua law khylan a banpaw Adullam khuapaw kyate miaa taraw kha nopinung kalan he a pya tuh, aning nynh nopinung kha muih kho vae khyh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Aning nynh tuin kya umpaw khuaccaaw hae kha, “Enaim khua laanpi pe umpaw beikinn ohhuanung kha teimou um?” cite a khia hae. Thuasalama minmin nynh, “Hein kya ohhuanung um boi khyh,” a ci hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tukeiccuze aning nynh Judah kalan ki zah, “Nopinung kha ka muih vae khyh, tuhpiaze khuaccaaw hae nynh, ‘Hein kya ohhuanung um boi khyh,’ a ci hae,” cite a hopya. <verse number="23" style="v" />Oute Judah nynh, “Nopinung kya umpaw uccaw kha amaw la lawkuh sah, tuhkhyhze tuh aening kha oun nuinse cih hae; e miaa taraw hynh nopinung kalan phang ka pya pite amaw kha na muih vae khyh hynhsa,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Sawpaw sah thum he aro te Judah kyakhe, “Na monung Tamar tuh ohhuanung lang tang zah ahoy leipaw ryalaw keiccuze atu ccaaw a poi vae,” cite a hopya hae. Judah nynh, “Amaw kha atolang poukhae oh lah phe chih lan maee te u oh,” a ci. <verse number="25" style="v" />A poukhae lya hae khe nopinung nynh a ranpaw kha byataw zah, “Ccaaw yn poisahtupaw hynh e uccaw hae a hoitupaw nynh thua, hynh-e tazeih, akhekuhpaw arui te hoitang hynh hum uccaw mou cipaw na syntaw tou, beih dotua hei,” a cipya. <verse number="26" style="v" />Judah nynh khah-e hae kha syntaw zah, “Nopinung hynh kamaw laeze a dinghua, pawccecize ka ccapaw Shelah kha a vawpaw lang ka pya khyh,” a ci. Te nopinung kha ikhae boi vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ninsaw a kyh tuh, a vue kya ccaawpheipaw a la um. <verse number="28" style="v" />Neitangia a cci lyakhe ccapaw lu kheit nynh a kuih kha atolang a dyng; te ccaawpuisah nung nynh a kuih kha kyng zah law te khii zah, “E ccapaw hynh masaty a puipaw nynh thua,” a ci. <verse number="29" style="v" />Thuasalama tuh-e ccapaw nynh a kuih kha bua khin zah lu kheit kha nynh poh a puity vae, te ccaawpuisah nung nynh, “Nang tou poh na puity!” a ci. Tukeiccuze Perez<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38.29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Perez </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw hynh Hebru bya te </char><char style="fq" closed="false">pui </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw nynh thua.</char></note> cite min a phu hae. <verse number="30" style="v" />Tukoute a kuih kya laaw khiikuhpaw a neitaw tuh yn pui; te Zerah<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38.30 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Zerah </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw hynh Hebru bya kyaze </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ase </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cite roi apoupaw te nynh aloku.</char></note> cite min a phu hae.</para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Josef te Potifar Zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josef kha Izip ram lang a cciakhae hae, te Izip ccungccapaw Potifar cikuhpaw, Faro kya-e bawi lu kheit, siapharan inn a do-oihtu hae mih bawi a thuapaw nynh Izip ram lang a cciakhaetu hae Ishmael hae kyate Josef kha a re. <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Josef kha umkhae zah ahangkuhpaw ccungccaw lang a tang; te a bawipaw Izip ccungccapaw inn kya a um.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:9">Loc 7.9</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Josef kha umkhae zah a cyipaw balyn kyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a laansui a uasahpya cipaw kha a bawipaw nynh a muih. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Josef tuh a bawipaw malang maehoynaw mue zah a bawipaw nynh a sungsah keiccuze a ryalawpahtu lang a nung; Potifar nynh Josef kha a inn uktu lang nung zah a hoipaw balyn kha a do-oihtu lang a nung. <verse number="5" style="v" />A inn te a hoipaw balyn kha a do-oihtu lang he a nung ccyh kyate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Josef liate Izip paw a inn kha hythua a pya; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hythuanaw tuh Potifar a hoipaw balyn kya, a inn te a loo kya a um. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Potifar nynh a hoipaw balyn kha Josef kuih kya pong ap zah amaw a aepaw looh holeite tuh ccangpaw pawpaw hanlan mah a peki vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">Josef tuh a pynrua hoy zah a puithya. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukoute a bawipaw zu nynh Josef kha ry zah, “Kamaw te ihkheih sih,” a cipya. <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuasalama Josef nynh ei zah a bawipaw zu kha, “Hein kya ka um zah ka bawipaw nynh a inn kya umpaw pawpaw mah peki leite a uccaw tynre kha ka kuih kya yn ap vae. <verse number="9" style="v" />E inn kya kamaw laeze ale huapaw um vae khyh, a zu na thuapaw nang holeite tuh pawpaw mah kaw yn khyasah leipaw um khyh. Pawtemou e hoyleinaw alepaw kha raete Pachia a rawsepaw seinaw kha pharung ka rae kho cih?” a ci. <verse number="10" style="v" />Te a bawinung nynh Josef kha nin kheit koute nin kheit soih salamah Josef nynh ikheih, umkheih lanpaw kha a nawccah khyh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Nin kheit tuh, inn kya lu kheit sanmah a um khyh lyakhe Josef nynh ryalaw lan inn lungkhu lang he a tee tuh, <verse number="12" style="v" />A bawinung nynh Josef a boeining kha phang kyng zah, “Oun ikhae!” a cipya. Thuasalama Josef nynh a boeining kha a bawinung kuih kya ccuetaw zah atolang po a ccue vae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Josef nynh a kuih kya a boeining kha cciataw zah atolang a ccuepaw kha a bawinung nynh he a muih tuh, <verse number="14" style="v" />a inn um hae paw kha ko hae zah, “Do oh, ka vawpaw nynh e Hebru paw hynh aening kha dothatheih khylan aening kalan yn thuakhae! Aning nynh kamaw kha ikhae lan yn teenua zah kae nynh thawte ka sia; <verse number="15" style="v" />aning nynh thawte ka siapaw roi kha he thae tuh, a boeining kha ka pe khe ccuetaw zah atolang po ccue vae,” a ci. <verse number="16" style="v" />Oute a bawipaw innvaw yn thua mawlaezung a bawinung nynh Josef boeining kha a pe khe phang a nung. <verse number="17" style="v" />te a bawipaw innvaw he yn thua tuh a bawinung nynh a la ho vae hawkhate a vawpaw kyakhe, “Aening kalan nae thuakhaepaw Hebru seepaw nynh kamaw kha yn dothatheih zah yn teenua; <verse number="18" style="v" />thuasalama thawte he ka sia tuh, a boeining kha ka pe khe ccuetaw zah atolang po ccue vae,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“E hynh na seepaw nynh ka tungvaw yn cyisahnaw nynh thua,” cite a zu nynh a hopaw bya kha a bawipaw nynh he thae tuh myarya a thinria. <verse number="20" style="v" />Te a bawipaw nynh Josef kha cciakhae zah siapharan kya-e thongccah hae a nungnaw hae thonginn kyakhe a nung, te Josef tuh thong a ccah vae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Thonginn kya Josef</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Josef kha umkhae zah atynpaw sungsahnaw kha a muihsah, te thong uktupaw malang maehoynaw kha a pya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:9">Loc 7.9</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v" />Te thonginn lupi nynh thonginn kya umpaw thongccah hae kha Josef kuih kya a ap, te thonginn kya cyi lan accanpaw pawpaw balyn Josef nynh a cyi. <verse number="23" style="v" />Josef nynh a cyipaw miakaw kha thong uktupaw nynh pawpaw mah dothui vae khyh, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Josef kha umkhae zah a cyipaw miakaw kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a laansui a uasahpya.</para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Josef nynh Maan A Leih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tukoute ccyh sohsoh aro tuh Izip siapharan banang kyngtu bawi te sanlou raetu bawi nynh mih bawipaw Izip siapharan tungvaw a sei hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Faro siapharan tuh banang kyngtu bawi te sanlou raetu bawi, tuh-e lu ning tungvaw a thinria zah <verse number="3" style="v" />Josef thong a sawnaw hae siapharan inn rintu bawi a inn kyakhe minmin kha thong a sawbua hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Siapharan inn rintu bawi nynh Josef kha minmin hanlan ryalawpahtu lang khang zah Josef nynh rya a lawpya hae; te minmin kha khaw cia thong a saw hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Zi kheit tuh tuh-e thongccah hae paw Izip siapharan banang kyngtu bawi te sanlou raetu bawi nynh mimaw raveihte asuilan um kalang paw maan kha a sah kalang hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Awkhua khe Josef nynh minmin kalan he thua tuh, mih lungriathaepaw kha a muih hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Josef nynh a bawipaw inn kya thongccahkheih hae paw Faro kya-e ryalahtu bawi hae kha, “Pawcce atunin nae mitmae hoy khyh rei?” cite a khia hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Minmin nynh Josef kha, “Maan kae sah zah oun leihpah khotu lu kheit sanmah um khyh,” a ci hae. Te Josef nynh, “Maan leih khonaw tuh Pachia te sekuh khyh tou? Nae maan tuh yn hopya tua oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze banang kyngtu bawi nynh a maan kha Josef kalan hynhte a hopya: “Ka maan ze ka malang hin misu ku kukheit a la um, <verse number="10" style="v" />tuh-e misu ku kyatuin aran ran thum a um. A naw he yn toih tuh a paw kha palou yn paw zah a thae tuh palou yn thae vae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Faro banang tuh ka kuih kya ka ccyng, te misu thae kha ka lo zah Faro banang lungkhu kya ka su koute Faro kuih kya ka pya,” a ci. <verse number="12" style="v" />Oute Josef nynh, “Na maan asuilan tuh hynhte nynh thua: Misu aran ran thum tuh nin thum cipaw nynh thua; <verse number="13" style="v" />Nin thum lungkhu Faro nynh thong kyate ae pousah cih zah langmaw na ryalaw kha bua ae pya cih; te banang kyngtu bawi na la thua lyaze na la cyi hawkhate Faro banang kha a kuih kya bua na pya cih. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuhte hoynaw he na tung te, kamaw kha ning leite thaw yn ccih lah kamaw kong kha Faro kya beih la hopah vae ii, tuhcite e thonginn kyate yn luesah bua. <verse number="15" style="v" />Accaccingte ho lanze kamaw hynh Hebru ram kyate oun ru hae; e Izip ram kya mah minmin nynh thongsaw lan ciate pawpaw mah ka cyih khyh,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Maan a leihpaw kha accing cipaw sanlou raetu bawi nynh he a muih tuh, Josef kha, “Kae mah maan ccangkheit ka sah: Ka lu kya sanlou bawng bawngthum ka la khangkuh zah <verse number="17" style="v" />avawlankou umpaw sanlou bawng kyatuin Faro siapharan hanlan sanlou aphuinphuin a um, thuasalama pavaw hae nynh ka lu vawlan umpaw sanlou bawng kya-e kha a la ae hae,” a ci. <verse number="18" style="v" />Te Josef nynh, “Na maan asuilan tuh hynhte nynh thua: Sanlou bawng bawngthum tuh nin thum cipaw nynh thua; <verse number="19" style="v" />nin thum lungkhu Faro siapharan nynh na lu kha ae pae cih. Te na pyn kha thing kya ae sae cih zah pavaw hae nynh na saw kha ae ae cih hae,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nin thumnaw nin tuh Faro pui nin thua zah Faro nynh a ryalawpahtu hae hanlan poi a tuapya hae, te banang kyngtu bawi te sanlou raetu bawi kha tuh-e a ryalawpahtu hae malang khe a pousah hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Faro nynh banang kyngtu bawi kha langmaw a ryalaw kyakhe bua a nung; te aning nynh banang kha Faro kuih kya a pya; <verse number="22" style="v" />thuasalama Josef nynh maan a leihpya hae hawte sanlou raetu bawi kha theih zah a sae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuhzemah banang kyngtu bawi nynh Josef kha liathui leite phe a ning vae.</para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Josef nynh Faro Maan A Leih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum ning he aro koute Faro nynh maansah zah a maan kyaze Nal vawpi pe khe a la thadyn, <verse number="2" style="v" />te puithya zah athopaw vaetua sa sari tuh vawpi lungkhu te oun pou hae zah vawkhu kin umpaw lonua kha a boukuh hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tukoute a muinthah zah angethahpaw vaetua sa sari tuh Nal vawpi kyate oun pou hae zah Nal vaw kin kya umpaw masaty e vaetua hae pe khe a la thadyn hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />A muinthah zah angethahpaw vaetua hae nynh puithya zah athopaw vaetua sa sari kha phe ae hae. Te Faro tuh luih a thaekuh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Oute Faro nynh ih zah vaeningnaw maan a sah; a maan kyaze accan le zah ahoypaw loohku kya-e avui vui sari tuh ku kheit kyate a lethung hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Accan dih zah nithua lang e khisan keiccuze asipaw loohku kya-e avui tuh vui sari a vui hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Te accan dihpaw looh avui hae nynh accan le zah ahoypaw looh avui vui sari kha phe a laang hae. Faro nynh he thaekuh tuh a maan nynh thua cipaw a ny. <verse number="8" style="v" />Khua he yn dae te, Faro tuh a lungriathae; tukeiccuze Izip ram e mitleihthya hae paw te ahaw hae paw balyn kha kosah hae zah Faro nynh a maan kha a hopya hae, thuasalama Faro maan kha a leihpah khopaw lu kheit sanmah um khyh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:2">Dan 2.2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Oute banang kyngtu bawi nynh Faro kha, “Ka seinaw kha atunin ka nykuh cih. <verse number="10" style="v" />Vaekheit tuh Faro nynh a ryalawpahtu hae tungvaw a thinria zah kae te sanlou raetu bawi kha inn rintu bawi a inn kya-e thonginn kyakhe yn nung. <verse number="11" style="v" />Kae te aning nynh zi kheit lungkhu kaemaw raveihte asuilan umpaw maan kha kae sah. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuin kya kaening ryte inn rintu bawi a seepaw Hebru ccangvaepaw a umbua. Kae maan kha kae hopah zah kae maan raveih thyhte yn leihpya. <verse number="13" style="v" />Maan yn leihpya thyhte phe accing; kae nynh langmaw ka ryalaw kha bua ka mue zah sanlou raetupaw kha tuh theih zah a sae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Oute Faro nynh Josef kha kosah hae zah Josef tuh thonginn kyate arangte a cciakhae hae. Josef nynh a khawming kha ngokuh zah uccaw a liakuh koute Faro kalan a tee. <verse number="15" style="v" />Te Faro nynh Josef kha, “Maan ccangkheit ka sah zah a leih khopaw lu kheit sanmah um khyh. Maan kha he na thae ze phe na leih kho cipaw ka thae,” a ci. <verse number="16" style="v" />Josef nynh Faro kha, “E tuh kamaw cyi khonaw thua khyh, Pachia nynh nang kha ahoypaw maan asuilan ae pya cih,” a cipya. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tukoute Faro nynh Josef kha, “Ka maan kyaze Nal vawpi kin khe ka la thadyn; <verse number="18" style="v" />te puithya zah athopaw vaetua sa sari tuh Nal vawpi lungkhu te oun pou hae zah vawpi kin kya popaw lonua kha a boukuh hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuh-e vaetua hae malang khe a muinthah zah angethahpaw ccangpaw vaetua sa sari tuh oun pou hae, tuhte amuinthahpaw vaetua hae tuh Izip ram balyn kya ka muih boi khyh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Muinthah zah angethahpaw vaetua hae nynh masaty e athopaw vaetua sa sari kha phe a ae hae, <verse number="21" style="v" />thuasalama he a ae kou hae te, phe a ae vae hae cipaw kha humhung nynh mah nyh khyh, pawccecize minmin tuh atakaw lya hawte mih muinthah mamin. Tukoute luih ka thaekuh vae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Vaeningnaw ka ih zah ka maan kyaze accan le zah ahoypaw loohku kya-e avui vui sari tuh ku kheit kya a lethung hae, <verse number="23" style="v" />tukoute accan dih zah nithua lang e khisan keiccuze asipaw avui vui sari tuh a vui hae; <verse number="24" style="v" />te accan dihpaw avui hae nynh accan hoypaw vui sari hae kha phe a laang hae. Tuh-e tuh mitleihthya hae paw kya ka hopah hae zah yn leihpah khopaw lu kheit sanmah um khyh,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Oute Josef nynh Faro kha, “Na maan hae tuh phuin kheit thua zah phe lokuh hae; Pachia nynh a cyi lanpaw kha namaw kya ae langsapyaku vae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahoypaw vaetua sa sari tuh kum sari thua zah ahoypaw looh avui vui sari tuh mah kum sari cipaw nynh thua; na maan hae tuh ccangkheit nynh thua hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Nulang te oun pou hae paw vaetua a ngethah zah a muinthah hae paw tuh kum sari cipaw nynh thua. Nithua lang e khisan keiccuze asipaw looh avui vui sari tuh mah ccakannaw kum sari cipaw nynh thua. <verse number="28" style="v" />Phe kae hopya vae hawte nynh thua; Pachia nynh a cyi lanpaw kha namaw kya ae muihsah. <verse number="29" style="v" />Izip ram balyn kya kum sari lungkhu myarya loohvoi cih. <verse number="30" style="v" />Tukoute ccakannaw kum sari yn thua cih zah Izip ram kya loohvoinaw balyn kha phe oun ning cih hae; te ccakannaw nynh ram kha yn roh cih. <verse number="31" style="v" />Oun thua cih paw ccakannaw tuh myarya yn ccih cih keiccuze ram lungkhu looh a la voi boi paw kha oun nyh vae lan khyh hae. <verse number="32" style="v" />Vae ning maan na sahpaw asuilan tuh, e uccaw hynh Pachia nynh phe a khyade vae paw thua zah Pachia nynh taloi yn cyih vae cih cinawpaw nynh thua. <verse number="33" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nang nynh a thya a hawpaw pise lu kheit kha na po cih zah Izip ram a uktu lang na nung cih. <verse number="34" style="v" />E ram kya bawi hae kha na khang cih hae zah kum sari loohvoi lungkhu Izip ram kyate a poupaw pum pangaw pum kheit kha na khoisah cih hae. <verse number="35" style="v" />Minmin nynh oun thua cih paw ahoypaw kum sari kya-e looh kha ccakhung hae sah lah Faro kawhoinaw zakaw khe nung hae sah. Khuapi kya looh kha suelua hae sah lah phang ccy hae sah. <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuh-e looh tuh Izip ram lungkhu yn thua cih paw ccakannaw kum sari lungkhu ae lan ram hanlan nungdaepaw athua cih zah ccakancci lungkhu ram tuh roh vae lan khyh,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Josef tuh Uktu lang A Tang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuh-e bya nynh Faro te a ryalawpahtu balyn kha mih lung a pawsah. <verse number="38" style="v" />Faro nynh a ryalawpahtu hae kha, “Pachia muisaw nynh a umkhaepaw ccangpaw lukhakheit, e ccungccapaw tahawpaw hynh ah muih kho ung cih oh tou?” a ci. <verse number="39" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Faro nynh Josef kha, “E balyn hynh Pachia nynh nang kha ae muihsah vae keiccuze nang hawte a thya a hawpaw lu kheit sanmah um vae lan khyh. <verse number="40" style="v" />Nang tuh ka inn uktu na thua cih zah ka ccungccaw hae nynh na bya kha a ngae cih hae; siapharan tungkhung kya ka dahungpaw kyalya hynh nynh nang laeze ka lehuanawpaw athua cih,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41.40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:10">Loc 7.10</ref></char></note> <verse number="41" style="v" />Te Faro nynh Josef kha, “Nang kha Izip ram balyn a uktu lang kae nung vae,” a cipya. <verse number="42" style="v" />Faro nynh a tazeih kuihpu kha khahkuh zah Josef kuih kya a pusah; myarya hoypaw boeining kha lawsakuh zah suisi kha a oisah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41.42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 5:29">Dan 5.29</ref></char></note> <verse number="43" style="v" />Te siapharan nynh ccangningnaw umpaw a marangle kha ccisakuh zah minmin nynh Josef malang khate, “Nae ccukharutung oh,” cite a sia hae. Tuhcite Faro nynh Izip ram balyn kha a uksah. <verse number="44" style="v" />Tuhpiaze Faro nynh Josef kha, “Kae tuh Faro siapharan nynh ka thua, Izip ram balyn kya na kaw leite humhung nynh mah a kuih a ccu hang lan khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="45" style="v" />Faro nynh Josef kha Zafenath-paneah cite min a phu; te On khua e ranpibawi Potifera ccanung Asenath kha Josef zu lang a pya. Tuhcite Josef tuh Izip ram balyn kha uknaw kaw a mue. <verse number="46" style="v" />Josef nynh Izip siapharan Faro kya ryalaw he a tee lya tuh kum sung thum he acih. Te Josef nynh Faro umnaw kyate pou zah Izip ram balyn kya khua a ccung. <verse number="47" style="v" />Kum sari loohvoi lungkhu laephi nynh looh myarya lung lan a pousah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Izip ram kya looh patae he avoi tuh Josef nynh kum sari lungkhu e looh balyn kha suelua zah khua hae kya a ccakhung; khua pepan umpaw loo hae kya-e looh hae kha khua takyh kya a ccakhung. <verse number="49" style="v" />Josef nynh looh kha rili kya-e laesia hawte myarya alung lan ccakhung zah tou kho um lei lan alung keiccuze tou mah tou vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Ccakanccinaw a thua mawkhe Josef nynh On khua e ranpibawi Potifera ccanung Asenath te ccapaw lu ning a saah hae. <verse number="51" style="v" />Josef nynh atawccaw kha Manasseh<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41.51 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Manasseh </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw hynh Hebru bya kyaze </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ningsah </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cite roi apoupaw te nynh aloku.</char></note> cite min a phu, “Pawccecize Pachia nynh ka vawsawnaw balyn te ka paaw inn balyn kha phe yn ningsah vae,” a ci. <verse number="52" style="v" />Ccapaw lu ningnaw kha Efraim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41.52 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Efraim </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw hynh Hebru bya kyaze </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ccaaw pya </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cite roi apoupaw te nynh aloku.</char></note> cite min a phu. “Pawccecize vawsaw ka tungnaw ram kyakhe Pachia nynh yn pungzaesah vae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Izip ram kya loohvoi kum kumsari tuh yn thang vae; <verse number="54" style="v" />Josef nynh a la ho hawte ccakanccinaw kum sari tuh yn thua vae. Ram takyh kya ccakan accih, thuasalama Izip ram balyn kya tuh looh a um.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41.54: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:11">Loc 7.11</ref></char></note> <verse number="55" style="v" />Izip ram balyn kya ccakan he yn ccih tuh ccungccaw hae nynh looh mue khylan Faro kalan a sia hae. Faro nynh Izip hae kha, “Josef kalan cceih oh lah ae hopya oh paw kha cyih oh,” a cipya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41.55: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:5">Joh 2.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="56" style="v" />Te ccakannaw nynh ram balyn kya pong alekuh tuh Josef nynh looh a ccakhungnawpaw ccunginn balyn kha pong hungpah hae zah Izip hae kha a zuapya hae, pawccecize Izip ram kya myarya ccakanccih. <verse number="57" style="v" />Tuhpiaze laephi vawlan e ccungccaw balyn nynh looh re lan Izip ram e Josef kalan a cceih hae.</para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Josef Uno hae Izip Ram lang Ccianaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jakob nynh Izip ram kya looh a um cipaw he thae tuh a ccapaw hae kha, “Pawcce lu kheit te lu kheit phang na doku oh? <verse number="2" style="v" />Izip ram kya looh a um cite ka thae; ah hiin nawlan oh, te ah chi khyh nawlan oh, la cceih oh lah looh la re oh,” a cipya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:12">Loc 7.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Josef a upaw hae lu haw tuh Izip ram e looh re lan a cceih hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuasalama Jakob nynh Josef a neitaw Benjamin kha a upaw hae kya cciasah bua khyh, pawccecize Benjamin nynh vawsawnaw a tungsei cih cipaw a thinphang. <verse number="5" style="v" />Kanaan ram kya ccakancci keiccuze Israel a ccapaw hae tuh looh re lan cceih hae paw mingccang hae ryte oun thuabua hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Josef tuh ram uktu thua zah ram lungkhu e ccungccaw balyn elang looh a zuapahtu nynh thua. Te Josef a upaw hae tuh oun thua hae zah Josef malang a bakhung hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Josef nynh a upaw hae kha a muih hae tuh phe syntaw hae, thuasalama a nyh leipaw hawte umsakuh zah byarepaw te beih hae zah, “Teitemou nae thua oh?” a ci hae. Minmin nynh, “Looh re lan Kanaan ram te nynh kae thua,” a ci hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Josef nynh a upaw hae kha syntaw hae salamah a upaw hae nynh amaw kha syntaw vae khyh hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Josef nynh a upaw hae konglang maansahpaw kha liathui zah, “Nanning hynh dophitu hae nynh na thua oh, ram a nyaanawpaw do khylan nae thua oh paw nynh thua,” a cipya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:5-10">Gen 37.5-10</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Minmin nynh Josef kha, “Thua khyh, kae bawipaw; na see hae hynh looh re lan kae cceihpaw nynh thua. <verse number="11" style="v" />Kaening tuh lu kheit ccaaw hae, u te neitaw hae nynh kae thua; a ding hae paw nynh kae thua; na see hae hynh dophitu hae papin kae thua khyh,” a ci hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Thuasalama Josef nynh minmin kha, “Thua khyh, nanning hynh ram a ryachinawpaw kha nae do oh paw nynh thua,” a ci. <verse number="13" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “Na see hae kaening hynh Kanaan ram e lu kheit ccaaw hae, u te neitaw hae kae thua zah uno lu haw lae ning kae cih; asoi huapaw tuh kae paaw te nynh atu a um hae, lu kheit tuh um vae khyh,” a ci hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Thuasalama Josef nynh minmin kha, “Ka ho vae hawte nynh thua, nanning tuh dophitu hae nynh na thua oh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Nanning kha pawtemou kae syntawtua cih oh ci zetuh: Faro min te bya ka kinku, nae neitaw asoi huapaw kha hein kya yn thua khyh zetuh e hmin kyate na pou lan khyh oh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Nae bya hynh ahme hme khyh cipaw ny nawlan nanning laku e lu kheit nynh cceihsah lah nae neitaw kha yn thuakhae sah, tuhlaepaw tuh thonginn kya na um cih oh; tuhkhyhze tuh Faro min te bya ka kinku, dophitu hae nynh na thua ccaccing oh,” a ci. <verse number="17" style="v" />Te minmin kha thonginn kya nin thum cia pynkheihlan a nung hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nin thumnaw nin kya Josef nynh minmin kha, “E hynh cyih oh lah na hiin cih oh, pawccecize Pachia kha ka rih: <verse number="19" style="v" />nanning hynh a dingpaw na thua oh zetuh nanning lakuze lu kheit kha na umnaw oh thonginn kya umsah. Tuhlaepaw tuh nae innbyn kya ccakancci keiccuze looh kha phukute cceih oh lah <verse number="20" style="v" />nae neitaw asoi huapaw kha kamaw kalan oun cciakhae oh. Tuhte na cyi oh zetuh nae bya tuh ahmepaw athua cih zah na hiin cih oh,” a cipya hae. Te minmin nynh tuhte cyi lan mih naw a ccah. <verse number="21" style="v" />Minmin nynh lu kheit te lu kheit kha, “Aening nynh ah neitawpaw tungvaw ah la cyi oh paw hanlan detahnaw ah tung vae oh; aning nynh oun soihbia zah a vawsawnaw mang ah muih oh pite ah ngaepah khyh oh. Tukeiccuze e vawsawnaw hynh ah tungvaw a ccah vae,” a ciku hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Te Reuben nynh minmin kha, “Imuapaw tungvaw sei nan oh sih cite kae hopah khyh oh tou? Thuasalama na ngae khyh oh. Tukeiccuze amaw a chii keiccuze e vawsawnaw nynh oun thuanua vae,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:21-22">Gen 37.21-22</ref></char></note> <verse number="23" style="v" />A hoku hae paw kha Josef nynh phe a ny cipaw minmin nynh nyh khyh hae, pawccecize Josef nynh byaleihtu kha mang zah bya a hopya hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Josef nynh minmin kyate toikuh zah a rah; tukoute bua yn ki zah minmin kha bya a beih hae. Te Simeon kha ko zah mih malang khe phang a he.</para>
  <para style="s1">Josef A U hae Kanaan lang A Ki hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Josef nynh, “Mih sungkua kya looh kha phe beih lan ruinpah oh, mih phua kha mih lathin sungkua raveih kya na sangpah cih oh zah laanryng hanlan vaelooh kha na pya cih oh,” cite kaw a pya hae. Tuhcite minmin hanlan a cyipya hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Minmin nynh mih lann hae kha looh phusah hae zah a cceih vae hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Khuazi ryanaw hmin kyakhe minmin laku e lu kheit nynh a lann kha aepaw pya lan cite a lathin sungkua kha he phou tuh a phua kha lathin sungkua kyakhe a muih. <verse number="28" style="v" />A uno hae kyakhe, “Ka phua kha bua oun nungpya hae; ka sungkua kya phua phang um rei!” a cipya hae. Minmin nynh mih bungzou zah mih rikaw phe thua lante lu kheit te lu kheit kha, “Pachia nynh aening tungvaw a cyipaw hynh paw a rynaw mou thua?” a ciku hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Minmin nynh Kanaan ram e mih paaw Jakob kya he thua hae tuh, mih tungvaw a cyihkuhpaw balyn kha a hopya hae; <verse number="30" style="v" />“Ram uktu bawi nynh byarepaw te oun beih zah, ram kya dophitu hae nynh na thua oh, oun ci. <verse number="31" style="v" />Thuasalama kaening nynh, ‘Kaening tuh a ding hae paw kae thua zah aphirute thongpang lahtu hae kae thua khyh. <verse number="32" style="v" />Kae paaw nynh oun saahkheih paw uno lu haw lae ning nynh kae thua; lu kheit tuh um vae khyh, asoi huapaw tuh kae paaw te Kanaan ram kya nynh atu a umkheih hae,’ kae cipya. <verse number="33" style="v" />Te ram uktu bawi nynh kaening kha, ‘Nanning tuh a ding hae paw nynh na thua oh cipaw ka ny nawlan, nae uno lukhakheit kha kamaw kya cciataw oh, nae innbyn kya ccakancci keiccuze looh kha phukuh oh lah cceih oh. <verse number="34" style="v" />Nae neitaw asoi huapaw kha kamaw kalan nae cciakhae cih oh, tetuh nanning hynh a ding hae paw na thua oh zah dophitu hae na thua khyh oh cipaw ka nyh vae cih. Te nae unopaw kha naemaw kalan bua kae sawpah cih oh zah, e ram kya kung na ku cih oh,’ oun cipya,” cite a hopya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mih lathin sungkua kya-e looh kha he a boh hae tuh mih phuabu raveih tuh mih lathin sungkua raveih kya ccarou a la um. Minmin te mih paaw nynh mih phuabu hae kha he a muih hae tuh mih rikawthua. <verse number="36" style="v" />Te mih paaw Jakob nynh minmin kha, “Nanning nynh kae kha ccaaw leite nae nung vae oh: Josef mah um vae khyh zah Simeon mah um vae khyh, te atu Benjamin mah bua na cciakhae vae cih oh. Hynh-e balyn hynh ka tungvaw acyihkuh vae,” a ci. <verse number="37" style="v" />Oute Reuben nynh a paaw kha, “Namaw kalan Benjamin kha bua kae thuakhae khyh zetuh ka ccapaw hae lu ning kha na theih cih hae. Amaw kha ka kuih kya yn ap lah namaw kalan bua kae thuakhae cih,” a cipya. <verse number="38" style="v" />Thuasalama a paaw nynh, “Ka ccapaw kha namaw kya cceihbua lan khyh, pawccecize a upaw tuh phe chih vae zah, amaw makhae nynh a um vae. Na ccianaw oh laanryng khe a chisei zetuh nanning nynh ka sang phe paw vae paw hynh ngaethyanaw te michi khua lang nae cciasah sei cih oh,” a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Benjamin te Izip lang A Cceih hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kanaan ram kya myarya ccakan accih. <verse number="2" style="v" />Izip ram kyate a phu hae paw looh phe thang lan a ae hae tuh mih paaw nynh minmin kha, “Bua la cceih oh lah looh beihtaraw oun re oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Thuasalama Judah nynh a paaw kha, “Ccungccapaw nynh, ‘Nae neitawpaw kha nae thuakhae khyh oh zetuh ka mitmae nae muih lan khyh oh,’ cite oun cipah zah, ccaerarih lan raeringnaw oun pya. <verse number="4" style="v" />Kae neitawpaw kha kaening ryte nae sawpya zetuh kae cceihbung cih zah looh kha kae repah cih; <verse number="5" style="v" />thuasalama amaw kha nae sawpya khyh zetuh kae cceih lan khyh, pawccecize ccungccapaw nynh, ‘Nae neitawpaw yn cciabua khyh zetuh ka mitmae nae muih lan khyh oh,’ cite oun cipya,” a ci. <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel nynh, “Ccangpaw neitaw kae hoi ung cite ccungccapaw kha hopyate pawcce kae kha lungriathaenaw nae pya oh?” a ci. <verse number="7" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “Ccungccapaw nynh kaemaw te kae puizia hae kong kha pekite oun khia zah, ‘Nae paaw a hiin ung tou? Ccangpaw neitaw na hoi ung oh tou?’ cite oun ci. Tuhte bya oun khia keiccu nynh amaw kha kae hopya. ‘Nae neitawpaw kha oun thuakhae oh,’ cite oun ci lanpaw kha kae nyh kho cih zawtou?” a ci hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Oute Judah nynh a paaw Israel kha, “Imuapaw hynh kamaw kya cciasah bua lah kae la cceih sah; tuhte rou nynh namaw, kaemaw te kae ccaaw hae hynh ah hiin cih oh zah ah chih lan khyh oh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Kamaw ccaccei hynh amaw hanlan aamahkhan ka thua cih; amaw hanlan ka tungvaw tavuan yn pya. Amaw kha na kalan ngedante hoyrarih lan bua kae thuakhae khyh zetuh seiphusahnaw kha zungzae ka ing sah. <verse number="10" style="v" />Hynhte accyh kae la sung khyh zetuh, atu hynh vae ning kae leihkuh vae cih paw,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Oute mih paaw Israel nynh, “Tuhte athua zetuh hynhte cyih oh: Kanaan ram e ahoy huapaw thingthae phin, balm thingphi beihtaraw, khoilutui beihtaraw, ehang kya thungpaw mynkhuhpaw, pistakhio thae, akaloh thaawpaw thingthae te almon thae kha nae sungkua kya sangkuh oh lah tuh-e ccungccapaw hanlan lasung lang la phupah oh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Phua kha leit ning alung lante phu oh. Nae sungkua kya nae kikhae oh paw phua kha bua la phu oh; a mesei hae paw nynh thua cih. <verse number="13" style="v" />Nae neitawpaw mah ko oh lah tuh-e ccungccapaw kalan bua la cceih oh; <verse number="14" style="v" />tuh-e ccungccapaw nynh nae uno lu kheit te Benjamin kha bua oun kisahnaw lan hae, Alesaepaw Pachia nynh tuh-e ccungccapaw malang thaw ae la ccih vae oh sah, kae tuh ka ccapaw hae hanlan rawkhui lan accan ze ka rah vae cih latu,” a ci. <verse number="15" style="v" />Minmin nynh lasung, phua leit ning ryte Benjamin kha Izip ram lang cciakhae hae zah Josef malang a thuakhae hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Josef nynh minmin ryte Benjamin kha he a muih tuh, a inn e ryalahtupaw kyakhe, “Minmin kha inn lungkhu lang teekhae hae lah saw sa kheit theih lah aepaw kha la paccyn; pawccecize minmin ryte ninthu kae aekheih cih,” a cipya. <verse number="17" style="v" />Josef nynh a ho hawte tuh-e ccungccapaw nynh minmin kha Josef inn lang a cciakhae hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Josef inn lang he cciakhae hae tuh, minmin nynh rih hae zah, “Anuhlang lyaze ah sungkua kya oun kisahkhaeku paw phua keiccu nynh oun teekhae hae. Aening kha seinaw ccungpyate see lang oun tangsah cih zah lann hae kha oun lua cih,” a ciku hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Josef inn kya ryalahtupaw kalan cceih hae zah thuakaw zung kyakhe, <verse number="20" style="v" />“Bawipaw, anulang lya looh re lan vaekheit kae thua boi vae, <verse number="21" style="v" />khuazi ryanaw kya kae thua zah kae sungkua kha he kae phou tuh, kae lathin sungkua kya kae phua raveih kha phe ccing lan a la um. Tuh-e tuh atu bua kae phubia. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuhpiaze looh re nawlan phua kha alae lante kae phubia. Kae phua kha kae sungkua kya hum nynh mah oun sangpah cipaw kae nyh khyh,” cite a hopya hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Aning nynh, “Nae lungdaesah, nae thinphang nan sah, nae Pachia te nae paaw a Pachia nynh nae sungkua kya sisua kha ae sangpya oh paw nynh athua cih; nae phua kha phe ka mue,” a ci. Oute Simeon kha minmin kalan khe a thuakhaepya hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuh-e paw nynh minmin kha Josef inn lang a cciakhae hae, tui kha pya hae zah mih ccu kha a singku hae, mih lann hae kha mah aepaw a pya hae, <verse number="25" style="v" />minmin nynh ninthu ccyh kya yn thua cih paw Josef hanlan lasung kha phe a paccyn ty vae hae, pawccecize minmin nynh tuh-e inn kya ae lan cipaw phe a thae vae hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Josef nynh innvaw he a thua tuh minmin nynh inn lungkhu lang a teekhae hae paw lasung kha ccyngpah hae zah amaw malang khe laekhu kya a bakhung hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Josef nynh minmin kha bya a beih kou hae te, “Na ho oh paw a taw vae paw nae paaw so a dan tou? A hiin ung tou?” cite khia hae zah <verse number="28" style="v" />minmin nynh, “Na seepaw kae paaw tuh mang a dan; mang a hiin ung,” a cipya hae. Te minmin nynh mih lu baling hae zah sawtuanaw kha a pya hae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Oute Josef nynh ngawdo zah a nung ccapaw, a neitaw Benjamin kha he a muih tuh, “E hynh nae hopya oh paw, nae neitaw asoi huapaw tuh athua tou? Ka ccapaw, Pachia nynh thaw ae ccih vae sah,” a cipya. <verse number="30" style="v" />Josef nynh a neitaw kha muih zah myaryamaw a sungsah keiccuze a rawthua zah arangte a toikuh. Te amaw khaan lungkhu lang tee zah a rah. <verse number="31" style="v" />Oute a maelahkuh koute bua yn pou; te aning nynh phang yhkuh zah, “Aepaw tuh yn paccynpah oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="32" style="v" />Josef hanlan ccaboi ccangkheit, a upaw hae hanlan ccaboi ccangkheit, te Josef te a aekheih hae paw Izip hae hanlan ccaboi ccangkheit khate aepaw kha a paccyn hae, pawccecize tuh-e tuh Izip hae nynh Hebru hae kha a zawpuinaw hae paw nynh thua. <verse number="33" style="v" />Josef a uno hae kha Josef malang khe atawccaw tahyhte alepaw kyate adihpaw kyacia po a haungsah hae. Tukeiccuze Josef a uno hae nynh mimaw te mimaw kha dokuh hae zah mih ngaeangthua. <verse number="34" style="v" />Josef ccaboi kyate minmin kha aepaw a pya hae. Benjamin tuh a upaw hae laeze leit pangaw alunghua lante looh kha a mue. Tuhcite minmin nynh neih hae zah Josef ryte a hoysah hae.</para>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Banang Azo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Oute Josef nynh a inn kya ryalahtupaw kha, “Minmin nynh a phu kho hae thyhte mih sungkua kya looh kha phe beih lan ruinpah hae lah mih phua raveih kha mih sungkua raveih kya sangpah hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Asoi huapaw kya-e sungkua kyakhe ngun banang te looh mee lang yn phupaw phua kha sangpah,” a cipya. Te Josef nynh a hopya thyhte aning nynh a cyi. <verse number="3" style="v" />Awkhua he yn aw tuh mih lann hae ryte minmin kha a cciasah vae hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Minmin nynh khua kyate eih asaw leinaw cia he a cceih hae khe, Josef nynh a ryalawpahtupaw kha, “Cceih lah minmin kha la deehui hae; he na phah hae te minmin kha, ‘Pawcce ahoypaw kha ahoy leipaw te nae liaru oh? Pawcce ka ngun banang kha na ru oh? <verse number="5" style="v" />E hynh ka bawipaw nynh a nianawpaw banang thua khyh tou? Malang yn cyihkuh lanpaw kha ny nawlan a mangpaw banang thua khyh tou? E na cyi oh paw hynh phe na sei oh,’ cite la hopah hae,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aning nynh minmin kha he a phah hae tuh khah-e bya kha a hopya hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “E bya hynh bawipaw nynh pawcce a ho? Tuhte cyi lanpaw tuh na see hae nynh tua mah kae tua boi khyh! <verse number="8" style="v" />Kae sungkua kya kae muihpaw phua kha Kanaan ram kyate namaw kalan phe kae kikhae vae; na bawipaw inn kya-e sui thuasah, ngun thuasah, pawcce kae ru lanpaw tuh? <verse number="9" style="v" />Na see hae lukhakheit kyakhe tuh-e uccaw kha muih athua zetuh, tuh-e paw tuh chihsah; tuhpiaze tuhlaepaw kaening balyn hynh bawipaw see lang kae tang cih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Aning nynh, “Na ho oh hawte thuasah; amaw kya banang muih athuapaw tuh ka see lang a tang cih, thuasalama tuhlaepaw tuh na la cceih cih oh,” a ci. <verse number="11" style="v" />Oute minmin nynh mih sungkua raveih kha laephi kya nyakuh hae zah mih sungkua kha a phou hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Aning nynh atawccaw kyate asoi huapaw kyacia he ccung tuh, banang kha Benjamin sungkua kya a muih. <verse number="13" style="v" />Minmin nynh mih ngaethah zah mih uccaw kha a sei hae. Te mih lann raveih tungvaw khe mih uccaw kha khang hae zah khua lang a ki vae hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Judah te a uno hae tuh Josef innvaw a la um lyakhe oun thua hae; te minmin nynh Josef malang a bakhung hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Josef nynh, “Pawcce hynhte na cyi oh? Kae tahawpaw ccungccaw nynh tuh malang yn cyihkuh lanpaw kha phe a ny kho cipaw na nyh khyh oh tou?” a cipya hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Te Judah nynh, “Bawipaw, namaw kya pawmou kae ho kho cih? Kaemaw kong kha pawtemou ccaerarih lan kae hopah thya cih? Pachia nynh na see hae seinaw kha phe muih vae; kaening tuh a uccaw kya banang muih athuapaw ryte ka bawipaw see hae nynh kae thua,” a cipya. <verse number="17" style="v" />Josef nynh, “Tuhte ka cyih lan khyh, a uccaw kya banang muih athuapaw ccungccaw rou nynh ka see lang a tang cih; thuasalama nanning tuh nae paaw kalan daetedae lan la cceih oh,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Judah nynh Benjamin Lue nawlan A Ngia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Oute Judah nynh amaw kalan naekuh zah, “Pou ka bawipaw, na seepaw kae nynh ka bawipaw na nakaring kya bya kaw kheit beih kae hopah lah na seepaw tungvaw na thinria nan sah; pawccecize nang tuh Faro te na lae khyh oh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Bawipaw, nang nynh kaening kha, ‘Nae paaw na hoi oh tou? Nae neitaw na hoi oh tou?’ cite nae khia. <verse number="20" style="v" />Te kaening nynh, ‘A taw vae paw paaw kae hoi, te kae paaw nynh a kum phe tang te a saahpaw imua, kae neitaw lu kheit kae hoi. A upaw tuh phe chih vae; a nung nynh a saah hae paw ccaaw hae kyaze amaw makhae nynh a um vae, tukeiccuze a paaw nynh myarya a sungsah,’ cite ka bawipaw kha kae hopya. <verse number="21" style="v" />Te nang nynh na see hae kaening kha, ‘Tuh-e paw tuh ka muihtua ccaw, ka kalan oun cciakhae oh,’ nae cipya. <verse number="22" style="v" />Kaening nynh, ‘Imuapaw nynh a paaw kha phiakuh kho lan khyh, pawccecize aning nynh a paaw kha a cciataw zetuh a paaw tuh a chihsei cih,’ cite kae hopya. <verse number="23" style="v" />Oute nang nynh, ‘Nae neitaw asoi huapaw yn cciabua khyh zetuh ka mitmae kha nae muih vae lan khyh oh,’ cite na see hae kaening kha nae cipya. <verse number="24" style="v" />Kaening nynh na seepaw kae paaw kalan kae ki zah ka bawipaw na bya kha kae hopya. <verse number="25" style="v" />Te kae paaw nynh, ‘Bua la cceih oh lah aening hanlan looh beihtaraw kha oun re oh,’ cite oun hopah zah <verse number="26" style="v" />kaening nynh, ‘Kae cceih kho lan khyh, kae neitaw asoi huapaw a cciabua ze rou nynh kae cceih cih; pawccecize kae neitaw asoi huapaw a cciabua khyh zetuh khah-e paw a mitmae kha kae muih kho lan khyh,’ kae cipya. <verse number="27" style="v" />Oute na seepaw kae paaw nynh, ‘Ccapaw lu ning kha ka zu nynh yn saahpya cipaw phe na ny oh; <verse number="28" style="v" />lu kheit tuh phe yn cciataw vae, amaw kha saw nynh zoihtatyh lan phe a pae ccaccing vae cite ka ci; tuin kyate amaw kha ka muih boi vae khyh. <verse number="29" style="v" />E lu kheit hynh mah kamaw kyate na cciakhae oh zah vawsawnaw a tungsei zetuh nanning nynh ka sang phe paw vae paw hynh ngaethyanaw te michi khua lang nae cciasah sei cih oh,’ oun cipya. <verse number="30" style="v" />Tukeiccuze kae nynh imuapaw leite na seepaw ka paaw kya ka thua zetuh ka paaw hiinnaw tuh imuapaw hiinnaw kya akyngkuhpaw thua zah <verse number="31" style="v" />imuapaw nynh kaemaw kya a umbua khyhpaw kha ka paaw nynh he a muih tuh a chih vae cih; te na see hae kaening nynh a sang phe paw vae paw, na seepaw kae paaw kha ngaethyanaw te Michi khua lang kae cciasah sei cih. <verse number="32" style="v" />Te na seepaw kae nynh, ‘Imuapaw hynh ka paaw kalan bua kae kikhae khyh zetuh ka paaw malang seiphusahnaw kha ka hiin lungkhu ka ing vae sah,’ cite ka hopya keiccuze kae tuh ka paaw kya imuapaw hanlan aamahkhan nynh ka thua. <verse number="33" style="v" />Tukeiccuze na seepaw kae hynh imuapaw ccelang namaw kya see lang beih kae tangsah lah imuapaw hynh tuh a upaw hae ryte la kibua sah. <verse number="34" style="v" />Pawccecize imuapaw leite pawtemou ka paaw kalan ka ki ngan cih? Ka paaw nynh a tung lanpaw teingnaw kha muih lan ka rih,” a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Josef nynh Amaw Kong A Ho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Oute Josef nynh a pe thadyn hae paw malang khe yhkuh kho vae khyh zah, “Ka kyate pong toisakuh oh,” cite a sia. Tukeiccuze Josef nynh a uno hae kya amaw kha he a nysakuh hae tuh, milae lu kheit sanmah umbua vae khyh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:13">Loc 7.13</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Te Josef nynh raerae ccae lan a rawpaw kha Izip hae te Faro innbyn hae nynh phe a thae hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Josef nynh a uno hae kha, “Kae hynh Josef nynh ka thua. Apang a hiin ung tou?” a ci. Thuasalama a uno hae tuh Josef malang mih rikawthua zah byakhung kho khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Oute Josef nynh a uno hae kha, “Ka kalan oun naeku tua oh,” cipah hae zah minmin nynh a naeku hae. Te aning nynh, “Kae hynh Izip ram lang nae zua oh paw nae neitaw Josef nynh ka thua. <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuasalama nanning nynh Izip ram lang nae la zua oh keiccuze nae ngaethah nan sah, naemaw te naemaw mah thinriakuh nan oh; pawccecize ccungccaw hiinnaw khum khylan Pachia nynh nae malang yn la saw. <verse number="6" style="v" />Ram lungkhu kum ning ccakanccih vae; atu te kum pangaw lungkhu loophonaw te loohruenaw yn um lan khyh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Pachia nynh nanning kha laephi vawlan khum khylan te alepaw luenaw liate nae hiinnaw kha khum khylan kae kha nae malang yn la saw. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nanning nynh Izip ram lang nae saw oh paw thua leite Pachia nynh yn la sawpaw nynh thua; Pachia nynh kae hynh Faro a paaw lante thuasah, siapharan inn a uktu lante thuasah, Izip ram balyn a uktu lante thuasah yn nung. <verse number="9" style="v" />Apang kalan arangte la cceih oh lah la hopah oh, Josef nynh, ‘Pachia nynh na ccapaw kamaw kha Izip ram balyn a uktu lang yn nung vae; accyh rosah leite kamaw kalan yn cceih,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45.9-11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:14">Loc 7.14</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Goshen kya khua na sah cih zah kamaw te naeku lan, te namaw, na ccaaw hae, na mintaw hae, na tuu hae, na miaa hae, na vaetua hae te na hoipaw balyn ryte na um cih oh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Ccakan hynh kum pangaw yn ccih ung cih, tukeiccuze namaw te na innbyn hae, te na hoipaw balyn ryte ryachinaw kya na um khyh nawlan oh, Goshen kyakhe kamaw nynh kae bawm cih oh,’ a ci cite la hopah oh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka mung te nanning kae hopya oh paw kha nae mit te ka neitawpaw Benjamin mit nynh phe a muih. <verse number="13" style="v" />Kae nynh Izip ram kya pawcih alepaw sawtuanaw mou ka mue cipaw te na muih oh paw balyn kha apang kya na la hopah cih oh. Arangte la cceih oh lah apang kha hynh-e kalan oun cciakhae bung oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Oute a neitaw Benjamin kha kui zah a rah; Benjamin nynh mah kui zah a rah. <verse number="15" style="v" />Te a upaw hae balyn kha myng hae zah a rah; tukoute a upaw hae ryte bya a hokuh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Josef a uno hae phe thua vae hae,” cipaw Faro inn kya thongpang he thae hae tuh, Faro te a ryalawpahtu hae tuh mih lungtua. <verse number="17" style="v" />Faro nynh Josef kha, “Na uno hae kyakhe, ‘Nae uccaw kha nae sahiin hae tungvaw khe khang oh lah, Kanaan ram lang la ki oh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Nae paaw te nae innbyn hae kha kamaw kalan oun cciakhae oh lah, Izip ram ze ahoy huapaw loram kha kae pya cih oh zah loram kya-e apaw-athae kha na ae cih oh,’ cite hopah hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw na hopya lan hae paw tuh, ‘Nae zu hae te nae imua hae hanlan Izip ram e marangle kha cciakhae oh, te nae paaw kha oun ko oh lah oun cceih oh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Nae sisua hanlan nae thindae nan sah, pawccecize Izip ram balyn ze ahoy huapaw tuh nae uccaw nynh thua,’ cite hopah hae,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel a ccapaw hae nynh tuhcite a cyi hae. Faro nynh a hopya thyhte Josef nynh minmin kha marangle a pya hae, te laanryng hanlan vaelooh kha mah a pya hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Minmin lu kheit cci hanlan liakunawpaw uccaw zung kheit cci kha a pya hae; thuasalama Benjamin kha ngunphua za thum te liakunawpaw uccaw zung pangaw kha a pya. <verse number="23" style="v" />A paaw elang Izip ram e ahoy huapaw uccaw hae a phupaw lann sa haw te laanryng kya a paaw ae lanpaw looh, sanlou te vaelooh a phupaw lann pinung sa haw kha a ky. <verse number="24" style="v" />A uno hae kha, “Laanryng kya la pekuh nan oh,” cipah hae zah a cciasah hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Izip kyate cceih hae zah Kanaan ram umpaw mih paaw Jakob kya a thua hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Te minmin nynh mih paaw kyakhe, “Josef tuh phang hiin ung! Aning tuh Izip ram balyn a uktu nynh thua,” a cipya hae. Jakob tuh mangtaran cih zah minmin kha zyn kho khyh hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Thuasalama minmin nynh mih paaw Jakob kyakhe Josef nynh a hopaw balyn kha hopah hae zah mih paaw nynh Izip ram lang a ccianaw lanpaw marangle Josef nynh a kypaw kha he a muih tuh, a lung bua yn cci vae; <verse number="28" style="v" />te Israel nynh, “Ka ccapaw Josef a hiin ung cipaw ka thae nyngkae tuh phe zaw vae; ka cceih cih zah ka chi maw amaw kha ka muih cih,” a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jakob Izip lang A Cceih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel nynh a hoipaw balyn ryte cceih zah Beersheba kya he a thua tuh, a paaw Isak Pachia kalan silawnaw a rae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Pachia nynh Israel kha khuazi vizin kyate, “Jakob, Jakob,” cite ko zah Jakob nynh, “Hein kya mang ka um,” a ci. <verse number="3" style="v" />Oute Pachia nynh, “Kae tuh Pachia nynh ka thua, na paaw a Pachia nynh ka thua; Izip ram lang ccia lanpaw kha rih nan, pawccecize tuin kya nang kha minphuin alepaw lang kae rae cih. <verse number="4" style="v" />Kamaw ccaccei nynh nang kha Izip ram lang kae cciakhae bung cih, te nang kha bua kae kikhae thung cih; Josef nynh a kuih te na mit kha ae masisah cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jakob tuh Beersheba kyate a cceih; te Israel ccapaw hae nynh mih paaw Jakob, mih ccaaw hae te mih zu hae kha Jakob nynh a cciku lan cite Faro nynh a kypaw marangle khate a cciakhae hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Minmin nynh Kanaan ram kya a mue hae paw mih sahiin hae te mih uccaw hae ryte Izip ram lang a cceih hae, Jakob nynh a ciihan balyn kha a cciakhae hae:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:15">Loc 7.15</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />a ccapaw hae, a ccapaw hae mih ccapaw hae, a ccanung hae, a ccapaw hae mih ccanung hae kha Izip ram lang pong a cciakhae hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Izip ram lang a cceih hae paw Israel ciihan hae mih min tuh hynhte nynh thua. Jakob te a ccaaw hae: Jakob a ccatawccaw tuh Reuben, <verse number="9" style="v" />te Reuben ccapaw hae tuh: Hanok, Pallu, Hezron te Karmi. <verse number="10" style="v" />Simeon ccapaw hae tuh: Jemuel, Jamin, Ohad, Jakhin, Zohar, te Kanaan minphuinnung a ccapaw Shaul. <verse number="11" style="v" />Levi ccaaw hae tuh: Gershon, Kohath te Merari. <verse number="12" style="v" />Judah ccaaw hae tuh: Er, Onan, Shelah, Perez te Zerah (Er te Onan tuh Kanaan ram kya a chih hae). Perez ccaaw hae tuh Hezron te Hamul nynh thua hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Isakhar ccaaw hae tuh: Tola, Puvah, Jashub te Shimron. <verse number="14" style="v" />Zebulun ccaaw hae tuh: Sered, Elon, te Jahleel. <verse number="15" style="v" />(E hae hynh a ccanung Dinah ryte Paddan-aram kya Leah nynh Jakob a saahpya hae paw nynh thua; a ccapaw hae te a ccanung hae mih balyn te sung thum lu thum acih hae). <verse number="16" style="v" />Gad ccaaw hae tuh: Zefon, Haggi, Shuni, Ezbon, Eri, Arodi, te Areli. <verse number="17" style="v" />Asher ccaaw hae tuh: Imnah, Ishvah, Ishvi, Beriah, te mih ccianung Serah. Beriah ccaaw hae tuh Heber te Malkhiel <verse number="18" style="v" />(E hae tuh Laban nynh a ccanung Leah a pyapaw Zilpah a ccaaw hae nynh thua; e hae hynh Zilpah nynh Jakob a saahpya hae paw thua zah mih balyn te lu haw lae taruh acih hae). <verse number="19" style="v" />Jakob zu Rachel a ccaaw hae tuh: Josef te Benjamin nynh thua hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Izip ram umpaw On khua e ranpibawi Potifera ccanung Asenath nynh Izip ram kya Josef hanlan Manasseh te Efraim kha a saahpya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:50-52">Gen 41.50-52</ref></char></note> <verse number="21" style="v" />Benjamin ccaaw hae tuh: Bela, Bekher, Ashbel, Gera, Naaman, Ehi, Rosh, Muppim, Huppim, te Ard. <verse number="22" style="v" />(E hae hynh Rachel nynh Jakob a saahpya hae paw thua zah mih balynte lu haw lae pali acih hae). <verse number="23" style="v" />Dan ccapaw tuh Hushim nynh thua. <verse number="24" style="v" />Naftali ccaaw hae tuh: Jahzeel, Guni, Jezer, te Shillem. <verse number="25" style="v" />(E hae tuh Laban nynh a ccanung Rachel a pyapaw Bilhah ccaaw hae nynh thua; e hae hynh Bilhah nynh Jakob a saahpya hae paw thua zah mih balynte lu sari acih hae). <verse number="26" style="v" />Jakob monung hae hobia leite, Jakob ryte Izip ram lang cceih hae paw Jakob ciihan hae tuh mih balynte sung taruh lu taruh acih hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Josef nynh Izip ram kya ccapaw lu ning a saah hae; tukeiccuze Izip ram lang cceih hae paw Jakob innbyn hae tuh mih balynte sung sari acih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46.27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:14">Loc 7.14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Goshen kya Jakob A Um</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jakob nynh Judah kha Josef kalan Goshen ram lang laanpi do ty khylan malang a saw. Goshen ram kya he a thua hae tuh, <verse number="29" style="v" />Josef nynh a marangle kha paccynsah hae zah a paaw Israel kha Goshen ram kya tungku khylan a cceih. A paaw malang he a thua tuh, a paaw kha kui zah khaw cia a rah. <verse number="30" style="v" />Israel nynh Josef kha, “Na mitmae kha phe ka muih vae zah na hiin ung cipaw ka ny vae keiccuze atu ka chi zemah pawtua-ung vae khyh,” a ci. <verse number="31" style="v" />Josef nynh a uno hae te a paaw innbyn hae kha, “Faro kalan ka cceih cih zah, ‘Kanaan ram umpaw ka uno hae te ka paaw innbyn hae tuh kamaw kya oun thua vae hae. <verse number="32" style="v" />Minmin tuh tuurin hae thua hae zah sahiin a kua hae paw nynh thua hae; te mih tuuphu, mih sahiin phu te mih hoipaw balyn kha oun thuakhae hae,’ cite ka hopah cih. <verse number="33" style="v" />Faro nynh he ae ko oh zah, ‘Paw rya mou na law oh?’ cite ae khia oh ze <verse number="34" style="v" />‘Na see hae kaening tuh kae minpaaw hae kyate tho zah kae ditaraw lyate atu cia sahiin a kua hae paw nynh kae thua,’ cite na hopah cih oh. Tuhteze tuh Goshen ram kya na um kho cih oh, pawccecize Izip hae tuh tuurin hae paw miakaw kha a hua hae paw nynh thua hae,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Josef nynh cceih zah Faro kha, “Ka paaw te ka uno hae tuh mih tuuphu hae te mih vaetua phu hae, a hoi hae paw uccaw balyn ryte Kanaan ram kyate oun thua vae hae; atu Goshen ram kya nynh a um hae,” a cipya. <verse number="2" style="v" />A upaw hae laku e lu pangaw kha ko hae zah Faro kalan a cciakhae hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Faro nynh a upaw kha, “Paw ryalaw mou leih na law oh?” cite khia hae zah minmin nynh, “Na see hae kaening tuh kae minpaaw hae hawte tuurin hae nynh kae thua,” a ci hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Minmin nynh Faro kha, “E ram kya ramccang ccungccaw hae hawte um khylan kae thua vae; pawccecize Kanaan ram kya myarya ccakancci keiccuze kae sahiin phu hae hanlan ram um vae khyh. Tukeiccuze na see hae kaening hynh Goshen ram kya nae umsah nawlan kae ngiaku,” a cipya hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Oute Faro nynh Josef kha, “Na paaw te na uno hae tuh namaw kalan oun thua vae hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Izip ram tuh na kuih kya nynh a um; na paaw te na uno hae tuh ram kyaze ahoy huapaw hmin kya khuasah sah hae; Goshen ram kya um hae sah; te minmin lakuze cyi khonaw a hoi hae paw na ny zetuh ka sahiin kuanaw kya uktu hae lang na nung cih hae,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Oute Josef nynh a paaw Jakob kha teekhae zah Faro malang a thuakhae, te Jakob nynh Faro kha hythua a pya. <verse number="8" style="v" />Faro nynh Jakob kha, “Kum hohzeihmou na cih vae?” cite a khia. <verse number="9" style="v" />Jakob nynh, “Ka khiavuikunaw hynh za kheit kum sung thum acih vae; ka hiinnaw kum tuh zya salamah kou maw aru. A khiavuikuh hae paw ka minpaaw hae kum asaepaw te touse khinpaw thua khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="10" style="v" />Oute Jakob nynh Faro kha hythuapya zah Faro umnaw kyate a cceih vae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Faro nynh kawpya thyhte Josef nynh a paaw te a uno hae kha umnaw pya hae zah Izip ram kyaze ahoy huanaw Rameses ram kha a pya hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Te Josef nynh a paaw, a uno hae te a paaw innbyn hae balyn kha milu alung azya thyhte looh a pya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Izip Ram kya Ccakannaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ccakan myarya acci keiccuze ram balyn kya looh um vae khyh. Ccakan keiccuze Izip ram te Kanaan ram tuh mih thaw azya. <verse number="14" style="v" />Josef nynh Izip ram te Kanaan ram kya-e looh a renaw hae paw phua balyn kha suelua zah Faro siapharan inn lang a cciakhae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Izip ram te Kanaan ram kya-e phua kha pong a mang hae tuh Izip hae balyn nynh Josef kalan cceih hae zah, “Looh oun pyatua! Pawcce na muihnaw kya kae chih cih? Pawccecize kae phua phe thang vae,” a cipya hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Te Josef nynh, “Nae phua athang vae ze, nae sahiin hae kha oun pya oh, nae sahiin hae khate looh kha oun rulaekuh oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin nynh mih sahiin hae kha Josef kalan a cciakhae hae; Josef nynh minmin kya-e marang hae, tuu hae, miaa hae, vaetua hae te lann hae khate looh kha a rulaesakuh hae. Tuh-e kum kya Josef nynh mih sahiin balyn khate looh kha a rulaesakuh hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuh-e kum thang zah khuavae he thua tuh, minmin nynh Josef kalan cceih hae zah, “Kae phua kha pong kae mang vae cipaw kae bawipaw namaw kha kae phei kho lan khyh, kae sahiin hae tuh namaw kya-e nynh athua vae. Namaw malang kae pyn te kae laephi laelan tuh pawpaw mah umlae vae khyh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Kaemaw te kae laephi parouhte na muihnaw kya kae chih vae cih tou? Kaemaw te kae laephi hynh looh te oun re. Kaening nynh kae laephi ryte Faro see lang kae tang cih; chi leite kae hiin nawlan te ram hynh ccungccaw adae khyh nawlan ccacii oun pya,” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Josef nynh Faro hanlan Izip ram balyn kha a re. Izip hae nynh myarya ccakancci keiccuze mih loo kha zua hae zah Faro loo lang a tang vae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Josef nynh Izip ram voikheit langte voikheih lang kyacia ccungccaw hae kha see lang a tangsah hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Aning nynh ranpibawi hae laephi kyalya kha nynh rebia khyh; pawccecize minmin tuh Faro kyate tyty a mue hae paw nethungpaw looh te Faro nynh a pya hae paw looh kha nynh a ae hae; tukeiccuze minmin nynh mih laephi kha zua khyh hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Oute Josef nynh ccungccaw hae kha, “Atunin naemaw te nae laephi kha Faro hanlan phe ka re vae, hein kya nanning hanlan ccacii mang um; lawkuh oh lah nae loo kya ccou oh. <verse number="24" style="v" />Te looh na rue vae oh ze pum pangaw pum kheit kha Faro na pya cih oh, pum pangaw pum pali kha nae looh lang a tang cih zah ccacii lang thuasah, naemaw te nae innbyn hae ae lan thuasah, nae ccaaw hae ae lan thuasah na lawkuh cih oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “Kae bawipaw, kae hiinnaw kha nae khum vae; ngaethya oun um sah; Faro see lang kae tang cih,” a ci hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuhcite Josef nynh Izip ram kya upadi ccangkheit a rae, tuh-e upadi tuh Faro nynh pum pangaw pum kheit kha a lawkuh cih cipaw thua zah atunin cia atyn. Ranpibawi hae laephi kyalya nynh Faro laephi lang tang khyh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jakob kyate Rhohui Bya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Israel tuh Izip ram, Goshen pee kya khua a sah; minmin nynh tuin kya a hoirum hae, te myarya lungthung hae zah a pungzae hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Jakob tuh Izip ram kya kum haw lae sari a hiin; tukeiccuze a hiinnaw she tuh za kheit sung pali kum sari acih vae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Israel a chinaw ccyh he anae tuh a ccapaw Josef kha ko zah, “Na malang maehoynaw ka mue zetuh na kuih kha ka phae kaw nung lah lungzite, hmerarih lan bya yn kinpyaku tua; Izip ram kya yn uh nan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47.29-30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:29-32">Gen 49.29-32</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 50:6">50.6</ref></char></note> <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka minpaaw hae kya he ka ihbua te, Izip ram kyate nae cciakhae cih zah mih shawku kyakhe nae uhbua cih,” a cipya. Josef nynh, “Na ho hawte ka la cyih cih,” cite a cipya. <verse number="31" style="v" />Te Israel nynh, “Bya yn kinpakuh,” ci zah Josef nynh bya a kinpyaku. Tukoute Israel tuh a ikhung vawlan lu nungnaw langkhe a bakhung.</para>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jakob nynh Josef Ccaaw hae Hythua Pya hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tukoute Josef kha, “Na paaw dan khyh,” cite a hopya hae. Tukeiccuze a ccapaw hae lu ning Manasseh te Efraim kha ko hae zah a cceih hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />“Na ccapaw Josef tuh na kya yn thua vae,” cite Jakob kha he hopah hae tuh, thawte e-iasawkuh zah ikhung kya a haung. <verse number="3" style="v" />Te Jakob nynh Josef kha, “Athunghuapaw Pachia nynh Kanaan ram Luz khua khe ka kya langkute hythua yn pya zah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48.3-4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:13-14">Gen 28.13-14</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />‘Nang kha kae pungzaesah cih zah kae lungthungsah cih; ccungccaw patae lang kae rae cih, e ram hynh namaw koute na ciihan hae kalan zungzae hanlan ka pya cih hae,’ yn cipya. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tukeiccuze na umnaw Izip ram kae thua maw, Izip ram kya na saah hae paw na ccapaw hae lu ning tuh ka ccapaw hae nynh thua hae; Efraim te Manasseh tuh Reuben te Simeon hawte ka ccapaw hae athua cih hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Minmin koute na saah hae paw tuh na ccaaw hae athua cih hae zah rhoccounaw kya tuh mih upaw hae min kya riabia athua cih hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Kae tuh Paddan ram kyate kae ki lya, Efrath khua kae thua maw taraw, Kanaan ram laanryng khe Rachel tuh a chih; te Efrath khua lang ccianaw laanryng khe Rachel kha ka uu,” (Efrath tuh Bethlehem nynh thua).<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:16-19">Gen 35.16-19</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel nynh Josef ccapaw hae kha he a muih hae tuh, “E hae hynh hum hae mou?” cite khia zah <verse number="9" style="v" />Josef nynh, “Pachia nynh hein kya yn pyapaw ka ccapaw hae nynh thua hae,” a ci. Te Jakob nynh, “Minmin kha kamaw kalan beih yn cciakhae hae, hythua ka pya cih hae,” a ci. <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel tuh a kum tang vae zah a mitmohbia vae keiccuze hoyte ngawmuih kho vae khyh. Tukeiccuze Josef nynh minmin kha amaw kalan a naesaku hae; te Jakob nynh minmin kha myng hae zah a pom hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel nynh Josef kha, “Na mitmae muih lante ka la ngaehoi vae khyh; thuasalama Pachia nynh na ccaaw hae kha mah hein kya yn muihsah vae hae,” a ci. <verse number="12" style="v" />Oute Josef nynh minmin kha a paaw ccukharu kyate a hoei hae, te Josef tuh a paaw malang khe a bakhung. <verse number="13" style="v" />Josef nynh a ccapaw hae kha parouhte cciakhae hae zah, Efraim kha a ranglang kuih khate kyng zah Israel a voilang kuih kalan khe a cciakhae, te Manasseh kha a voilang kuih khate kyng zah Israel a ranglang kuih kalan khe a cciakhae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Thuasalama Israel nynh a ranglang kuih kha avoikekuh lante dyng zah asoi huapaw Efraim a lu vawlan khe a khang, te a voilang kuih kha a tawccaw huapaw Manasseh a lu vawlan khe a khang. <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel nynh Josef kha hythuapya zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Ka minpaaw Abraham te</para>
  <para style="q2">ka paaw Isak kha</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw malang a la cciasah hae paw Pachia,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka hiin lungkhu atunin cia</para>
  <para style="q1">kamaw hanlan tuurintu</para>
  <para style="q2">a thuapaw Pachia,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />vawsawnaw balyn kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">yn khumtupaw vaawpaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">e imua hae kha hythuapya vae hae sah;</para>
  <para style="q2">te ka min, ka minpaaw Abraham min,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka paaw Isak min tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q1">zungzae la tyn vae sah;</para>
  <para style="q2">te laephi vawlan la pungzae vae hae sah,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A paaw Jakob nynh a ranglang kuih kha Efraim lu vawlan a khangpaw kha Josef nynh he a muih tuh a lunghoy khyh; tukeiccuze Josef nynh a paaw kuih kha lah zah Efraim lu kyate Manasseh lu kalan a khang sah. <verse number="18" style="v" />Josef nynh a paaw kha, “Apang, hynhte thua khyh! Hynh-e paw hynh a tawccaw athua keiccuze na ranglang kuih kha hynh-e paw lu vawlan khang,” a cipya. <verse number="19" style="v" />Thuasalama a paaw nynh phe ei zah, “Phang ka nyh, ka ccapaw, mang ka nyh; Manasseh hynh mah a phuin lepaw ccungccaw lang a tang cih. Tuhzemah a neitawpaw tuh amaw laeze a phuin lehuapaw lang a tang cih zah a ciihan tuh minphuin patae lang a tang cih,” a ci. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tukeiccuze tuh-e nin khe minmin kha hythuapya hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“ ‘Pachia nynh nang kha Efraim hawte thuasah, Manasseh hawte thuasah ae rae vae sah,’</para>
  <para style="q1">cite Israel hae nynh naemaw min te hythua a pya cih hae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="m">Tuhcite Jakob nynh Efraim kha Manasseh malang a nung.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:21">Heb 11.21</ref></char></note> <verse number="21" style="v" />Oute Israel nynh Josef kha, “Ka chih vae cih, thuasalama Pachia nynh nanning kha ae umkhae cih oh zah nae minpaaw hae ram lang bua ae cciakhae cih oh. <verse number="22" style="v" />Na upaw hae laeze nang kha alunghua lante kae pyapaw tuh, ka thaloi te ka li te Amor ccungccaw hae kuih kya-e ka lawpaw Shekhem nynh thua,” a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jakob Rhohui Bya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Oute Jakob nynh a ccaaw hae kha ko hae zah: “Oun sueluakuh oh, malang ccyh kya nae tungvaw yn cyihkuh lanpaw kha kae hopah cih oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pou Jakob ccapaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">sueluakuh oh lah thaetua oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">nae paaw Israel bya kha ngaetua oh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Reuben, nang tuh ka ccatawccaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thungnaw, ka thawzung kya-e thaety,</para>
  <para style="q1">sawtua lan um huapaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">huhan a hoi huapaw nynh na thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuhzemah nang tuh vahungtui hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">atyn leipaw na thua keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">byapi huapaw tuh na thua lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize na paaw ikhung—</para>
  <para style="q1">ka iphae vawlan na kae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">na thusah vae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Simeon te Levi tuh uno nynh thua hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih thaloi hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ahoy leipaw zunghe lang a mang hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aphirute khua a khankunaw hae kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">ka teebua lan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin tungkunaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">ka umbua lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize mih thinria vae ze</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw kha theih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">lungpawte taeku nawlan</para>
  <para style="q2">tangnuapaw ccumaria kha a khya hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Myarya lepaw mih thinrianaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">rehahan lan mih bungpawnaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">thyalawnaw um sah,</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin kha Jakob ciihan kya</para>
  <para style="q1">ka phia cih hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel minphuin kya</para>
  <para style="q2">phiariphiarae ka nung cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Judah, na uno hae nynh nang kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ae thehoysah cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">na kuih te na rhaw hae nging kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na kyng cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">na paaw ccapaw hae nynh na malang</para>
  <para style="q2">a bakhung cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka ccapaw Judah!</para>
  <para style="q2">Nang tuh anopaw chindeih nynh na thua;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 24:9">Nam 24.9</ref>; <ref loc="REV 5:5">Bya 5.5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">saw kha na tei zah</para>
  <para style="q2">akarung kalan na ki.</para>
  <para style="q1">Aning tuh chindeih hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">chindeih pinung hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">tharae leih dyngkuh zah a rya,</para>
  <para style="q2">hum nynh mou amaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a laesy ngan cih?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Minhoynaw kha a mue makhia tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">siapharan kawhoinaw ccoi thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccu laku kya-e uktu hoitang thuasah</para>
  <para style="q1">Judah kyate phiakuh lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">te ccungccaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw kaw kha a ngae cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A lann kha misu ku kya khii zah</para>
  <para style="q2">a lann nopaw kha misu ku</para>
  <para style="q2">ahoy huapaw kyakhe a khii,</para>
  <para style="q1">a boeining kha misutui kyakhe suh zah</para>
  <para style="q2">chii hawte asepaw misutui kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">a angkiccuapaw kha a su;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a mit tuh misutui laeze sehua zah</para>
  <para style="q2">a haw tuh mateitui laeze arawhua.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zebulun tuh rili kin kya</para>
  <para style="q2">khua a sah cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw kya-e rili kin tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">sanphalung hae thadynnaw</para>
  <para style="q2">hmin athua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">A ram tuh Sidon khua kyacia</para>
  <para style="q2">athua cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Issakhar tuh a thawsaepaw lann</para>
  <para style="q2">athua cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">a phupaw uccaw tung ning</para>
  <para style="q2">laku khe a rya;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />a haeungnaw hmin tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">hoy zah a umnaw ram tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">lungrythua lan a um cipaw a muih;</para>
  <para style="q2">tukeiccuze phupaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">khangku khylan a raw kha tuakuh zah</para>
  <para style="q1">nangsete ryalawsahpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">see lang a tang.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Dan tuh Israel minphuin hae kyaze</para>
  <para style="q2">phuin kheit hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccungccaw hae kha byapia cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Dan tuh laanpi kin umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">hupaw athua cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">marang a ccikuhpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">nulang a ccaw nawlan</para>
  <para style="q1">marang ccu a tuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">hupaw arepaw athua cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>,</para>
  <para style="q2">na khumnaw kha phang ka ngaw.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Luadetu hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">Gad kha a tuk cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama Gad nynh minmin kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a tukru cih hae zah a dee cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Asher ram kyate athuapaw looh</para>
  <para style="q2">apou cih zah</para>
  <para style="q1">siapharan hanlan angaekuhpaw looh</para>
  <para style="q2">athua cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Naftali tuh a rythyte a paeepaw sazuh,</para>
  <para style="q2">apuithyapaw ccaaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a saahpaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Josef tuh athae te</para>
  <para style="q2">phe beihpaw akaran,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuidy pe umpaw athae te</para>
  <para style="q1">phe beihpaw akaran nynh thua,</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw akaran hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">lungrua vawlan po a lo hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Li a kawthya hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw kha thawte a tuk hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw kha kaw hae zah thawte</para>
  <para style="q2">a naangbia hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuhzemah a li tuh no khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">a zunghe hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">Athungpaw Jakob Pachia</para>
  <para style="q2">kuih te thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Israel Lungpi a thuapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">Tuurinpaw min te thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />nang ae bawmpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">na paaw a Pachia liate thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha hythua ae pya cih paw</para>
  <para style="q2">Athunghuapaw liate thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">raepaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">Tuh-e Pachia nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ahangnaw vaawram e hythuanaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">anenaw umpaw akhupaw tui kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">hythuanaw, matei hythuanaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">vue hythuanaw kha ae pya vae sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na paaw kya-e hythuanaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae tynpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">mua hae kya-e hythuanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae tynpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">mua kya-e ry lan umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">uccaw hae laeze aphutehua;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e hythuanaw tuh Josef lu vawlan,</para>
  <para style="q2">a uno hae kyate</para>
  <para style="q1">phia a thuapaw kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">a terui vawlan um vae sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Benjamin tuh saw leih a teipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">suizaw nynh thua,</para>
  <para style="q1">awkhua kya a teipaw kha a ae,</para>
  <para style="q2">phe a tei vae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">zete ccyh kya phiariphiarae leih a nung,”</para>
  <para style="m">a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />E hae hynh Israel phin haw lae ning nynh thua. E bya hynh mah minmin kha lu raveihte angaekuhpaw hythuanaw kha mih paaw nynh a hopya hae paw bya nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jakob Chinaw te Uunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Oute Jakob nynh, “Ka ccungccaw hae kalan suelua ka thua vae cih, Hit ccungccapaw Efron loo kya umpaw lungkarung kyakhe ka paaw hae ryte nae la uh cih oh. <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuh-e lungkarung tuh Kanaan ram, Mamre te anaekunaw Mekpelah kya umpaw thua zah, Abraham nynh uuku nawlan cite loo ryte Hit ccungccapaw kya-e a repaw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49.30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:3-20">Gen 23.3-20</ref></char></note> <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuin kyakhe Abraham te a zu Sarah kha a uu hae; Isak te a zu Rebekah kha mah a uu hae; te Leah kha mah tuin kya ka uu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49.31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:9-10">Gen 25.9-10</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 35:29">35.29</ref></char></note> <verse number="32" style="v" />Loo te loo lungkhu umpaw lungkarung tuh Hit ccungccaw hae kya-e repaw nynh thua,” cite bya a tawsya hae. <verse number="33" style="v" />Jakob nynh a ccapaw hae kya bya a tawsya hae paw kha he a thangsah te, a ccu kha ikhung kalan khin zah a hy thang vae, te a ccungccaw hae kalan a sueluabua hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49.33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:15">Loc 7.15</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Oute Josef nynh a paaw mae kha bakhungnua zah thawte rah zah a myng. <verse number="2" style="v" />Josef nynh a paaw rhua kha mynkhuhpaw te ccaan khylan a kuihkaw ryalahpaw sibawi hae kha kaw a pya hae. Tukeiccuze sibawi hae nynh Israel kha mynkhuhpaw te ccaan hae zah <verse number="3" style="v" />nin sung pali a rokhaekuh hae, pawccecize tuh-e accyh tuh mynkhuhpaw te ccaan nawlan ahopaw ccyh nynh thua. Te Izip hae tuh Jakob hanlan nin sung sari a rah hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jakob hanlan rawnaw nin he athang te, Josef nynh Faro innbyn hae kyakhe, “Nae kyate maehoynaw ka mue zetuh, Faro kha akawlan thyhte beih la hopah oh: <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka paaw nynh bya yn kinsakuh zah hynhte a ho, ‘Ka chih vae cih. Kanaan ram kya kamaw hanlan ka karynkupaw shawku kya nae la uh cih oh,’ a ci. Tukeiccuze atu ka paaw kha uu khylan ka la cceih sah; te bua kae ki cih,” a cipya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 47:29-31">Gen 47.29-31</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Faro nynh Josef kha, “Na paaw nynh bya ae kinsaku hawte na paaw kha la uh,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Josef tuh a paaw uu lan a cceihthung, amaw ryte Faro see hae balyn, a inn kya ryalah hae paw piccan hae, Izip ram e piccan hae balyn a cceihthung bua hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Josef a innbyn hae, a upaw hae te a paaw innbyn mah a cceihbua hae. Mih ccaaw hae, mih tuu hae, mih miaa hae te mih vaetua hae kyalya kha Goshen kya a cciataw hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Marangle hae te marang rhawkaw hae mah Josef kya a cceihbua hae. Tuh-e phu tuh myarya lepaw phu nynh thua. <verse number="10" style="v" />Jordan nithua lang umpaw ccatan tinnaw hmin Atad kya he a thua hae tuh myarya alepaw te ngaethya lan kou umpaw rawkhuinaw kha a rae hae; Josef tuh a paaw hanlan nin sari rawkhuite a um. <verse number="11" style="v" />Ccatan tinnaw hmin Atad kya-e rawkhuinaw kha tuh-e ram kya umpaw Kanaan hae nynh he a muih hae tuh, “E hynh Izip hae kya-e myarya thinlungcci lan umpaw rawkhuinaw nynh thua,” a ci hae. Tukeiccuze Jordan vaw nithua lang umpaw tuh-e hmin kha Abel-mizraim cite min a phu hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Jakob nynh a tawsya hae hawte a ccapaw hae nynh a cyipya hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Minmin nynh Jakob kha Kanaan ram lang cciakhae hae zah Abraham nynh uuku nawlan cite Hit ccungccapaw Efron kya-e a repaw, Mamre te anaenaw Makpelah loo kya umpaw lungkarung kyakhe a uu hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:16">Loc 7.16</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Josef nynh a paaw kha a uh koute a uno hae te a paaw uu khylan a cceihthung kheih hae paw balyn ryte Izip ram lang a ki hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Josef nynh A Ngaethya hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mih paaw he a chih tuh, Josef a upaw hae nynh, “Josef nynh aening kha palei lung-ung yn la tungpah zah a tungvaw kya ah la cyi oh paw hoyleinaw keiccuze oun liaru lanze pawte athua cih?” a ciku hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin nynh Josef kalan hynhte bya a taw hae: “Na paaw nynh a chi mawze bya oun tawsya zah, <verse number="17" style="v" />‘Josef kha hynhte la hopah oh: Na upaw hae nynh seinaw a rae hae paw te na tungvaw vawsawnaw pyate a sei hae paw kha beih la ngaethya hae cite kae ngia,’ cite yn hopya. Tukeiccuze na paaw a Pachia see hae nynh seinaw kae la raepaw kha beih oun ngaethya,” a cipya hae. Minmin nynh tuhte he a ho hae tuh Josef tuh a rah. <verse number="18" style="v" />Oute a upaw hae mah a rah hae, te Josef malang bakhung hae zah, “Kaening tuh na see hae nynh kae thua,” a cipya hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Thuasalama Josef nynh, “Rih nan oh, kae tuh Pachia umnaw kya zawtou ka um? <verse number="20" style="v" />Nanning nynh ka tungvaw vawsawnaw pya lan na la tuaku oh zemah Pachia nynh khah-e kha ahoypaw lante paccyn zah, atunin acyiku vae hawte ccungccaw patae kha khum khylan a la paccyn. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tukeiccuze rih nan oh, naemaw te nae ccaaw hae kha kamaw ccaccei nynh kae bawm cih oh,” a cipya hae. Tuhcite minmin kha lungtangnaw pya hae zah nebaleih lante a hopya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Josef Chinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Josef tuh a paaw innbyn hae ryte Izip ram kya um zah za kheit kum haw a hiin. <verse number="23" style="v" />Josef tuh Efraim ccaaw hae te Efraim mintaw hae kha a muihsya ung hae; Manasseh ccapaw Makhir ccaaw hae kha mah Josef nynh a innbyn kya a umsah bua hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Oute Josef nynh a uno hae kha, “Ka chih vae cih, thuasalama Pachia tuh nanning kalan yn thua ccaccing cih zah Abraham, Isak te Jakob kya bya a kinkupaw ram langkhe e ram kyate ae cciakhae thung cih oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Te Josef nynh Israel ccapaw hae kha, “Nae kalan Pachia he yn thua te, ka ru kha e kyate nae la cciakhae thung cih oh,” cite hopah hae zah bya a kinsaku hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50.25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:19">Exo 13.19</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Jos 24.32</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:22">Heb 11.22</ref></char></note> <verse number="26" style="v" />Te Josef tuh za kheit kum haw acih te a chih, mynkhuhpaw kha thuh hae zah Izip ram kya thingkua lungkhu khe a nung hae.</para>
</usx>